window.FWN_PRODIGIOUSLY_AMAZING_WEAPONSMITH_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_PRODIGIOUSLY_AMAZING_WEAPONSMITH_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":3901,"title":"Chapter 3901 Too Big A Blow (1)","paragraphs":["3901 Too Big A Blow (1)","Huang Yueli glanced at her indifferently, “Thank you, Young Miss Zijun, for reminding me.”","After finishing speaking, she turned her gaze back to the stone tablet again, and ignored Li Zijun again.","Li Zijun was so angry that she glared at Huang Yueli, at the same time wondering why she was so calm.","Did she really think that Liu Buyan’s strength was good enough to beat the geniuses of the Cloudy Qilin Clan?","!!","What a frog in a well, she didn’t know where her confidence came from!","The strength of the genius cultivators of the Ancient God Clan was beyond the imagination of these wastes of the human race. The two were completely incomparable!","“Hmph, just wait and see then!”","Huang Yueli didn’t listen to what Li Zijun and the cultivators around her said.","She was really concerned about Liu Buyan’s situation, but she was not worried that Liu Buyan’s points being too low.","It doesn’t matter to her whether Liu Buyan’s score was high or not. She was just curious about Liu Buyan’s current strength.","Ever since she ascended to the God Realm, she has never seen Liu Buyan make a move!","Li Zijun said a few more irritating sarcastic remarks, seeing Huang Yueli ignoring her, she soon lost interest and finally calmed down.","Both of them stared at the front of the stone tablet, waiting for the points to appear.","Not long after, “One” was displayed on the stone tablet.","Immediately afterwards, the number on the stone tablet began to climb up one after another, and soon reached the level of fifty.","Huang Yueli blinked her big eyes, and was a little surprised when she saw the numbers jumping rapidly.","Liu Buyan’s current cultivation was only at the early stage of the Dream Profound Realm. Even after entering the Illusion Array, under the influence of the array, he has temporarily reached the late stage of the Dream Profound Realm, but there was still a difference from the genuine late Dream Profound Realm.","For Liu Buyan, this was a leapfrog battle.","To be able to gain points so fast was already considered very fast.","It seems that her Senior Brother has indeed put in a lot of effort in cultivation recently.","A look of doubt appeared in Huang Yueli’s eyes.","Seeing this, Li Zijun said coldly from the side: “Previously, the spirit beasts that appeared in the Illusion Array were only the lowest-level spirit beasts. After gaining fifty points in a row, spirit beasts in the middle stage of the Profound Realm will appear, and they are still in groups. It seems that Divine Doctor Liu won’t last long...”","Li Zijun raised her chin confidently.","She had seen Liu Buyan’s trial with her own eyes just now, and she thought she knew his strength very well.","Based on Liu Buyan’s previous performance, it can be regarded as a rapid progress if the score exceeds 100 this time, and it was impossible to get higher!","However, before Li Zijun finished speaking, she heard several gasps from behind.","She was a little surprised, and glanced at the follower behind her. Just as she was about to ask a question, she saw the numbers on the stone tablet suddenly start jumping up quickly.","60... 70.. 80...","The points increase rapidly at intervals of ten.","In just a few breaths, it exceeded one hundred!","Li Zijun thought she was seeing things!","However, when she rubbed her eyes hard and looked in the direction of the stone tablet again, the points had already soared to two hundred!","“This... this... how is this possible??”","Li Zijun’s eyeballs almost fell to the ground.","However, the more surprising thing was yet to come.","Before Li Zijun digested all that happened before her, Liu Buyan’s points broke through 205 all the way.","Follower No. 2, who was complacent before, had a pale face now."]},{"number":3902,"title":"Chapter 3902 Too Big A Blow (2)","paragraphs":["3902 Too Big A Blow (2)","He came in with Li Zijun this time because he wanted to help Li Zijun suppress Liu Buyan and his Junior Sister, and also took this opportunity to show his face in front of Young Miss Zijun who was ranked high in the clan.","In the beginning, being able to get a high score of 205 and break through his personal best result still made him very excited. He felt that he could finally make a splash this time.","But who knows...","It didn’t take long for him to be happy that this result was surpassed by a cultivator who was only at the early stage of the Dream Profound Realm?","Follower No. 2 and Li Zijun couldn’t believe that such a thing would happen.","!!","The two of them stared fixedly at the stone tablet with their four eyes, wishing they could stare a hole out of the stone tablet!","It’s a pity that no matter how hard they looked at it, they couldn’t change the reality.","Liu Buyan’s score soon exceeded 300, 400, and even... 500!","It wasn’t until around 650 that the rate of increase began to slow down.","Seeing this, Huang Yueli secretly breathed a sigh of relief, “It seems that Senior Brother has really gained a lot from comprehending in the tower this time. Moreover, his talent in combat is really good. To have this score, he’s one of the best among the Cloudy Qilin Clan. Among the geniuses, they are all ranked high...”","She muttered to herself, her voice was so low that even Li Zijun who was not far away couldn’t hear her.","However, as soon as she finished speaking, she heard a cold snort from behind.","Huang Yueli was taken aback, she turned her head abruptly, and saw Li Moying looking down at her with a rather arrogant expression on her face.","Seeing her looking over, Li Moying snorted coldly, “Not even getting a fraction of my points, what’s there to see?”","Huang Yueli stared at his tight jaw line for a while, then chuckled.","This little girl was still laughing! Was she so concerned about that guy Liu Buyan?","Huang Yueli saw his displeased face as if he was going to explode at any time, so she hurried over to appease him, “Alright, Senior Brother is far behind you! Only you are the most powerful genius in my heart!”","“Hmph, you’d better remember whose woman you are.” Li Moying grabbed Huang Yueli’s slender waist and was about to take her into his arms. At the same time, he leaned close to her ear and whispered angrily, “You only just need to pay attention to your husband’s points, other men are weak and there’s nothing to look at.”","Huang Yueli twitched the corners of her mouth, she didn’t know what to say for a moment.","Her husband was also too narcissistic, too domineering, right?","However, what he said was the truth, making it impossible to refute...","Li Moying stared at her, his mesmerising eyes looking back at her which made Huang Yueli’s legs go weak for a while.","This...was this too foul?","Why did this man have to be so good-looking?","Li Zijun looked at the two people looking at each other affectionately from a close distance, and her complexion changed for the worst...","Just then, there was a “plop”.","A silver light flashed suddenly, and then, a tall figure slammed into the ground.","“I...pfft... bleh bleh bleh—!!”","Liu Buyan ate his mouth full of mud again, and got up from the ground in embarrassment.","He leaned on his waist, his face filled with righteous indignation, “The spirit beasts of your Cloudy Qilin Clan are too cunning, too bullying! Just like someone! They actually sneaked up from behind!”","Huang Yueli glanced behind him subconsciously, and saw a very distinct hoof print on Liu Buyan’s butt, which seemed to be kicked to death by a spirit beast like a horse.","“Brother Liu is really different. It’s rare to see such a fresh and refined way of dying in our Cloudy Qilin Clan!”"]},{"number":3903,"title":"Chapter 3903 Too Big A Blow (3)","paragraphs":["3903 Too Big A Blow (3)","Li Moying, who was at the side, hummed softly, and spoke coldly.","Huang Yueli couldn’t help but roll her eyes at him.","No matter what time, he still provoked her Senior Brother!","Sure enough, upon hearing Li Moying’s words, Liu Buyan’s face turned red all of a sudden, “Are you looking for death? Do you want to experience a fresh and refined way of dying?”","Li Moying’s expression did not change at all, “I think, unfortunately, the person who can kill me has never appeared so far.”","Liu Buyan was about to curse but he forcibly held back.","He quickly gave Huang Yueli a disgusted look, and the meaning was very clear: This narcissist belongs to you, right? Take him back, take him back now! I really can’t stand it anymore!","Huang Yueli pursed her lips and smiled, “Senior Brother, you scored more than 700 points in the Illusion Array, I really have to congratulate you!”","Hearing this, Liu Buyan’s attention was immediately diverted.","“What? I actually have more than 700 points? Hahahaha, I just said that I must be a genius!”","Liu Buyan excitedly ran to the side of the stone tablet to appreciate his score.","At this moment, the onlookers, who were chattering non-stop, were surprisingly quiet.","None of them thought that Liu Buyan, a Spirit Medicine Master, surpassed most of them!","Seven hundred and twenty-six points.","This score ranks among the top ten among the younger generation of Cloudy Qilin Clan.","Although he does not have the status of Li Zijun, he would definitely be the focus of training in the clan.","If lucky, he might even have the opportunity to become the elder of the clan in the future!","These people, they just open their eyes every day to cultivate. After so many years, they are still not as good as a Spirit Medicine Master!","This blow was really huge!","Liu Buyan was also very satisfied after seeing his scores.","Liu Buyan turned to Li Zijun, who had a livid face, “How is it? Young Miss Zijun? As I said earlier, my score will definitely be much higher than 205?”","Li Zijun felt her chest tighten and she almost vomited out a mouthful of blood!","As soon as Liu Buyan opened his mouth, he scolded them 205!","However, Liu Buyan was very skillful in speaking. If he really wants to be serious, he will definitely say that they think too much.","Moreover, Li Zijun can’t care about such a trivial matter anymore. Her mind was still buzzing now. She never thought that such a situation would happen!","“Ha ha ha, Wow! Divine Doctor Liu, you really hid very well. I didn’t expect that you are not only amazingly talented in medicine, but also so good in martial arts...” Li Zijun could only laugh a few times, wanting to bring this matter to the past.","However, who was Liu Buyan? How could he let her gloss over this so easily?","He smiled and said, “My score was higher than the two people who got off just now on your side! How about it? If no one else from your side is participating then it means that we have won the bet, right?”","After hearing this, Li Zijun was shocked, and suddenly remembered that there was still a bet between her and Huang Yueli!","Originally, she wanted to make Huang Yueli and Liu Buyan feel ashamed, but what happened? Liu Buyan’s martial arts talent was so high!","Li Zijun now suspects that when Liu Buyan entered the Illusion Array, he fared badly intentionally because he made an appointment with his Junior Sister and was playing tricks on her!","Otherwise, how could his strength improve by leaps and bounds within a few days?"]},{"number":3904,"title":"Chapter 3904 Too Big A Blow (4)","paragraphs":["3904 Too Big A Blow (4)","The only explanation can only be that they had this planned from the very beginning!","Let Liu Buyan deliberately show weakness first, and let Li Zijun misunderstand that he was weak.","In this way, he can fight in place of his Junior Sister without arousing any suspicion.","Things had already come to this point and in fact, Huang Yueli has already won the bet.","Because, the content of their bet at the beginning was that as long as Huang Yueli’s points could surpass any cultivator from the Cloudy Qilin Clan, she would be considered a winner.","However, Li Zijun didn’t intend to admit defeat just like that.","Otherwise, she could be said to have fallen to the bottom today. If word spread, she would be ridiculed by those vixens who wanted to climb into the Young Master’s bed!","However, there was no one else on the scene who could score higher points than Liu Buyan.","Originally, Li Zijun had prepared Followers No. 3 and No. 4, both of whom were geniuses who could score three to four hundred points in the Illusion Array.","But now, all of them are useless.","Li Zijun gritted her teeth hard, “Wait, who said you won? I haven’t entered the Illusion Array myself! Although it’s really not easy for you to get more than 700 points, but the genius of our Cloudy Qilin Clan Stronger! I’ll let you see and see!”","After speaking, she didn’t say much, and walked straight towards the Illusion Array.","She acted so decisively because she was afraid that Huang Yueli and Liu Buyan would react and realise that they had already won.","In this way, she would not be able to force Huang Yueli to end.","Huang Yueli secretly raised her eyebrows as she watched her leaving in a hurry.","Can she not know Li Zijun’s mind?","It’s just that, in her opinion, it’s very ridiculous!","If Li Zijun admits her mistake and stops, at least she won’t have to suffer a bigger blow...","It’s a pity that Li Zijun never dreamed that the seemingly delicate and harmless girl next to Li Moying was actually a peerless genius who really hid her identity very deeply!","After Li Zijun entered the Illusion Array, the number on the stone tablet was reset to zero, and then began to climb rapidly.","Li Zijun was worthy of being one of the best heaven-level geniuses in the Cloudy Qilin Clan, and her fighting skills are obviously outstanding.","This point can be known by looking at the admiration expressions on the faces of the cultivators onlookers.","It didn’t take long for Li Zijun’s score to surpass Liu Buyan’s score of 726 points. Moreover, the rate of increase showed no signs of slowing down, and it was still rising all the way.","Soon, they broke through the previous threshold again.","“One thousand points! One thousand points! Young Miss Zijun is really amazing!”","“Young Miss Zijun has scored more than 1,000 points before, but she couldn’t hold on for a long time after getting 1,000 points last time, so she had to give up.”","“She came prepared this time! It took less than a quarter of an hour to get to 1,000 points, and it looks like she still has plenty of energy! It will definitely be much higher than last time.”","“I don’t know how many points she can reach this time?”","The cultivators watching were all excited.","For them, the most exciting thing was to see the top talent in the clan beat their own records.","Although Li Zijun’s record was so insignificant compared to Li Moying’s, he hasn’t entered the Illusion Array for nearly a year since leaving that incomparably shocking record. .","If one wants to see him make a move, one would probably have no chance.","It’s good to be able to see Li Zijun’s with their own eyes, creating a new record of her own."]},{"number":3905,"title":"Chapter 3905 Too Big A Blow (5)","paragraphs":["3905 Too Big A Blow (5)","And Li Zijun did not disappoint them.","After her points exceeded a thousand points. Still going up.","One thousand and one...","One thousand two...","One thousand three...","The exclamations of the cultivators onlookers never stopped, and they were all full of admiration for Li Zijun’s performance.","Liu Buyan listened, and couldn’t help but let out a ‘tch’, feeling a little unwilling.","When he was in Soaring Heavens Continent, he was also a first-class peerless genius, but after arriving in the God Realm, he couldn’t compare to Li Zijun, a white lotus who was trying to hook up with his Junior Sister’s husband.","Seeing this, Li Moying glanced at him, and stated in a very flat tone: “Li Zijun is still ten years younger than you.”","Liu Buyan turned around and glared at him angrily, “Aren’t you usually very cold, can’t hold back a fart every three sentences? Why are you talking so much today? Even if you see that something’s broken, don’t say it, don’t you have manners?”","Li Moying didn’t seem to feel his anger at all, and continued, “Even if I don’t say it, it doesn’t mean that the facts don’t exist...”","“You–!”","Seeing that the two were about to quarrel again, Huang Yueli shook her head helplessly, so she had no choice but to jump out to smooth things over.","“Alright, alright, you guys are the ones who talk too much! Have you forgotten that I am still betting with Li Zijun? Look, her points have not increased, and she will probably come out soon!”","The two men snorted at the same time, looked at each other with disgust, and then turned their gazes to the stone tablet again.","Just like what Huang Yueli said, the number on the stone tablet stayed at 1403 points, and it hadn’t increased for a while.","Everyone stared at this number without blinking. After a while, the points jumped up by one number.","Immediately afterwards, a silver light suddenly appeared.","Li Zijun’s figure appeared in front of everyone.","Although she didn’t fall so embarrassingly like Liu Buyan, she still looked disheartened, and it looked like she had completely consumed all the profound energy in her body.","However, Li Zijun was worthy of being one of the best geniuses in the Cloudy Qilin Clan. Although she was exhausted at this time, he still stood there tenaciously.","She glanced at her final score, and listened to the various praises coming from all around, with an unstoppable smile on her face.","“Hehe, Divine Doctor Li, thanks to you today, I performed extraordinarily! Over 1,400 points, this is the first time I have reached such a high score! If I hadn’t made a bet with you, I might not have been able to break through so quickly. Thank you so much!”","Li Zijun expressed her gratitude to Huang Yueli with a very sincere look.","However, anyone could tell that her words were full of complacency.","Gratitude was false, it was true to use these few words to stimulate Huang Yueli!","However, she was also fully qualified to say such things!","After all, Li Zijun’s score today has even surpassed Li Leyun, the Patriarch’s niece, and she has become the second only to Li Moying among the younger disciples of the Cloudy Qilin Clan.","The cultivators present had already recovered from the initial shock, and all turned their gazes to Huang Yueli.","Ordinary people must be very anxious when they see their opponents get such high scores.","However, there was no panic on Huang Yueli’s face.","She smiled slightly, nodded and said, “Young Miss Zijun is too polite. I am very happy for you if you can make a breakthrough.”"]},{"number":3906,"title":"Chapter 3906 Too Big A Blow (6)","paragraphs":["3906 Too Big A Blow (6)","When Huang Yueli said this, she had a dignified and generous smile.","It’s completely the boldness and assertiveness that a powerful Madame should have.","Li Zijun never expected that she would have such a reaction. After being stunned for a while, her expression suddenly became ugly.","What did the damn girl mean by saying these words?","Did she really think that she had married the Young Master and became the Young Madame of the Cloudy Qilin Clan?","That kind of condescending attitude, as if she is just a young genius under her command, and her own strength was much higher!","If Li Moying or the elders of the Cloudy Qilin Clan said these words, Li Zijun would definitely be very happy, feeling that she was affirmed by the strong.","But now, the speaker was replaced by Huang Yueli...","This made her feel uncomfortable no matter what!","Li Zijun gritted her teeth, wishing that she could tear Huang Yueli apart!","However, she couldn’t find fault with Huang Yueli now.","After all, she was congratulating her and even said good things.","Could she say that her tone was wrong?","The tone of voice is purely a personal perception, and the other party can completely deny it.","In desperation, Li Zijun could only force himself to suppress her anger, and abruptly changed the subject, “Alright, all the cultivators on my side have entered the Illusion Array, so now... should it be the turn of Divine Doctor Li? Will you be participating in it personally?”","“Oh? Is it my turn?” Huang Yueli blinked her eyes.","Li Zijun nodded and said: “That’s right, my points have surpassed Divine Doctor Liu, if you don’t want to enter, then you will lose this bet!”","When Huang Yueli heard the words, the corners of her mouth rose slightly, and she smiled.","She has a beautiful appearance, and her sweet smile immediately caught the attention of young cultivators.","“Isn’t this a bit wrong? When we made a bet before, we clearly agreed that as long as I can surpass any cultivator who is qualified to enter the training ground, I will win. I didn’t say that I must surpass you?”","She rushed into the illusory figure formation just now because she was afraid that Huang Yueli would think of this.","Otherwise, she would not be willing to enter the Illusion Array before Huang Yueli and lower her self-worth.","But who knows, she tried all her tricks, but in the end she still couldn’t fool that damn girl!","Thinking of this, Li Zijun was depressed for a while, but she quickly thought of a new reason, “Divine Doctor Li, did you remember wrongly? When we made a bet earlier, your Senior Brother could not replace you to participate in the competition. His high points can only prove that he is qualified to enter the training ground, not yours.”","Huang Yueli had no expression on her face, “Oh? Did you say that? But, if that’s the case, why didn’t you tell me before my Senior Brother entered the Illusion Array? Now that the competition is almost over, you just use these reasons to talk about it? ”","Li Zijun pursed her lips guiltily.","At that time, she wanted Liu Buyan to make a fool of himself.","In this way, it will be more obvious how shameless this pair of brothers and sisters is for occupying the resources of the Cloudy Qilin Clan!","Unfortunately, it was self-defeating just now.","Who would have thought that Liu Buyan could get such a high score, which was completely different from his initial score!","I don’t know if he deliberately concealed his strength at the beginning.","However, there will definitely not be two special cases like Liu Buyan at the same time.","That damn girl looks very weak at first glance. After entering the Illusion Array, she might die within a few breaths."]},{"number":3907,"title":"Chapter 3907 Too Big A Blow (7)","paragraphs":["3907 Too Big A Blow (7)","She had waited for so long, just to see with her own eyes how miserable that damn girl was, and she absolutely couldn’t just give up like this!","Thinking of this, Li Zijun spoke again, “I just forgot it for a moment, but now it came back to me. Anyway, rules are rules, do you still want to deny it?”","The surrounding cultivators looked at each other, and felt that what Li Zijun said was too shameless.","It’s really rare to talk back and speak so confidently in such an embarrassing situation!","Li Zijun also noticed the strange gazes of the cultivators around her, which embarrassed her who had always kept a good face.","However, she had already made up her mind that this time, even if she risked shaming herself, she would drag that damn girl into the water with her. If Huang Yueli insisted on reneging on her debt, she would also stalk her and force her to enter the Illusion Array.","But who knows, Huang Yueli did not follow her routine at all.","Hearing Li Zijun’s shameless remarks, she actually nodded her head with a very understanding expression.","“Well, what Young Miss Zijun said is very true. A person who turns one back on what one says will indeed make people look down upon that person. No matter how talented or powerful one is, one’s character will still be despised. Moying, am I right?”","Her big watery eyes sparkled as she looked at the man beside her.","Li Moying had been staring at his little fox all the time, without averting his gaze. Seeing her looking at him in such a coy manner, he nodded quickly, “Well, whatever my wife says is right.”","Huang Yueli smiled so sweetly that even her little canine teeth were exposed.","Li Zijun was so angry at Huang Yueli’s implicitly sarcastic words that she felt her chest tighten, and then seeing her showing affection with the Young Master, ahe almost vomited blood!","The Young Master actually allowed her calling him by his first name, and even proclaimed that she was his wife!","Why?","Li Zijun’s face turned green.","However, Huang Yueli didn’t seem to see her ugly expression and smiled very softly, “Well, since Moying also said so, then I have to keep my promise. I will go to the Illusion Array to try it myself. ”","Li Moying raised his eyebrows in surprise, “Are you planning to go in now?”","Huang Yueli nodded obediently, “That’s right, I have to enter the Illusion Array in front of everyone to prove my strength. Otherwise, it’s fine for me to be ridiculed, how can I let people talk about you? Don’t worry, I will be careful and there will be no problem.”","Li Moying looked at his little fox who still had a smile on her face.","The reason he finds it strange is...","Just as the two were talking in a low voice, suddenly, a golden light flashed across the crowd.","This kind of light was very familiar to all the cultivators present.","It was the light emitted by the teleportation array when someone was teleported out due to insufficient training time.","Everyone was no longer surprised.","“Hey, who was this? It’s so unlucky? I’m about to see Divine Doctor Li enter the Illusion Array, and this good show is about to reach its climax, and this person doesn’t have enough time? Hahahaha, isn’t it too funny?”","“It’s really too unlucky! Divine Doctor Li’s cultivation base is not high and she looks so delicate. She probably won’t be able to stay in the illusion for a long time, at most a dozen breaths, and this person doesn’t have enough time! It’s too miserable, really. It’s too miserable!”","“I don’t know which guy was so unlucky? This joke was enough for me to laugh for a year!”","Everyone looked around, trying to see who this unlucky person was."]},{"number":3908,"title":"Chapter 3908 Too Big A Blow (8)","paragraphs":["3908 Too Big A Blow (8)","As a result, they looked left and right for a long time, but found that none of their companions were missing.","“Huh? What’s going on? Why don’t you feel that there are no fewer people?”","“Isn’t this too strange? Don’t tell me there’s something wrong with the teleportation array?”","Just as the onlookers were puzzled, several of Li Zijun’s followers were already pale.","No one saw it more clearly than them. The person who disappeared from the golden light just now was none other than Li Zijun who brought them in!","No one expected that Li Zijun’s training time would suddenly run out at this juncture.","At this moment, the cultivators who were spectating this entire farce also reacted.","All of a sudden, various voices of discussion emerged, and the scene was once very chaotic.","Huang Yueli couldn’t hold back, and laughed out loud.","In order to wait for her to come out and see her make a fool of herself, Li Zijun waited for a full sixty hours.","During the incomparably precious sixty hours of experience time, she didn’t enter the tower to study, nor did she enter the Illusion Array trial, she just waited there.","After finally waiting for this moment, she herself was teleported out?","Huang Yueli asked herself, if she was standing in Li Zijun’s position, she would probably faint from anger, right?","Li Moying looked at his little fox’s sly smile, shook his head, and playled with her hair.","“You’ve got it all figured out, haven’t you?”","Huang Yueli blinked her big eyes with an innocent face, “Honey, what are you talking about? Why can’t I understand anything?”","Li Moying shook her head helplessly, “Alright, aren’t you going to enter the Illusion Array? Can you enter now? Do I need to tell you about the fighting characteristics of spirit beasts in the Illusion Array?”","Huang Yueli said with a smile: “No, no! I don’t need you to open the back door for me! I’ve been in the tower for five days, and my hands are already itchy. Alright, then I’ll head off now !”","“Yeah.” Li Moying nodded, watching his wife’s figure disappear into the Illusion Array.","...","She just felt a blur in front of her eyes, and when she opened her eyes again, the cultivators around her were gone, as were the Illusion Array and the tower.","“What... what’s the situation?”","“Young Miss Zijun, have you come out? You must have gained a lot after practicing in the training grounds for so long this time?”","The guards’ concerned voices came from behind her.","Li Zijun suddenly turned her head and saw the faces of those guards. She snapped awake from her stupor and realised what happened just now.","She actually... was teleported out just like that!","Her training time has ended!","How so? How could it be such a coincidence?","The opportunity she has been waiting for for sixty hours was now in front of her eyes, but now? She couldn’t even see it with her own eyes!","“Young Miss Zijun? What’s wrong with you? Are you too tired?” The guards looked at each other, all worried.","This Young Miss Li Zijun was one of the top-ranked geniuses of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, and one of the cultivators who are most likely to get a good ranking in the God Realm’s Grand Meet. She was very important to the clan.","It would be extremely bad if something happened to her while she was cultivating in the training place.","Li Zijun lowered her head and remained silent.","The guards were thinking about whether to step forward to help when suddenly, Li Zijun rushed over and wanted to go behind them."]},{"number":3909,"title":"Chapter 3909 Their Relationship (1)","paragraphs":["3909 Their Relationship (1)","The guards never expected that Li Zijun would have such a reaction, and they were caught off guard and passed through the crowd.","Without looking back, Li Zijun rushed towards the training place.","The guards realised it at this moment, and they didn’t bother to be surprised, and hurriedly chased after her.","Their duty was to guard the place of experience and not allow those unauthorised to enter it.","Even if that person was Li Zijun, she didn’t have the right.","However, Li Zijun was one of the most talented young cultivators in the clan after all, and her speed was much faster than them. Although the guards tried their best to catch up, they still couldn’t catch up with her.","Seeing that Li Zijun was about to pass through the defensive array in front, the guards were all anxious.","“Young Miss Zijun, Young Miss Zijun! Stop quickly, you can’t go ahead!”","“What’s wrong with you? What happened??”","“Young Miss Zijun, no matter what happens, you can’t rush around like this, please stop first...”","The guards shouted in unison.","They couldn’t figure out why Li Zijun, a talented cultivator known for her calmness and prudence, behaved so abnormally today!","Even when all the training time had been exhausted, she rushed in without hesitation.","Even the children in the clan know that this will not work.","What on earth was she so anxious about? Even if she feels that she doesn’t have enough time to cultivate, she can still find a solution with the Patriarch. Why do such inexplicable stupid things?","However, under Huang Yueli’s repeated tossing, Li Zijun had lost her basic sense of reason.","The only thought in her heart was that she must see Huang Yueli’s embarrassing appearance with her own eyes!","And this process must be very short, it may be over in a few breaths, if she doesn’t rush in quickly, she won’t be able to see anything, and the sixty hours of waiting will be in vain!","Li Zijun’s head felt hot for a while, and she didn’t think about anything else at all.","Seeing that the soaring towers were hidden in the clouds, she rushed over immediately.","“Young Miss Zijun——!”","Amidst the exclamation of the guards, a burst of golden light suddenly burst out among the clouds!","All of a sudden, the entire back mountain shook, and the ground kept shaking, as if it was about to be torn apart from the middle!","Following the loud noise, Li Zijun’s body was thrown out like a kite that had been cut.","All the guards changed their expressions in unison!","As members of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, they have all heard that there are defensive arrays handed down from ancient times around the training ground. If someone tries to force their way in, it will trigger a violent backlash.","However, since they were born, they have never heard of anyone who dared to break in casually, so they don’t know how powerful this defensive array was.","Today, thanks to Li Zijun, they have seen it.","Fortunately, they were quite far away. Although many people fell to the ground and fell to the ground, no one was seriously injured.","But Li Zijun will be miserable.","Under the defensive array, Li Zijun’s cultivation level was not enough and with that powerful rebound, she spat out a mouthful of blood in the air and her body was sent flying in an unnatural arc and she was falling towards the mountain..."]},{"number":3910,"title":"Chapter 3910 Their Relationship (2)","paragraphs":["3910 Their Relationship (2)","At this moment, the guards’ hearts were raised in their throats, and they were all extremely nervous.","Although they had absolutely no idea why Li Zijun insisted on going to the place of experience, but she still had a special identity. She was one of the top geniuses in the clan, which was very important to the clan.","She was falling and if she was seriously injured and her performance in the God Realm’s Grand Meet was affected, then these guards would also be blamed.","However, under the current situation, it was out of their own abilities to save her...","Just at this critical moment, a loud shout suddenly came from not far away.","“What’s going on? Who trespassed on the training ground??”","Immediately afterwards, two figures suddenly jumped up from the bottom of the mountain, and a powerful force burst out, just in time to catch up with the rebounding force of the defensive array.","Under the collision of the two forces, there was a deafening crackling sound.","However, the profound strength itself also cancelled out a lot.","The speed at which Li Zijun fell out became significantly slower.","One of the figures jumped up immediately and caught Li Zijun, which saved her from being seriously injured.","This change happened so fast that the guards didn’t even react.","When they came back to their senses, they saw two familiar figures appear in front of them, and they were so frightened that they quickly knelt down on the ground.","“Pa... Patriarch! Elder Qingsong! Subordinate... Subordinate...”","The Captain of the guards stuttered and couldn’t finish his sentence.","Li Shihong’s face was very ugly, “What’s going on? What happened just now? Why was the defensive array in the training place touched?”","The Captain of the guards froze, and quickly calmed himself down, explaining: “Patriarch... the Patriarch, subordinates... don’t know what’s going on. Young Miss Zijun was teleported from the place of experience not too long ago and before I had time to say a word to her, she turned around and rushed towards the place of experience! This subordinate...the subordinate couldn’t react in time, and couldn’t catch up with Young Miss Zijun. Later, Young Miss Zijun triggered the defensive array...”","He spoke intermittently, but the meaning was still very clear.","Li Shihong frowned, and turned his gaze to Li Zijun.","Due to the timely rescue, Li Zijun was not seriously injured, but at that moment just now, she was shocked by the defensive array, which still hurt her meridians.","However, she also realized that something was wrong, so she quickly supported a big tree beside her to stand firm, lowered her head, and looked at the ground.","“Patriarch...”","“What the hell is going on? Zijun, did you really do this? How is it possible? You have always been the most brilliant genius among our clan. You are usually calm and composed, and even Leyun was not as good as you. How could you do such a thing?” Li Shihong couldn’t believe such a thing would happen.","After Li Leyun was sent away, Li Shihong was most optimistic about Li Zijun.","Although he felt that her strength was a little weaker than his niece, her stability beyond her age was the most reassuring.","Even if Li Moying can’t be tempted, at least it won’t cause trouble!","But who knows, it didn’t take long before Li Zijun caused such trouble!","Although the consequences of touching the defensive array of the training place was not too serious, this kind of mistake would not be made by the most ordinary clansmen of the Cloudy Qilin Clan!","Li Leyun lowered her head, gritted her teeth, and didn’t know how to answer for a moment."]},{"number":3911,"title":"Chapter 3911 Their Relationship (3)","paragraphs":["3911 Their Relationship (3)","She just felt that she had to rush to the training grounds, because the matter was very urgent.","However, Li Zijun also knows that such a reason was simply too whimsical for Li Shihong!","Moreover, she couldn’t tell Li Shihong directly about the bet she made with Huang Yueli.","Li Leyun’s thoughts were spinning rapidly in her mind, and she was so entangled that she wanted to come up with a suitable reason to prevaricate.","But the more impatient she was, the more she couldn’t think properly.","!!","At the moment of the stalemate, there was another sound of footsteps on the trail behind the mountain, as if someone was coming up the mountain again.","One of them immediately said, “Patriarch, did something happen to the training ground just now? Why was the defensive array touched?”","Li Shihong snorted coldly, “I was just going to ask Li Zijun about this!”","Li Yuntao looked at Li Shihong, and then at Li Zijun, who was very anxious, full of suspicion.","He hesitated for a moment, but he still asked the question he wanted to ask more, “Patriarch, what is the situation in the training ground now? I heard that many of our clansmen are dissatisfied with Divine Doctor Liu and Divine Doctor Li, and want to go in and bet with them to see how long they can stay in the Illusion Array. It can’t be ...can’t be that the two sides are fighting, can it? What happened?”","Li Shihong’s face was ashen, before he continued: “The trigger just now was that Li Zijun touched the defensive array, not something that went wrong in the training ground. But you reminded me, I don’t know what’s going on inside now, let’s hurry up and go in to have a look!”","Li Zijun listened from the side, and opened her mouth wide in surprise.","She felt a little strange just now, why Li Shihong and Li Qingsong suddenly appeared in the back mountain, near the training grounds, just in time to save her.","Normally, they wouldn’t come here if they had nothing to do.","Now it seems that it should be about her bet with that damn girl, and somehow the news got out.","Li Shihong and the others were worried that the two Divine Doctors were not strong enough and that something would happen in the bet, so they rushed over to stop them...","Thinking of this, Li Zijun was startled, and couldn’t help but shrink back, hoping that she could disappear in front of Li Shihong and others immediately.","Previously, she did not expect that Huang Yueli would stay in the tower for so long, so her followers came in and out, changing several groups of people.","When there are too many people, it was inevitable that news will leak out. It was not too strange for Li Shihong and the others to know.","Fortunately, Li Shihong and the elders don’t seem to know that she was the instigator of the bet!","However, there was no other way to get rid of this matter now...","Li Zijun wished that Li Shihong would forget her, but of course this was impossible.","Li Shihong turned his attention to her and asked, “Li Zijun, you were in there just now, tell me, what happened inside? Betting with two Divine Doctors? It’s outrageous! I personally gave the token for them to enter the training ground, so they don’t even listen to my orders?”","Li Zijun shivered secretly, only then did she realise how irrational her actions were.","However, this was something she couldn’t have predicted in advance.","If Huang Yueli was the same good-for-nothing as she imagined, then it only took half an hour for her to slap Huang Yueli in the face, and there would be no chance for this incident to reach Li Shihong’s ears.","Now that it had been delayed for so long, things were getting out of hand."]},{"number":3912,"title":"Chapter 3912 Their Relationship (4)","paragraphs":["3912 Their Relationship (4)","It was not that easy to wrap things up and keep it from them.","The hatred in Li Zijun’s heart soared!","She didn’t reflect on what was wrong with her own actions at all, but attributed her embarrassing situation to Huang Yueli.","If it wasn’t for that damn girl who was clinging to the Young Master, she wouldn’t have made a bet against her on the spur of the moment!","If that damned girl was a little more straightforward, instead of delaying time in the tower on purpose because of her mental strength, she wouldn’t...","!!","Suddenly, Li Zijun’s eyes lit up.","That’s right! Why didn’t she think of it!","She saw that damn girl seduce the Young Master with her own eyes! If the Patriarch knew about this, he would definitely not blame her again.","Li Zijun quickly walked up to Li Shihong, with a look of guilt on her face, she lowered her head, “Patriarch, actually...the one who proposed to fight with Divine Doctor Li and the others was me...”","“What? It was you?” Li Shihong was taken aback, and looked at her incredulously.","“Li Zijun, what happened to you today? Why did you do such a thing? Divine Doctor Li is the benefactor of our Cloudy Qilin Clan! Why don’t you even have this measure? And you even tried to trespass to the training grounds... You! You I’m so disappointed!”","Li Zijun’s heart tightened.","If it weren’t for her having another trick, hearing these words would have dealt a fatal blow to her.","The mistakes she made today were enough for Li Shihong to remove her from Li Moying’s list of fiancees.","“As the Patriarch, I will not tolerate today’s incident. You will go to the punishment hall later...” Li Shihong’s face was full of disappointment.","But halfway through his speech, he was interrupted by Li Zijun.","“Patriarch, please calm down! Although I am indeed impulsive, there’s a reason for me to do these things, and I did it all for the sake of the clan!”","Li Shihong didn’t believe this at all. He frowned and said, “For the sake of the clan? How dare you say such a thing? If Divine Doctor Liu and Divine Doctor Li are injured, people will definitely say that our Cloudy Qilin Clan is ungrateful!”","Li Zijun hurriedly said: “But... Patriarch, you don’t know what I saw! I was in the training grounds, and I saw Divine Doctor Li hugging the Young Master, obviously throwing herself into his arms! She...she clearly took the opportunity when healing the Young Master and deliberately seduced the Young Master!”","“What did you say?” Li Shihong’s face changed suddenly!","Behind him, the elders and other clansmen who followed also looked extremely surprised.","“What’s going on? Divine Doctor Li seduced the Young Master?”","“Isn’t it? It’s groundless, so to say that the doctor...”","“Wait, I just remembered that Young Miss Leyun also said earlier that Divine Doctor Li had an affair with the Young Master, and she would be kicked out because of this, right?”","When someone said that, Li Shihong’s expression became even uglier.","No one knows what happened to Li Leyun better than him. After all, every time Li Leyun made a mistake, he witnessed it with his own eyes.","At that time, Li Leyun also insisted that the relationship between Li Moying and Divine Doctor Li was not normal.","It’s just that Liu Buyan and the others flatly denied it at the time.","In addition, the two of them did cure Li Moying, so Li Shihong didn’t think too much about it. Instead, he felt that it was Li Leyun’s obsession with Li Moying that made her lose her mind.","But now...","Even Li Zijun said that!","It may be slander for one person to say such a thing, but what if two people say it?"]},{"number":3913,"title":"Chapter 3913 Their Relationship (5)","paragraphs":["3913 Their Relationship (5)","This made him think deeper into it.","What’s more, Li Leyun and Li Zijun were both talented cultivators with high status in the Cloudy Qilin Clan. What they said was very important.","Li Shihong couldn’t care about anything else, and said with a gloomy face, “What’s going on? Zijun, come here and explain it clearly!”","Li Zijun took a sneak look at Li Shihong’s face, and immediately felt as if she had put down half of the big rock that had been hanging in her heart.","She knew that what Li Shihong was most worried about was that Li Moying fell in love with a woman with insufficient status outside. Last time, Li Yuntao and the others received news that Li Moying had a wife who had ascended from the lower realms and would not marry anyone. Li Shihong was almost worried.","Fortunately, there was an accident later, Li Moying was rescued back to the Amethyst Paramount Palace in a coma, but the mysterious woman disappeared.","Li Zijun wisely didn’t ask any more questions, but she could also guess that the woman must have been dealt with secretly by Li Yuntao and Li Leyun.","Originally, Li Shihong and others were worried that when Li Moying woke up and found that the woman was missing, he would be furious, and thought of a lot of reasons to explain to him.","But who knows, after Li Moying woke up, he completely forgot about that woman, and didn’t even ask about it, which made Li Shihong and others feel a little strange while rejoicing.","After contacting each other now, Li Shihong quickly realised that it was probably because of the appearance of this Divine Doctor Li that attracted Li Moying’s attention, which made him have no time to care about other women...","While Li Shihong was pondering, Li Zijun also explained at the same time.","“Patriarch, I really didn’t intend to provoke Divine Doctor Li on purpose today, it was really...it was the situation at that time, as a member of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, I couldn’t stand it! The behavior between her and the Young Master was very ambiguous, moreover, while she’s still relying on the support of the Young Master, she mocked our clansmen, and said that the Young Master was her man and she will soon become the Young Madame of the Cloudy Qilin Clan. At that time, we all have to kneel down and salute her... ...”","Li Zijun elaborated on the situation at that time.","Immediately, Huang Yueli was portrayed as an arrogant vixen who seduces men by her beauty and bullies others.","After saying these words, Li Shihong and the cultivators he brought showed extremely angry expressions on their faces.","Li Yuntao slapped his thigh vigorously, “It’s really unreasonable! I used to respect that Divine Doctor Li very much. I thought it was very rare for her to have such medical skills at such a young age. How could I know that she was such a woman!”","“I really didn’t expect that, how dare she say that she’s the Young Madame of the Cloudy Qilin Clan? Huh, even if she can climb into the bed of the Young Master, so what? With her status, if she wants to marry into the Cloudy Qilin Clan, she might as well hurry up to commit suicide and reincarnate! Our future mistress must not be a human woman with poor talent like her!”","As Li Zijun’s elder, Li Qingsong was the one who was the most angry, “Zijun, you did the right thing! For such a kind of woman, you should show her the strength of our Cloudy Qilin Clan genius, and let her know how high the sky is! Don’t talk about betting with her, you should beat her up on the spot.”","Hearing the angry discussions of the crowd, Li Zijun almost laughed out loud.","She pursed the corners of her lips and forced herself to maintain a dignified smile, “I thought, beating someone would lose our identity of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, and it’s best to let her quit in spite of the difficulties.”"]},{"number":3914,"title":"Chapter 3914 Their Relationship (6)","paragraphs":["3914 Their Relationship (6)","Hearing this, Li Yunhai couldn’t help sighing, “Well, Zijun’s words are very true! After all, Divine Doctor Li saved the Young Master, and every sentence you utter is about fighting, how unbecoming is that? Zijun should be calm and bet with her and let her see the true strength of our Cloudy Qilin Clan, this is the best method.”","Li Yuntao also nodded, “That’s right, it’s true. So what happened to the outcome of your bet?”","Hearing this question, everyone’s eyes turned to Li Zijun at the same time.","After talking for a long time, Li Zijun only said that she was the one who initiated the bet but she didn’t say the result.","This was what Li Zijun was waiting for!","She suppressed the joy in her heart, and said with a wry smile: “Oh, it’s true that I was not prepared enough for this matter at the beginning. That Divine Doctor Li has a very strong mental power, and she has been staying in the tower for a long time. I didn’t expect that there would be such accidents, so the time left for experience was not enough. The moment Divine Doctor Li was about to enter the Illusion Array, I was teleported out!”","Everyone finally realised the reason for her actions.","“So, just now you were in a hurry to rush into the training ground, but you were bounced back by the defensive array. Was that why?”","Li Zijun nodded, “That’s right, I was anxious to see the result of the bet, and I was worried that after I was teleported, Divine Doctor Li would renege, so I was a little anxious... I ran into the defensive array, it’s all my fault, after the things here are over, I’ll go to the punishment hall to receive my punishment!”","Li Zijun took a retreat in advance, and said her words very earnestly.","From the ears of everyone, she was an upright person who wholeheartedly considers the clan, and she was willing to bear the responsibility even though it was clearly not her fault.","Li Shihong’s face loosened a lot. Originally, he was extremely disappointed with Li Zijun, but now, he admired Li Zijun even more.","After all, Li Zijun was still much better than Li Leyun, and her behavior was much more generous!","It seems that Li Moying’s fiancée can be decided...","It’s not your fault. Although you were a little impulsive, it’s understandable. There is no need to go to the punishment hall to receive the punishment. Just go back and think about it behind closed doors for three days.”","This kind of punishment was like nothing.","Li Zijun was overjoyed in her heart, and hastily bowed her head to admit her mistake.","At the same time, she was extremely grateful.","This time, she would like to thank that Divine Doctor Li. Although the sixty hours of training time was wasted earlier, it was a blessing in disguise to be appreciated by Li Shihong and the elders!","That damn girl wants to fight her? Hah! What a daydream!","Li Zijun thought of something, and quickly raised her head and said: “Patriarch, several elders, when I was teleported out just now, Divine Doctor Li was about to enter the Illusion Array, and I don’t know what the results were. Can you please let me use next month’s training time in advance to let me see the result? After all, it’s a bet, and I always have to see the result with Divine Doctor Li face to face.”","Li Shihong narrowed his eyes, “That’s right, of course there must be a result of the bet! You can go in now, but it’s not you who will go alone, but all of us! Since the little girl surnamed Li has something to do with the Young Master, we should let her see the reality earlier!”","Hearing this, Li Zijun was even more overjoyed. No matter how hard she tried, she couldn’t suppress the smile on her lips."]},{"number":3915,"title":"Chapter 3915 Their Relationship (7)","paragraphs":["3915 Their Relationship (7)","What a windfall!","She never expected that Li Shihong and so many elders could be invited to watch them fight together!","That damn girl has already entered the Illusion Array, and now it’s too late to deny it. When the time comes, the Patriarch and the others will be able to see her embarrassed posture and horrible points. This was not just a matter of embarrassment. It was a pure naked humiliation!","Moreover, in order to make that damn girl give up, Li Shihong and the others will definitely warn her severely, and at the same time find a reason to drive her out of Amethyst Paramount Palace.","In this way, she could drive this little vixen away without any effort!","Li Zijun was overjoyed, imagining Huang Yueli’s shameless face in her heart, she almost jumped up ecstatically.","At this moment, Li Qingsong’s voice sounded abruptly in front of her again, “Zijun, you said just now that you have already entered the Illusion Array, how many points did you gain this time?”","Li Zijun shuddered, and finally remembered that it was not the time for her to be complacent, and hurriedly replied: “This time, the total was 1402 points.”","“Oh?” Li Qingsong was obviously very pleasantly surprised. “Last month, you just broke through 1,000 points. It’s only been a month. Your strength has improved so much?”","If one wants to increase the Illusion Array points, the later one goes, the slower the progress.","When one starts off with a few dozen points, it is very fast to increase by 100 points, but after exceeding 1,000 points, it is very difficult to increase by 10 points each time.","Li Zijun unexpectedly scored more than 400 points higher in one fell swoop, which was indeed a remarkable achievement.","Li Zijun was secretly proud of herself, but she still pretended to be humble and said: “In order to participate in the God Realm’s Grand Meet, I have been practicing day and night during this time, and I have comprehended most of the second book of combat secrets by chance, so I have improved a bit, but I still have a lot of room for improvement...”","Li Qingsong twirled his beard and laughed, “Not bad, it’s already very good! You can’t compare with a peerless genius like the Young Master, but your points are already higher than Li Leyun!","Li Zijun smiled slightly.","This was what she was most proud of.","After today, all the clansmen will know that she was the genius second only to the Young Master among the younger generation, and Li Leyun can’t compare to her!","No matter in terms of strength or character, she was the most qualified to stand by Li Moying’s side.","The two of them spoke softly at the end of the line, but the elders who had been walking in front all the time had strong spiritual senses, so they naturally listened to their conversations.","Li Shihong frowned. Hearing Li Leyun’s name, he felt mixed feelings.","But now, Li Leyun has done so many stupid things, which makes Li Zijun stand out...","He was depressed for a while, then thought of Li Moying again.","It’s strange to say that when Li Moying went out to cultivate once, he was about to bring back a woman from the lower realm. This time he just woke up from a coma, and in the blink of an eye he fell in love with a woman from the human race again.","From this point of view, he should be the kind of man who was naturally romantic.","Of course, Li Moying does have the capital of being romantic, but when he was in Amethyst Paramount Palace, he was obviously an unattainable flower!","The women of the Cloudy Qilin Clan are also very beautiful, and Li Leyun was one of the four great beauties in the God Realm."]},{"number":3916,"title":"Chapter 3916 Their Relationship (8)","paragraphs":["3916 Their Relationship (8)","However, Li Moying didn’t like any of them.","Moreover, the attitude towards them was extremely indifferent, and it could be said that they were completely ignored.","But why was it that when facing human women, you see one and love the other? The speed of this change of heart was faster than lightning!","Could it be that because Li Moying ascended from the lower realms, he has a soft spot for humans?","If this was the case, things would be a little troublesome. No wonder he doesn’t like the fiancée the clan arranged for him...","Li Shihong has already started thinking about how to persuade Li Moying after today, let him at least marry Li Zijun as his wife, and give birth to a son, and then he will stop interfering with how many concubines he wants to take from the human race ...","The journey to the place of experience was not far away, and soon, a group of people walked to the entrance.","After the defensive array once again emitted a burst of light, it opened to both sides.","The clouds cleared, and everyone walked in.","All the cultivators in the training ground are now surrounded by the Illusion Array, their eyes fixed on the numbers on the stone tablet.","On the field, there was an eerie tranquillity.","This made the footsteps of Li Shihong and the others extraordinarily clear.","However, everyone seemed to be frozen in place, looking at the stone tablet, completely unaware that someone had broken in.","Only Li Moying discovered the visitor immediately.","He straightened up, a cold light flashed in his dark pupils, he slightly pursed his lips, and said indifferently: “Patriarch, several elders, why do you have time to come to this training place?”","The man’s deep and magnetic voice echoed over the venue.","Everyone suddenly woke up, turned around abruptly, looked behind them, and immediately broke out in a cold sweat from fright.","“Pa... Patriarch!!”","“Patriarch, Elder Tao, Elder Hai, Elder Qingsong!”","“Greetings to the Patriarch! Gree.. Greetings to the elders!”","To them, Patriarchs and elders were the highest-ranking people in the clan. Young people like them can only meet one of them once in a while during the Clan’s Annual Martial Grand Meet.","But now, Li Shihong not only came in person, but also brought so many elders with him.","Have they ever seen such a battle?","Li Moying was still calm, and slowly walked out of the shadow behind the stone tablet.","He was tall and handsome, and the aura exuding from his body was even more powerful and compelling. It was not inferior to those elders in the Dao Profound Realm in front of him, and even surpassed them!","As soon as Li Zijun saw Li Moying approaching, she couldn’t help but a faint blush appeared on her face.","At any time, their Young Master looks so outstanding. He was not only a real strong man, but also the man in every girl’s dream!","Usually, Li Zijun can force herself to remain calm in front of Li Moying, but now she has already guessed that she will be the candidate for Li Moying’s fiancée, which makes her a little unable to control the turbulent emotions in her heart.","It’s a pity that Li Moying was completely unaware of her own contrived thoughts.","Li Moying’s eyes fell directly on Li Shihong, and she cupped her hands, “Patriarch, may I ask if this is...”","Li Shihong coughed heavily, “Moying, I heard that Zijun made an agreement with Divine Doctor Li today to fight with the Illusion Array points? Isn’t it?”"]},{"number":3917,"title":"Chapter 3917 Peerless Genius (1)","paragraphs":["3917 Peerless Genius (1)","Li Shihong originally planned to question him, but the moment he saw Li Moying, he suddenly calmed down and changed his mind.","Li Moying was no ordinary clansman. Not only was he extremely talented, but he also had a very strong personality.","Even if Li Shihong was the Patriarch of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, it was actually impossible for Li Moying to follow his command.","At that time, once the two sides quarrel, not only will it be impossible for Li Moying to separate from that human woman, but they will even fall out, and the gains will outweigh the losses.","Therefore, Li Shihong stopped talking in time, and turned to ask about the situation of Huang Yueli’s trial.","Li Moying glanced at Li Shihong lightly, taking in his hesitant expression.","Seeing Li Zijun timidly standing aside, what else does she not understand?","Li Moying didn’t point it out, but said calmly: “It’s true, I didn’t expect that so many people would be dissatisfied when I brought my sworn brother and his Junior Sister into the training grounds. It seems... There are still many people in the clan who are not convinced by me being Young Master.”","Hearing this, the cultivators who had been watching shuddered in unison.","They only thought of watching the fun before, but Li Zijun took the lead, so they ran here in a flash of enthusiasm.","Never thought about it at all. In fact, they have offended their Young Master by daring to watch this bet!","Now, when they heard Li Moying’s cold voice, they suddenly woke up.","But, it’s too late!","What’s worse was that if Li Zijun wins the bet, it’s fine, they can still defend themselves, and they came here so eagerly to watch all in the name of the clan’s consideration.","But just now, after seeing the points displayed on the stone tablet...","They only had one thought in their minds – where did this pervert come from! Was there really a woman in the world who was as talented as the Young Master? Were they dreaming?","Not only the onlookers, but even the elders behind Li Shihong seemed a little embarrassed at this time.","If possible, no one wants to offend Li Moying.","However, Li Moying’s marriage was related to the vital interests of all branches of the clan, so all the elders can’t stay out of it, so they can only bite the bullet and come here.","Li Shihong coughed a few times, “Ahem, Moying, don’t say that, Zijun and the others are indeed a little reckless, but they definitely don’t mean to oppose you. They are afraid that other clan members in the clan will be dissatisfied with you. That’s why I came up with this method, as long as the two Divine Doctors are really capable, they will stop other people’s mouths. Otherwise, if any untrue rumours spread, your reputation will be damaged!”","His intention to defend Li Zijun was too obvious, and Li Moying’s face became even colder.","However, he didn’t say much, but just cast a cold glance at Li Zijun.","Li Zijun was swept over by his cold gaze, and couldn’t help but tremble all over.","She also knows that Li Moying will definitely be very angry if she lures Li Shihong and others to the training grounds.","However, she thought it was for Li Moying’s good, to prevent Li Moying from being seduced by the vixen of the human race!","She felt that what she did was right. As long as Li Moying leaves that vixen and calms down, he will definitely appreciate her painstaking efforts!"]},{"number":3918,"title":"Chapter 3918 Peerless Genius (2)","paragraphs":["3918 Peerless Genius (2)","Li Shihong saw that the scene was deadlocked, and quickly said: “Moying, don’t talk about anything else. How is the situation now? Where’s Divine Doctor Li?”","Li Moying’s eyes returned to Li Shihong, and said calmly: “She has already entered the illusion.”","Hearing this, Li Zijun secretly heaved a sigh of relief.","What she was most afraid of now was that Huang Yueli would renege on her debts.","If Huang Yueli refused to enter the Illusion Array relying on Li Moying’s backing, then she would have no way to attack her.","But now it seems that her worries were unfounded, Divine Doctor Li has already entered the Illusion Array...","Everything was still developing in the direction she expected.","As long as she sees that damn girl in a state of distress and has unsightly test scores, the Patriarch will definitely oppose her being with the Young Master. Even the Young Master himself may feel too shameful to step down.","Li Shihong obviously thought so too.","He exhaled lightly, and said, “Oh? Has Divine Doctor Li already entered? How long has she been in? How many points has she scored so far?”","Hearing this, Li Moying’s mouth showed a hint of sarcasm, and he didn’t answer right away.","The cultivators behind him who came to watch immediately lowered their heads. They were all quieter than quails. They looked terrified and didn’t even dare to fart.","Seeing this, Li Zijun immediately had a bad feeling.","However, she didn’t know what was wrong, so she could only wink desperately at a few of her followers, telling them to stand up quickly, say a few embellished words, and seize this last opportunity to discredit Huang Yueli.","But who knows, the few followers who usually cooperate with her tacitly, now seem to have suddenly become fools, bowing their heads and not saying a word, completely ignoring the gaze she cast.","Li Zijun’s eyes widened. She thought those followers didn’t notice, and he didn’t care about the wrong occasion. She raised her hand to cover her mouth, and coughed heavily twice.","It was only then that the followers seemed to have come to their senses, and raised their eyes to glance at her hastily.","Li Zijun quickly gestured towards them.","However, after seeing her, several people immediately lowered their heads again, not daring to look at her for a second time!","Li Zijun’s hand stayed in the air, feeling like a fool.","Even Li Shihong noticed something was wrong with her, and frowned at her, “Zijun, what are you doing? Are you suffering from the cold? Why are you coughing?”","“Ahem, my throat...is a little uncomfortable...” Li Zijun was agitated, and hurriedly said: “It’s nothing, it doesn’t matter, let’s hurry up and see how Divine Doctor Li is doing in the Illusion Array!”","Li Shihong nodded, and followed Li Zijun to the stone tablet that displayed the points.","The rest of the elders followed behind them and walked slowly.","Li Yuntao and Li Yunhai were still discussing in low voices.","“It’s been less than a quarter of an hour since we entered the training ground, right? That Divine Doctor Li actually stayed in the Illusion Array for such a long time!”","“That’s right. I noticed this just now. From this point of view, her talent might be pretty good!”","“Well, I guess it’s considered outstanding talent among the human race, but it is impossible to compare with the geniuses of the god race!”"]},{"number":3919,"title":"Chapter 3919 Peerless Genius (3)","paragraphs":["3919 Peerless Genius (3)","“Isn’t that the case? Speaking of which, Divine Doctor Li is young and impulsive. Of all people to compete against, she actually chose Zijun? If she has this talent, she shouldn’t be able to lose. It’s too ugly, but compared with Zijun... It’s a miracle for her to have a fraction of the record of more than 1,400 points!”","“Indeed...”","As the two were talking, they felt an awkward silence around them.","This kind of silence was exactly the same as when they first stepped into the training ground.","The two looked up in surprise, and found that besides them, Li Shihong and other elders were walking very fast, and had already surrounded the stone tablet.","However, each of them stiffened, as if they had been petrified!","Everyone had expressions of shock on their faces!","“This... what’s going on?”","Li Yuntao and Li Yunhai looked at each other suspiciously, then hurried to the side of the stone tablet, and took a closer look...","Immediately afterwards, the reactions of the two of them were exactly the same as those of the other elders!","They were staring at the numbers on the stone tablet, tongue-tied, and their eyeballs were about to pop out!","Li Moying still stood not far away, watching everyone’s performance, his expression was still indifferent, from the appearance, there was no emotional fluctuation at all.","Only Liu Buyan took a peek at him and sneered with disdain.","Tch!","Look at this kid’s pretense, it was definitely all pretense!","Liu Buyan couldn’t believe that Li Moying was really so cold!","His wife’s talent was outstanding and shocked everyone. It is estimated that Li Moying was extremely proud of her, a hundred times happier than himself being in the limelight!","It’s so hypocritical to pretend to be indifferent!","Li Moying felt Liu Buyan’s contemptuous eyes, but he didn’t even bother to respond.","“Patriarch, have you finished seeing the score? Although Divine Doctor Li’s final score hasn’t come out yet, judging by her current score, she should have won this round of bet, right?”","Li Shihong just woke up like a dream. He suddenly turned his head to look at Li Moying. With trembling fingers, he pointed to the number displayed in the center of the stone tablet, “This... this... this...”","He said “this” three times in a row, but couldn’t continue.","Because, no matter what he said now, he could no longer express the shock in his heart!","After a while, Li Shihong finally choked out a sentence, “This...is this real? I...I’m not dreaming, am I?”","Li Moying shrugged his shoulders, “Patriarch’s words are really interesting. The points displayed on the stone tablet of the Illusion Array have never been wrong. As for dreaming... Maybe so, it could be that everyone here is dreaming together, right? ”","“But...but...” Li Shihong stammered, still unable to believe his eyes.","At the same time, the other cultivators gradually came to their senses.","Everyone looked at each other in blank dismay, the expressions on their faces were still somewhat dull, and they were still digesting the amazing news they just saw!","“Impossible! This... This is absolutely impossible!”","A scream broke the tranquility around the Illusion Array.","Everyone turned their heads in unison, and turned out to be Li Zijun who had cried out.","Li Zijun’s complexion has turned livid, her head was covered with sweat, her lips were trembling slightly, and she was no longer able to maintain her usual dignified image."]},{"number":3920,"title":"Chapter 3920 Peerless Genius (4)","paragraphs":["3920 Peerless Genius (4)","Throughout the entire day, she had suffered too many blows in succession!","However, no matter how hard she was hit before, it couldn’t compare to the shock she received the moment she saw the points on the stone tablet!","That number displayed was really incredible!","Even in the millions of years of the Cloudy Qilin Clan’s history, not many people can achieve it!","“This is absolutely impossible. That Divine Doctor Li is just an unknown human woman. She can’t have such talent! This is not normal at all, there must be something wrong!”","!!","Li Zijun yelled out regardless, completely unable to accept this fact.","Before Li Moying could speak, Liu Buyan couldn’t help but stepped forward.","“Miss Zijun, please pay attention to your own words and deeds, and don’t discredit the Cloudy Qilin Clan anymore! In the past few days, you have repeatedly provoked my Junior Sister, not only proposing a bet, but also repeatedly cheating and modifying the rules. As for these trivial tricks, Junior Sister couldn’t even be bothered with you! Now, her points in the Illusion Array are right in front of you and so many people are watching, yet you still want to slander her?”","“I...I...” Li Zijun didn’t expect Liu Buyan’s words to be so sharp, and she was rendered speechless for a moment.","After a long while, she finally choked out a sentence, “I’m not slandering her, but this is really...really impossible! Absolutely impossible!”","“Yeah, I also think it’s unlikely. The points on the stone tablet have already exceeded 30,000 points! This... all those who can reach this point in history, without exception, are all god-level geniuses! Could it be that Divine Doctor Li is... yes...”","“No way? Impossible? Isn’t she a human cultivator? There are only two or three god-level geniuses in the history of the human race, and their actual combat ability cannot be compared with the god-level geniuses of the ancient gods!”","“Besides, I’ve tested Divine Doctor Li’s cultivation before. She should only be in the Profound Mind Realm? If she really has such an extraordinary talent, then... how could she only be in the Profound Profound Realm?”","At this time, several elders also calmed down a bit, and began to discuss with each other.","No one could believe it when they saw this point for the first time, it’s real!","The fact that the Cloudy Qilin Clan was able to obtain a god-level genius like Li Moying was already smoke from the ancestral graves. Which of the Twelve Ancient God Clans in the entire God Realm would not envy them?","This also shows how rare god-level geniuses are!","Now, a Spirit Medicine Master who came out of nowhere actually has such a high talent?","Who would believe such a thing?","Was a god-level genius a chinese cabbage that could be found anywhere?","After hearing this, the elders blushed and didn’t know what to say.","If they insist that the points were wrong, wouldn’t that be akin to admitting that their Ancient God Clan was not worthy of their name?","Moreover, the Illusion Array in the training ground has been operating for hundreds of thousands of years, and it has never made any mistakes.","However, to accept that such a delicate and weak girl like Huang Yueli was actually a peerless genius, that was still too incredible!"]},{"number":3921,"title":"Chapter 3921 Why Don’t You Hurry And Get Married?(1)","paragraphs":["3921 Why Don’t You Hurry And Get Married?(1)","After the shock, the elders all turned their attention to Li Shihong.","With the current situation, everyone was in a daze and could only wait for their Patriarch.","Li Shihong was no less shocked than the others, but, as the Patriarch of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, he knew better than anyone how powerful the Illusion Array in the training grounds was.","As long as there was enough crystal jade to provide energy, this Illusion Array can even block the joint attack of ten experts in the Profound Fate Realm. It is used to test the strength of the young geniuses of the Cloudy Qilin Clan.","Moreover, Huang Yueli has indeed stayed in the Illusion Array for a long time.","If her strength was weak, she would have been teleported out by now, and it would be impossible for her to persist for such a long time.","Li Shihong pursed his lips, and managed to recover his voice, “We can’t see the situation in the Illusion Array, and we can’t rule out if there’s any problem of the array. However, for so many years, the Illusion Array has been operating normally...”","While talking, he thought of something, and turned to look at Li Moying who was standing behind the stone tablet.","The handsome young genius who usually stood tall with an indifferent expression and cold gaze, had a peerless character that was difficult to describe in words.","Only when one looked very carefully can you find that his eyes were much gentler than usual, and there is still a hint of a faint smile at the corner of his lips.","Seeing Li Moying’s calm expression, Li Shihong’s lips trembled, “Moying, you... did you know... know... this Divine Doctor Li is extremely talented?”","Hearing this, everyone turned their heads to look at Li Moying in surprise.","After Li Shihong mentioned these words, many people thought at the same time that Li Moying would agree to a Spirit Medicine Master who had saved his life to compete with the heavenly genius of his family. This matter was a bit abnormal.","Judging from Li Moying’s personality, if Li Zijun really had an affair with Divine Doctor Li as Li Zijun said, he would never let someone humiliate his woman in this way.","Even if he and Divine Doctor Li weren’t in a serious relationship, he wouldn’t be like this.","In addition, after seeing Divine Doctor Li’s points, he still looked so calm.","It’s easy to think that he should have known about it beforehand!","Thinking of this, Li Zijun’s face instantly turned pale, and she became no different from a dead person.","Thinking of how complacent she was all the time before, that she had a certain chance of winning, and that the Young Master looked at her differently, that didn’t stop her from betting against Divine Doctor Li... Li Zijun felt that he was the stupidest idiot in the world!","Li Moying clearly didn’t take her seriously, she just wanted to use her to gain prestige for the girl he likes!","The corners of Li Moying’s lips turned up slightly.","He has always been as cold as ice in front of outsiders, and many people have never seen him smile at all. Although he only slightly restrained his aura at this time and smiled very shallowly, it melted the iceberg aura around him a lot .","All the female cultivators present gasped in unison!","Usually, he was handsome enough even when he did not smile, but now he was even more handsome when he smiled, taking their breaths away.","Li Moying said calmly: “I just heard from Little Li’er that her talent in martial arts is much stronger than her medical skills, but I didn’t expect her to get such a high score.”"]},{"number":3922,"title":"Chapter 3922 Why Don’t You Hurry And Get Married?(2)","paragraphs":["3922 Why Don’t You Hurry And Get Married?(2)","Li Moying said a few words lightly, although he admitted that he knew Huang Yueli’s talent was very high, but he also emphasized that he didn’t know it was so high.","After all, it is still inappropriate for the members of the Cloudy Qilin Clan to know that Huang Yueli was from the Sacred Phoenix Clan.","Otherwise, there will be big trouble.","Moreover, the higher Huang Yueli’s talent was, the greater their troubles would be!","Speaking of which, he should also be thankful that the Illusion Array in the training grounds can only see the points, but cannot see the battle situation in the array.","If it weren’t for this, if Huang Yueli used all her strength in the formation, Li Shihong and his experienced cultivators would probably see the problem and reveal the secret that she was from the Sacred Phoenix Clan.","Now it’s much safer. The Illusion Array covered up all fluctuations of profound energy, which gave Huang Yueli a chance to show off her talent.","Liu Buyan looked at Li Moying’s pretense of staging an indifferent arrogance, and couldn’t help but sneered again.","He really wondered what those girls were crazy about?","A man like Li Moying was hypocritical, cold, ruthless, and boring, and he only looks human in front of his Junior Sister.","Usually, even if he treats his friends, he was inhumane, a scumbag!","After Li Moying finished speaking, Li Shihong and the elders fell silent.","Originally, they were already wavering, thinking that the Illusion Array would not go wrong, and that the little girl in the array might have a god-level talent, but they still couldn’t believe it.","But now, after being verified by Li Moying’s words, they can’t help but not believe it.","That beautiful young doctor was not a fool. Everyone in the God Realm knows how talented Li Moying was. She actually has the guts to say that she was talented in front of Li Moying! And Li Moying believed it too!","This in itself has explained countless problems.","At the same time, Li Shihong and the others thought they understood why Li Moying didn’t look at Li Leyun and Li Zijun, but in less than a month, he secretly fell in love with the female doctor who treated him...","If they missed Divine Doctor Li, where would they find a proud girl whose talent could match Li Moying’s?","Thinking of this, Li Shihong almost burst into tears. He finally suppressed the tears from the corners of his eyes, and looked at Li Moying with a kind eyes like an old father.","“Moying... It seems that I am really worrying too much! I am afraid that you will not be enlightened on this matter of men and women. You only know how to cultivate and miss the important things in life! Now it seems that you are still smart, and your vision Good! A peerless genius like Divine Doctor Li is really rare to come across! All of us old guys are blind, but we didn’t realize that she is such a piece of jade, only you can see it! Good! ”","Although he once hoped that Li Moying could marry a woman with the blood of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, that was also because he couldn’t find a proud girl whose talent matched Li Moying’s.","Now, Divine Doctor Li, who appeared out of thin air, is not only talented, but also proficient in medical skills, not to mention his amazing beauty...","Such a perfect match, he really can’t find it!","What made Li Shihong laugh even more was that the little girl was still a human girl with no family power!","Before, he thought that the human race was of low status and was not worthy of Li Moying, but now, he thinks that the human race is good, the human race is wonderful, and the human race is awesome!"]},{"number":3923,"title":"Chapter 3923 Why Don’t You Hurry And Get Married?(3)","paragraphs":["3923 Why Don’t You Hurry And Get Married?(3)","If Huang Yueli was from an Ancient God Clan, even if she married Li Moying, she still belonged to her own clan.","After all, no matter which big power it was, it would never give up its god-level genius. It was impossible for Huang Yue to become a member of the Cloudy Qilin Clan even if they divorced.","Even if she had children with Li Moying, there must be one bloodline left in each family.","But now that Huang Yueli was from the human race, it will be very different!","She doesn’t have any power to belong to, so after she married Li Moying, what else can she do besides joining the Cloudy Qilin Clan? Of course, her and Li Moying’s descendants all belong to the Cloudy Qilin Clan!","What kind of talent would the baby born of two god-level geniuses? Li Shihong didn’t even dare to think about it!","After all, in the history recorded in the ancient books of the God Realm, there has never been such a thing!","Li Shihong still wanted to maintain his majesty as the Patriarch of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, but when such a great event happened, he was so excited that he was shaking all over, and he couldn’t control his reaction no matter what, he couldn’t jump up and cheer on the spot , is already a very self-control performance.","He paced back and forth, and the more he thought about it, the more excited he became, “Moying, you really deserve to be the first genius in the history of our Cloudy Qilin Clan. Not only is your talent high enough, but you also have vision and charm! Such a peerless lady was easily subdued by you. That’s great, it’s really great! So it’s not that you don’t like women, but that you have too high standards! Once you set your sights on someone you like, you’re still very quick! ”","Li Moying slightly lowered his eyelids to hide the expression in his eyes.","He didn’t bother to explain to Li Shihong that what he liked was Huang Yueli, not her talent. Even if his Little Li’er wasn’t a genius, he would still like her.","Presumably Li Shihong couldn’t understand this kind of thing.","Liu Buyan listened from the side, so he could only laugh.","The old man said that Li Moying doesn’t like women? It’s clearly for the sake of women that he doesn’t even have humanity, and even snatched his brother’s crush, alright?","As for easily subduing Huang Yueli, that’s even more nonsense. How many years did it take to catch his Junior Sister in the lower realm? Now he can pretend to be a wolf with a big tail!","Li Shihong clapped his hands suddenly, and said again: “It’s not too late. When Divine Doctor Li comes out of the Illusion Array, let’s sit down quickly and have a good talk about the marriage of the two families.”","Li Shihong’s thinking now is completely different from that of an hour ago.","Now, the most important thing for him is to get the two peerless geniuses married as soon as possible, and tie Huang Yueli to the Cloudy Qilin Clan first! lest any accident happen.","Although, with Moying’s charm and strength, the entire God Realm couldn’t find a man who could match him, but emotional matters were uncertain after all, and it’s always bad to have long nights and dreams.","“I don’t know what relatives and elders there are in Divine Doctor Li’s family... That’s right!”","“Ahem!”","Liu Buyan coughed hard twice, knowing that now is the time for him as a Senior Brother to show his performance. To be able to make things difficult for Li Moying, such kind of good opportunity was rare in a hundred years!","Both Bai Liufeng and Huang Siluo were in the lower realm, and now in the entire God Realm , the one person who had the status to express opinions on Huang Yueli’s marriage, was him!","Li Moying, a brat who wants to marry his Junior Sister, hmph! He would definitely shave off a layer of his skin!"]},{"number":3924,"title":"Chapter 3924 Why Don’t You Hurry And Get Married?(4)","paragraphs":["3924 Why Don’t You Hurry And Get Married?(4)","He was about to make things difficult for Li Moying, but before he could speak, Li Moying intervened.","“Marriage...there’s no rush right now.”","Li Shihong didn’t like to hear these words. “How can you not be in a hurry? There is an ancient saying that first you start a family and then you start a career. You marry the young wife first, so that you can practice with peace of mind?”","The corners of Li Moying’s mouth twitched, “Patriarch, you are too worried. It is common people’s idea to start a family first, not us cultivators. Among cultivators, there are many people who only get married when they are hundreds of years old. At this age...”","“Hey, you kid! I just praised you for your vision, why don’t you get it now? For such a good girl like Divine Doctor Li, why don’t you hurry up and marry her? What are you waiting for? Don’t think that just because you are a god-level genius, she’ll like you!” Li Shihong became anxious, and didn’t pay attention to the embellished words he was uttering.","He was very worried that Li Moying would become too conceited and confident because he was surrounded by talented girls from various protoss clans on weekdays, and missed out on Divine Doctor Li.","It’s nothing more than the fact that Divine Doctor Li’s status was a little low.","But this is nothing, just relying on their talent, no matter which power they belong to, they will always be praised to the sky.","When Li Moying heard Li Shihong’s words, he couldn’t help feeling secretly proud.","Who said he wasn’t in a hurry? When he was with Huang Yueli in the previous life, he was also very anxious, wasn’t he? He was afraid that the lady who he had finally wooed would fly away!","It’s just that he has already married Huang Yueli. Although Li Shihong and the others don’t know about it, it doesn’t prevent the two of them from recognizing each other as their only partner.","Even if they get married again in the God Realm, the weight of this marriage will not compare to that in the Lower Realm.","At that time, he was able to marry his wife only after passing many tests by Little Li’er’s own father.","Li Moying recalled the grand occasion of getting married in the lower realm for a while, and the smile on the corner of his mouth deepened, causing the girls around him to stare intently, but they could only silently while their hearts were breaking.","If possible, they really didn’t want to witness such a beautiful smile of their own Young Master.","Because, he did this for the girl he admired!","That is something they will never be able to compare with!","Li Moying said unhurriedly: “Of course I know Miss Li is very good, and it’s not because she doesn’t want to marry. But...”","Before he finished speaking, he saw a burst of silver light suddenly appearing from the periphery of the Illusion Array.","His voice stopped abruptly, and he turned towards the Illusion Array.","Seeing this, Liu Buyan couldn’t help but frown, a little worried, “What’s the situation? Why hasn’t Junior Sister come out yet?”","Li Moying smiled instead, “It’s okay, there shouldn’t be any problem, it’s just that Little Li’er’s points have exceeded 100,000 points. After 100,000 points, what will appear is not a spirit beast, but someone from the god clan above the Dao Profound Realm and human cultivators, and they are all real masters. This streamer is just a reminder.”","Li Shihong and others have all seen Li Moying’s situation in the Illusion Array with their own eyes, so of course they also know this.","However, this did not weaken their shock in the slightest!","One hundred thousand points!","That girl who looked slender and weak, as if she would fall if the wind blows, has already broken through 100,000 points! !","This achievement is beyond reach for many god-level geniuses."]},{"number":3925,"title":"Chapter 3925 Super High Level of Flirting (1)","paragraphs":["3925 Super High Level of Flirting (1)","In fact, being able to break through 30,000 points already shows that Huang Yueli was a god-level talent.","Since the history of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, there has never been a record of a heaven-level genius scoring 30,000 points.","That’s why Li Shihong and the others were so excited when they saw the number of more than 30,000 points on the stone tablet just now. They wished they could drag Huang Yueli out of the Illusion Array on the spot, and stuff her and Li Moying into the bridal chamber!","At that time, the score of 30,000 was enough to surprise people.","Now... 30,000 points had actually become 100,000 points!","That’s not just a surprise, but a thrill!","Recalling that when Li Moying entered the Illusion Array for the first time, he only had a score of 110,000 to 120,000. Later, he had to practice in the tower several times before he could reach the first place.","Now it seems that Young Miss Li’s talent was not inferior to Li Moying’s at all, and she might even surpass him.","Everyone’s eyes were focused on the front of the stone tablet, and they didn’t even dare to blink. They stared at the constantly changing numbers on it, and held their breath.","Only Li Moying and Liu Buyan looked calm and took it for granted. They didn’t feel that there was anything abnormal about Huang Yueli’s behavior.","The number on the stone tablet rose all the way until it reached about 110,000, and the rate of increase began to slow down significantly.","Next, the points jumped up from one thousand and one thousand at the beginning to one hundred and one hundred.","Later, it became tens of dozens...","It was obvious that Huang Yueli had already fallen into a hard fight in the Illusion Array, and had encountered an enemy who could really pose a threat to her.","In the end, the points on the stone tablet didn’t increase for a long time.","Li Shihong and the surrounding cultivators all heaved a sigh of relief.","Anyway, this astonishing rise is finally coming to an end...","On the contrary, Li Moying, who had always been careless, suddenly became serious at this moment, and a trace of solemnity flashed across his handsome face.","At this moment, a familiar silver light flashed outside the Illusion Array.","A slender figure flashed in the silver light and fell out.","When Huang Yueli was teleported out, her body completely lost her balance. Seeing that she was about to fall this time, she was inevitably a little annoyed.","Unexpectedly, when she rushed to the ground, what she bumped into was a thick and warm wall of flesh.","A hint of surprise flashed across Huang Yueli’s large Yingying eyes, her cherry-like mouth slightly opened, and when she looked up, she met her husband’s charming peach blossom eyes.","The coldness and indifference in his eyes had long since disappeared, replaced by deep worry and a little panic.","Huang Yueli raised the corners of her mouth and smiled sweetly, “Moying, you came in time! I thought I was going to fall!”","Li Moying hooked the girl’s slender waist, took her into his arms, pressed the positions of several meridians on her back with his big hand, and checked her physical condition without any delay. After finding that there was nothing serious, his tense face relaxed a little.","Huang Yueli didn’t feel that there was anything wrong with her.","She raised her hand and pushed Li Moying’s chest, “Moying, let me go first and let me check my points. I killed a lot of spirit beasts in it, but later I met a cultivator in the Dao Profound Realm and it became harder.”"]},{"number":3926,"title":"Chapter 3926 Super High Level of Flirting (2)","paragraphs":["3926 Super High Level of Flirting (2)","“I want to know, how many points did I get?”","Huang Yueli looked anxious, and her head had already turned to the direction of the stone tablet.","However, looking from where they were standing, there were a lot of bewildered cultivators standing in the middle, unable to read the writing on the stone tablet.","Huang Yueli was a little impatient. Seeing that Li Moying refused to let go, she pushed him with a little more strength, “Oh, Moying, let me go first!”","Li Moying pursed his thin lips, feeling a little unhappy.","After waiting for several hours, he waited for his wife to show up, but the little fox refused to let him hug her!","He received a light hug perfunctorily, before he was pushed away mercilessly!","Li Moying reached out and grabbed Huang Yueli’s wrist, not only did not let go of her, but even forcefully wrapped his arms around her.","“Moying?” Huang Yueli’s face blushed slightly, “Why are there so many people? Hey, let me go first.”","It was only then that she realized that the two of them were still in the training grounds but there seemed to be a lot more people here than before she entered the Illusion Array. Li Shihong and the others also appeared here at some point!","What exactly was going on?","Although she stayed in the Illusion Array for quite a long time just now, she did everything she could, and it wouldn’t last more than a day, right?","Li Moying took advantage of the moment when she was stunned and walked forward with her in his arms, “I want to see your points too, why don’t we go together?”","Huang Yueli always felt that there was something wrong with these words.","However, before she could figure it out, Li Moying had already walked towards the stone tablet with his arms around her.","The crowd standing around the stone tablet saw the two people approaching, and they all backed away in a hurry, looking at the beautiful couple with deep awe.","Huang Yueli walked to the front of the stone tablet, and after a closer look, her face suddenly collapsed, her mouth pouted, looking extremely annoyed.","“What? How did this happen? I only have such few points!”","Her arrogant and complaining expression was extremely cute in Li Moying’s eyes.","However, when these words were heard by the other cultivators present, they were so surprised that they almost fell to the ground on the spot!","In the end, she seemed quite dissatisfied?","How could such a thing happen?!","Even if it was only a fraction of her points, everyone present will not be able to laugh anymore, alright? And she was still not satisfied?","It’s so infuriating when people compare themselves to others!","Li Moying was not surprised at all, he knew how strong his little fox is, raised his hand to touch her delicate face, and tidied up her messy hair due to the repeated battles, before laughing softly: “Your points are already very high.”","Huang Yueli glared at him and harrumphed: “How is it high? Hmm? Not even two-thirds of yours! This is not normal!”","Li Moying smiled and shook his head, as he dotingly planted a kiss at the corner of her lips, and said: “This is the score I only got after entering the Illusion Array for the tenth time. When I participated in the trial for the first time, I didn’t have such high points as you!”","Huang Yueli blinked her eyes and looked at him suspiciously, “Really? Impossible?”","Li Moying looked upright, “It’s true, I remember it clearly, my points were 200 points lower than you!”","Huang Yueli couldn’t believe it even though he looked as if he was swearing."]},{"number":3927,"title":"Chapter 3927 Super High Level of Flirting (3)","paragraphs":["3927 Super High Level of Flirting (3)","Thinking about it again, what Li Moying said was also reasonable. It was the first time she entered the Illusion Array and she lacked experience. In addition, the time of comprehension in the tower was not very long. It was normal that there would be a gap with Li Moying’s record. But that’s all.","The talents of the two of them were similar, and the points of the first trial must not be much different. It was possible for any one of them to be higher by a bit.","This difference of 200 points, under the base of 100,000, was actually the same as no difference.","However, Huang Yueli was quite happy when she thought that she had won her husband.","“Hmph, do you know how powerful your wife is now? If you don’t obey me in the future, I’ll beat you up and lock you up in the firewood room, and you won’t be allowed to eat for three days!” She raised her chin proudly and waved her small fist towards Li Moying’s handsome face.","Li Moying lowered his head and cooperated obediently, “Yes, yes, don’t worry, my lady, I promise to be obedient!”","Huang Yueli was satisfied now.","Li Shihong watched the interaction between the two of them from the sidelines, his eyes almost popping out.","Originally, when he saw Huang Yueli coming out, he had already prepared thousands of words to bring the two of them together, but in the end, he couldn’t say a single word!","On the one hand, he didn’t find a chance to intervene at all, and on the other hand, because he was too surprised, his mind went blank.","Although Li Shihong already knew that Li Moying and Huang Yueli were attracted to each other, he never imagined that the relationship between these two people would be like this!","In his imagination, Li Moying’s personality was cold and indifferent, and he would definitely not take the initiative.","As for Huang Yueli, although he didn’t understand it, there was no genius girl in the God Realm that was not arrogant .","But now? What did he see?","Li Moying was actually like an ordinary boy who is in love, trying to please the girl he likes so much, he was so clingy that he can’t bear to look directly at her!","In order to coax his wife, he opened his mouth and talked about all kinds of nonsense.","He also said that “the score in the first trial was 200 points lower than yours”, clearly 200 points higher, alright?","Although for geniuses like them, the difference of a few hundred points makes no difference at all, it’s just a factor of luck, but this does not prevent Li Shihong from having a new understanding of Li Moying!","This kid’s proficiency in wooing girls was super high. They still wanted to teach him, but in fact, they couldn’t even match Li Moying with a single finger.","And Huang Yueli didn’t react too much. He had never seen a girl who could act like a baby better than her. Just a smile and a look in her eyes were so sweet that people couldn’t take their eyes off.","If he didn’t know that her points were still on the front of the stone tablet, he wouldn’t believe it even if he was killed. This was a proud girl with a god-level talent.","Not only that, the natural intimacy of the two of them is not like a young couple who have only known each other for a month, but rather like an old married couple. Everything seems so natural and in harmony...","Li Moying has more than 180,000 points, ranking first.","There will not be many who can reach 100,000 in the future. Huang Yueli’s score of 110,000 has already squeezed into the top ten.","Huang Yueli made some calculations, and felt that if she worked harder and tried a few more times, she still had a good chance of catching up to Li Moying.","It’s just a pity that the God Realm’s Grand Meet is just around the corner, and she has no time left.","When the Grand Meet is over, her identity will be exposed, and it is estimated that she will not have the opportunity to come to the Cloudy Qilin Clan for a while."]},{"number":3928,"title":"Chapter 3928 Super High Level of Flirting (4)","paragraphs":["3928 Super High Level of Flirting (4)","It will take a long time to break Li Moying’s record and truly realize her dream of holding her husband down and wielding a small leather whip...","Huang Yueli pondered secretly for a while, and suddenly felt something was wrong.","The surrounding environment is a bit too quiet...","When she came out just now, she clearly saw many people around, but now, no one spoke.","After thinking about it for a while, Huang Yueli understood.","A smile flashed in her eyes, the corners of her mouth slightly raised and she looked towards the crowd.","When Li Shihong saw Huang Yueli looking over, he was excited for a while, and was thinking of saying something, so he hurriedly asked this peerless genius to settle the marriage with Li Moying.","However, Huang Yueli’s gaze just swept across his face and did not stop, but looked behind him.","Li Shihong suddenly remembered something and looked back.","Standing behind him was Li Zijun with a pale face!","At this time, Li Zijun had long since lost her previous smugness and she couldn’t even pretend to be calm.","Her forehead was covered with cold sweat, her face was uglier than that of a dead person, and her body was trembling non-stop.","Li Zijun never dreamed that the girl who looked weak and slender, who seemed to have no talent in martial arts, was actually a true peerless genius!","She was not a heaven-level genius but an extraordinary god-level genius!","She was the proud daughter of heaven who could be compared with the Young Master!","At this moment, Li Zijun regretted it to the extreme. If she had known that Huang Yueli had such talent and strength, she wouldn’t have dared to provoke her even if she had given her a hundred courage? Not to mention raising a bet against the other party!","Thinking about it now, Huang Yueli’s calm and composed attitude at that time, as well as the time she spent studying in the tower, have already explained a lot of problems.","It was because she herself was dazzled by jealousy, she insisted on ignoring these things, thinking that Huang Yueli was a fool and deliberately pretended to be like that.","It turns out that the real fool was herself!","Huang Yueli walked towards Li Zijun, stopped not far from her, and said, “Miss Zijun, the bet between us can be said to have come to fruition now, right?”","Thinking of Li Leyun’s current situation, Li Zijun was extremely upset.","Li Leyun is already doomed to miss the God Realm’s Grand Meet, offended the Young Master and the future Young Madam, and will definitely not be trained by the family in the future.","Could it be that she will become like this too?","Seeing that Li Zijun couldn’t even speak, Huang Yueli couldn’t help laughing, “Miss Zijun, you don’t have to be afraid of becoming like this. I don’t eat people, I just want to confirm with you that I won this bet, right?”","Li Zijun nodded hurriedly, “Yes... yes...”","Huang Yueli raised a smile, “That’s good, everyone has heard it, I won this bet, I have the strength and qualifications to enter the training ground, I don’t want to hear people say that Moying is selfish by covering me, or any other gossip.”","She emphasized emphatically that her eyes scanned everyone present.","Everyone came back to their senses, and quickly patted their chests to express their loyalty.","“Young Madam, don’t worry, it’s only natural for you to enter the place of experience, who dares to talk nonsense? They don’t understand any rules!”","“We are all loyal to the Young Master. Whoever dares to talk nonsense, I will be the first to tear him apart!”"]},{"number":3929,"title":"Chapter 3929 Lucky! (1)","paragraphs":["3929 Lucky! (1)","“That’s right, that’s right! The Young Master is right in whatever he does, and anyone who dares to oppose the Young Master is a person with ulterior motives!”","The cultivators all looked extremely sincere, and said all sorts of shameless remarks.","The corner of Huang Yueli’s mouth twitched after hearing it.","How afraid were these people of Li Moying?","After all, they were all geniuses who were ranked among the top in the Ancient God Realm, but they were all behaving in such a manner? It didn’t seem to fit their identity?","What she didn’t expect was that although the cultivators of the Cloudy Qilin Clan usually respect Li Moying, they would not put themselves in such a low position like dust.","Today is like this, the main reason was simply because... Huang Yueli’s talent was too heaven-defying!","Thinking that the Young Master of their family not only has amazing talent, but will soon marry a wife who was equally talented...","Just thinking about it makes people tremble all over.","At this time, it was just a pure reaction to curry favor with Li Moying and Huang Yueli.","Huang Yueli nodded in satisfaction, without looking at Li Zijun again.","It was as if they were just strangers who had nothing to do with each other. They just had an unintentional bet and fight. After the bet was over, they went their separate ways.","Until Huang Yueli walked away, Li Zijun maintained an extremely stiff posture, full of fear, and couldn’t calm down for a long time.","She thought that if she offended a peerless genius like Huang Yueli this time, she would definitely end up miserable.","After all, Li Leyun’s lesson from the past was still there.","But who knows, Huang Yueli seems to have forgotten her.","Even Li Shihong was a little strange, he glanced at Li Zijun, thought for a while, and said: “Divine Doctor Li, I’m very sorry these days, Zijun is still young, and we as Elders have indulged her too much, that’s why she offended you. How about this, for my sake, I’ll disqualify her from participating in the God Realm’s Grand Meet, and go to the punishment hall to face the wall and think about her mistakes...”","When Li Zijun heard this, her face was full of unwillingness, and she felt extremely aggrieved.","Participating in the God Realm’s Grand Meet, to show her talent to the entire God Realm, and to gain more honors and resources, this has been her ambition since she was very young.","She has also worked hard for this for more than ten years, and she was confident that she can get at least the top 20 rankings.","However, no matter how unwilling she was, Li Zijun didn’t dare to utter any nonsense. She was much smarter than the spoiled Li Leyun, and knew that Li Shihong first said that he would punish her for her own good.","Huang Yueli will definitely become the Young Madam of the Cloudy Qilin Clan in the future. She has cheated the other party like this today, and she knows that the other party will not calm down easily.","If Li Shihong doesn’t punish her now, in case Huang Yueli holds grudges, Li Zijun won’t be able to hang out in the Cloudy Qilin Clan in the future.","Why don’t simply take the initiative to admit her mistakes now...","Thinking of this, Li Zijun suppressed the depression in her heart, and bowed to Huang Yueli and said, “Divine Doctor Li, it’s because I’m not good at learning, I don’t have eyes and I offended you, I’m going to the punishment hall... ...”","Huang Yueli looked at Li Shihong and Li Zijun in surprise.","When she came to her senses, she quickly stopped, “Eh? Wait, when did I say I was going to punish Li Zijun?”","The cultivators present were all startled.","Li Shihong couldn’t believe such a thing would happen, and asked suspiciously: “But, she offended you just now...”"]},{"number":3930,"title":"Chapter 3930 Lucky! (2)","paragraphs":["3930 Lucky! (2)","Geniuses with a talent were usually aloof and very arrogant.","What’s more, Huang Yueli was still a god-level genius?","Huang Yueli shook her head and said, “Actually, it’s not really an offense. Miss Zijun’s behavior was indeed not prudent, but it’s not all her responsibility...”","The main reason was that her husband’s peach blossoms were simply too prosperous!","Thinking of this, she took the time to turn her head and glared at Li Moying.","Li Moying, who was innocently standing by the side, touched his nose, completely wondering why his little fox was so angry?","“Anyway, what happened today should have taught her a lesson. You should know that in the world of cultivation, there are people beyond the skies. No one should be underestimated. Even Moying and I have never dared to underestimate anyone. As long as you practice diligently, everyone will have a chance to climb to the top.”","Huang Yueli looked at Li Zijun and said calmly.","The cultivators present did not expect that Huang Yueli would say such a thing, and they were stunned for a moment.","But after thinking about the deep meaning in it carefully, and bowing their heads, they both felt a little ashamed.","As the geniuses of the younger generation of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, they were indeed usually proud and arrogant, and they didn’t pay attention to the clansmen of the same generation.","Like Li Zijun’s proposal to Huang Yueli for betting today, they usually did not do less. From their point of view, making a fool of a martial artist with less talent than themselves is just like having fun, and it’s no big deal.","Otherwise, there wouldn’t be so many people. As soon as they heard the news of Li Zijun’s bet with Huang Yueli, they rushed over to watch.","Usually, they don’t feel that they are at fault, but now after seeing Huang Yueli’s talent, they suddenly realize that they were just frogs in a well.","Li Shihong and several elders looked at each other, and they all saw a trace of surprise and shock in each other’s eyes.","Having a god-level talent is already remarkable enough, but Huang Yueli has such a brilliant mindset at such a young age, which is even more unbelievable.","The Cloudy Qilin Clan really got lucky this time!","Such a flawless girl unexpectedly fell from the sky and became their Young Madam.","Huang Yueli looked at Li Shihong, “Patriarch Li, let’s leave this matter as it is. Miss Zijun’s cultivation is not easy, and she has been waiting for a long time for the opportunity to participate in the God Realm’s Grand Meet. So don’t ruin her future just because of this little thing.”","Even after she said that, Li Shihong naturally wouldn’t object, so he quickly agreed.","Compared with Huang Yueli’s aggressive behavior, the provocative actions she did before were simply too stupid to be seen!","No wonder the Young Master fell in love with her.","Even if she is not a god-level genius, with such a demeanor, she is enough to be a powerful Madam!","“Thank you... Thank you...” Li Zijun whispered.","Huang Yueli heard her thank you, but didn’t take it to heart.","Although her words sound high-sounding, in fact, she was not a saint and she will not forgive anyone who offends her.","However, Li Zijun and Li Leyun were still different.","In order to become Li Moying’s fiancée, Li Leyun dared to do anything. In the secret realm of the Saint Iniquitous Shadow, she really almost killed her. If she hadn’t been so lucky, she might have died then and would never have the chance to reunite with her husband."]},{"number":3931,"title":"Chapter 3931 Lucky! (3)","paragraphs":["3931 Lucky! (3)","In contrast, Li Zijun did nothing more than just placing a bet with her, and now she has been severely slapped in the face. Huang Yueli has seen such kinds of people a lot, hence she didn’t feel anything at all.","The most important thing is that there aren’t many top heaven-level geniuses in the Cloudy Qilin Clan. Now that Li Leyun has been dispatched, if she is unhappy because of her, Li Zijun will also be locked up. The ranking of the God Realm’s Grand Meet will be much lower.","A virtuous lady like her naturally has to think for her husband.","Huang Yueli felt that she was doing too beautifully, the corners of her mouth were raised, and she smiled very proudly.","As soon as Li Moying lowered his head, he saw the sly smile of his little fox, and his heart skipped half a beat.","So adorable...","He stretched out his hand and pulled her into his arms. He lowered his head, just wanting to steal a kiss on her face.","But who knows, the moment he was about to “speak”, Huang Yueli just turned around, threw herself into his arms, looked up at him, and said, “I should be fine now, right? Then...we can go back. Have you rested?”","Hearing this, Li Moying frowned slightly, looked her up and down, and asked anxiously, “What’s the matter? Little Li’er, what’s wrong with you?”","Huang Yueli blinked her big eyes innocently, and shook her head, “I’m fine, my health is very good! It’s just that I’ve been fighting for a few hours, so it’s not a big problem. I’m worried about you... Is your health getting better? How long has it been? The comprehension in the tower this time is also very energy-consuming, I don’t want to waste all the time I spent recuperating for you.”","Li Moying glared at the little woman in his arms. He didn’t think he was so weak!","Does his little fox think he was a fragile piece of paper?","This was simply a provocation to a man’s dignity!","However, when he glanced over the faint shadow under Huang Yueli’s eyes, he immediately changed his mind, “Well, it’s getting late, we should go back and rest.”","It’s not him who should rest, but Huang Yueli!","Li Moying turned around and bid farewell to Li Shihong.","But Li Shihong was still immersed in the shock just now, and couldn’t recover. He never thought that the two of them would leave so soon.","“Uh, wait! I haven’t said anything yet! Moying, you don’t need to be in such a hurry, right? Besides, the small bamboo house you lived in before was a bit too simple after all. Moying’s health is also very good now. It’s almost there, there’s no need to recuperate in such a secluded place, why not move back to the original residence? Also, Divine Doctor Li, what do you think about Moying?”","Huang Yueli paused, glanced at Li Shihong, and blinked, “Hmm? Just like what you saw? Patriarch, do you have a problem?”","How dare Li Shihong have any problems!","He waved his hands hastily, “No, no problem! I mean... cough cough, look at our Moying, how do you feel?”","Huang Yueli had a suspicious look on her face, and she didn’t understand what he was up to.","She turned her head to look at the handsome face of her husband, and sighed sincerely: “He looks good!”","Li Shihong slapped his thigh excitedly, “He does, doesn’t he? Let’s not talk about anything else, just this face, you won’t be able to find any one more handsome than him in the entire God Realm! And he doesn’t talk to others usually, especially to those of the opposite gender! He only talks to you, so this goes to show that he is honest!”"]},{"number":3932,"title":"Chapter 3932 Lucky! (4)","paragraphs":["3932 Lucky! (4)","“It’s rare to see such a handsome yet honest man!”","“Not to mention, our Moying, after all, is the Young Master of the Cloudy Qilin Clan. When he succeeds in cultivation, I will pass on the position of Patriarch to him. Then you will be the Mistress of our Cloudy Qilin Clan!”","Having said that, Li Shihong paused, and said with a smile on his face: “Divine Doctor Li, take a look, we, Moying, are still worthy of your conditions, right?”","“Uh, this... this...” Huang Yueli was in a daze, unable to speak for a long time.","She never expected that Li Shihong would recommend Li Moying so hard.","Listening to this tone, it seems that Li Moying was a man who was too old to get a wife, and he was going to sell him cheap like a Chinese cabbage?","Huang Yueli couldn’t react for a while, but Li Shihong misunderstood what she meant, thinking that she was still young and still hesitating.","So, he decided to try harder, “Divine Doctor Li, pardon me, an old man for saying something that shouldn’t be said. The relationship between a man and a woman is the purest when they are young. Since you and Moying have a good impression of each other, you should settle the marriage as soon as possible. This way, you can cultivate peace of mind, right? Besides, you don’t have the support of a big force now, and you probably don’t have enough resources for cultivation, right? If you marry into our Cloudy Qilin Clan, you will be a member of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, and I promise to take all the resources for you to help you with your cultivation!”","“Well, ahem...Master Patriarch, it’s a bit too hasty to talk about this now...”","Huang Yueli didn’t expect Li Shihong to be so enthusiastic. He just found out that she has outstanding talent, so he wished Li Moying could marry her right away!","She also had the initial thought that Li Shihong was so opposed to Li Moying’s marriage to a human before which was why he tried to stuff him with so many women from the Cloudy Qilin Clan. So even if he had changed his attitude, it will take some time for this and he won’t show her any favor so soon.","In the end, it turned out that she was thinking too much.","Li Shihong was indeed worthy of being a big man in charge of a powerful force in the God Realm and his skin was unusually thick.","There was a complete change in attitude so quickly!","Li Shihong said: “Hurry? How is there no hurry? If one isn’t a cultivator, girls from ordinary families get married in her teens and a girl your age already has two babies in her arms! It’s not too early to fix this marriage. Don’t worry! Besides, I didn’t ask you to get married immediately, how about getting engaged first?”","As Li Shihong said, he winked at the Elders behind him, signaling them to help persuade them.","The Elders also understand how important it is to the family to have a young lady with god-level talent.","At this moment, everyone’s small thoughts had to be put aside, and they all came together to help Li Shihong persuade.","Surrounded by them and listening to their ‘persuasions’, Huang Yueli felt embarrassed to the extreme!","How afraid were they that Li Moying won’t be able to find a wife! Those words of praising her and promoting Li Moying at the same time were hilarious!","Huang Yueli was extremely embarrassed by what they said, but the Elders had good intentions and praised her to the sky.","She felt extremely helpless with this sudden turn of events.","In desperation, she thought of Li Moying, and quickly asked the man behind her for help with her eyes.","However, Li Moying just smiled lightly and raised an eyebrow at her.","A mischievous smirk appeared on his usually indifferent face, which made him look even more attractive."]},{"number":3933,"title":"Chapter 3933 Lucky! (5)","paragraphs":["3933 Lucky! (5)","Huang Yueli stared at that incomparably handsome face, dazed for a moment.","Even though she has seen her husband countless times, she still sighs from time to time, how could there be such a handsome man in the world! What’s more, he was hers!","But then, she woke up amidst the persuasion of the Elders.","Seeing that Li Moying just smiled and didn’t speak, Huang Yueli became angry for a while.","This man clearly did it on purpose!","Does seeing her so embarrassed make him happy?","Huang Yueli puffed up her cheeks, and gave her husband a vicious look.","Seeing that the little fox was angry, Li Moying was also alert, so he quickly straightened up and coughed heavily.","“Ahem, Patriarch, Elders, please stop talking about this matter. Little Li’er and I have already understood your kindness, but the girl gets shy easily, with all of you surrounding her like this and asking her to marry, how embarrassing is it?”","Hearing this, Huang Yueli’s eyes widened, and she couldn’t help but twist Li Moying’s back hard where no one was looking.","This man... made it sound like she couldn’t wait to marry him, but she was just too embarrassed to say it.","Li Moying’s brows twitched slightly.","His little fox was really too ruthless!","Really worthy of being a peerless genius with god-level talent...","However, his rhetoric succeeded in persuading Li Shihong and others.","The Elders looked at Li Moying, then at Huang Yueli, and finally closed their mouths, and did not continue to persuade.","Even Li Shihong said: “It turned out to be like this... um, um, it’s true that we didn’t consider this point. Girls can be a bit reserved. So let’s go back to rest early, Divine Doctor Li. About you and Moying, I’d better talk to your Senior Brother about the marriage!”","Huang Yueli originally smiled after hearing the previous few words, and felt that the problem had been solved.","But when she heard the second half of his words, the expression on her face froze again.","Li Shihong was too persistent!","Huang Yueli hurriedly said: “My Senior Brother is also tired, let’s talk about this later! Don’t be so anxious.”","Li Shihong frowned, and wanted to say something else.","But Li Moying coughed lightly again and interrupted him, “Patriarch, Little Li’er is right. After all, I also represent the Cloudy Qilin Clan. If the marriage is too hasty, it will lose face for our family! Let’s talk about it after Little Li’er and I have participated in the God Realm’s Grand Meet. The two of us have already made an agreement before, and we will officially talk about marriage after the God Realm’s Grand Meet.”","“Ah, that’s right, it will be the God Realm’s Grand Meet soon!”","Li Shihong was so busy thinking about Li Moying’s marriage that he had already forgotten about it.","At this moment, when he suddenly remembered, he was even more hesitant.","For occasions like the God Realm’s Grand Meet, all the major forces in the God Realm will send a large number of disciples, and the Patriarch or the Supreme Elder will personally lead the team to participate in the competition.","In previous years, the Cloudy Qilin Clan also attached great importance to such competitions, and tried every means in order to earn a higher ranking.","But this year, Li Shihong has nothing to worry about at all, because he has the trump card of Li Moying in his hand!","Li Moying must be the number one in this year’s God Realm’s Grand Meet!","Oh, no, the Cloudy Qilin Clan now has not one god-level genius, but two!"]},{"number":3934,"title":"Chapter 3934 Lucky! (6)","paragraphs":["3934 Lucky! (6)","After having Huang Yueli, Li Shihong could already imagine what kind of disturbance this young couple would cause in the God Realm’s Grand Meet!","At that time, all the Ancient God Clan and all the powerful forces in the God Realm will envy the good luck of the Cloudy Qilin Clan.","The Sacred Phoenix Clan, who have fought against them for so many years, will be completely trampled under their feet and they will never be able to stand up again!","In order to ensure Li Moying and Huang Yueli’s performance in the God Realm’s Grand Meet, it was indeed inappropriate to hold an engagement ceremony for them at this juncture.","However, if it is really undecided, Li Shihong was also worried that he’d have sleepless nights and that something will happen.","For some reason, he always had a bad premonition that Li Moying and Huang Yueli’s marriage, which was a match made in heaven, would not go very smoothly.","Li Shihong pondered for a moment before asking: “This...you really don’t want to get engaged first?”","Li Moying didn’t say anything, his expression was indifferent and he remained silent.","Huang Yueli shook her head decisively.","“No, I think it’s good as it is now. We’ll talk about anything after the God Realm’s Grand Meet is over.”","According to her plan, she was going to expose Huang Sanbai’s true colors during the God Realm’s Grand Meet.","At that time, her identity as a clansman of the Sacred Phoenix Clan will also be revealed.","At the same time, she will return to the Sacred Phoenix Clan to fight for the status and resources that should belong to her.","When Li Shihong knows her true identity, it’s probably impossible for him to agree to her engagement with Li Moying. Moreover, the Cloudy Qilin Clan and the Sacred Phoenix Clan will still be arguing!","Therefore, Huang Yueli didn’t want to expose her talent at first, she wanted to deal with the matter of the Sacred Phoenix Clan quietly first, and then consider the matter of marrying Li Moying.","Now, although she couldn’t hold back for a while and showed her true strength, she definitely has no plan to stay in the Cloudy Qilin Clan as the Young Madame, at least not now.","In order to avoid unnecessary trouble, she is not going to get engaged at such a sensitive time.","When Li Shihong heard this, his face immediately collapsed, looking very disappointed.","However, Huang Yueli’s attitude was so firm, he couldn’t say anything more.","Thinking about it again, with the talent and strength of their Young Master of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, it was impossible for Huang Yueli to find someone who was better. The marriage between the two had at least 80% certainty...","Huang Yueli showed a smile, “Alright, then I’ll... say... goodbye... Hey, Moying, let me down!”","The girl’s sweet smile suddenly froze.","Because just when she was halfway through her words, she suddenly felt her legs fly into the air, and she was carried horizontally!","Huang Yueli leaned back, unable to maintain her balance, so she could only quickly hug the neck of the man in front of her.","“Put...let me down!”","Huang Yueli’s face was blushing, and her white teeth were biting her lips.","There were so many people here! And even so many Elders!","Can’t this man restrain himself a little?","However, when Li Moying heard her tender voice, not only did he not let go, but he raised his hand and patted her butt, “Be good, don’t move around, I can’t carry you steady! When you’re tired, just rest on my shoulder. Just wait a while, and I’ll take you back right away.”"]},{"number":3935,"title":"Chapter 3935 Lucky! (7)","paragraphs":["3935 Lucky! (7)","Huang Yueli really wanted to say, she has feet and can walk, so she doesn’t need him to carry her back!","However, Li Moying’s deep gaze fell on her face, and the suppressed light in his eyes made her secretly startled.","At the same time, the scorching palms carrying her were full of threats.","Huang Yueli instinctively felt that she was a little insecure, so she wisely chose to shut up.","Anyway, since there was someone who was willing to work, it’ll be a waste if she doesn’t enjoy it, and she’s too lazy to put in the effort herself!","The beautiful girl leaned in the arms of the tall and handsome man coquettishly, and was regarded as a treasure by him, so he carried her back carefully.","Seeing the backs of the two leaving, the cultivators present felt violent storms in their hearts, unable to recover their calmness for a long time.","Those girls who had a crush on Li Moying had their hearts broken to pieces.","The male god in their hearts, who is high above him, has an owner!","Moreover, he was so gentle, considerate, and caring for the girl he admired!","In the past, they all thought that it would be impossible for a peerless genius like Li Moying to find a woman who matched him, so since everyone is not worthy of him, it is good to look up to him together, at least there was still a chance to become part of the Young Master’s harem. The first step was to get closer to him.","But now...","Seeing that Huang Yueli easily hooked up with their male god, it seemed effortless.","What’s more, her talent, strength, and beauty made them so convinced that none of them could even utter the word “jealousy.”","They were too far away from Huang Yueliu.","People were like the bright moon in the sky and they were just the gravel on the ground.","What qualifications did they have to say that they were jealous of her?","But Li Shihong and the other Elders were in completely different moods. After Li Moying and Huang Yueli left, they looked at each other and almost jumped up from the ground in excitement.","“Great, really great! This is really God’s blessing for our Cloudy Qilin Clan! We have two god-level geniuses at once, and in another twenty years... no, maybe only ten years, our Cloudy Qilin Clan will definitely become the number one force in the God Realm, and maybe even unify the God Realm!”","“Hahaha, that’s all right now. The Sacred Phoenix Clan used to have a lot of geniuses in their younger generation. They fought against us everywhere, and openly robbed us of the treasures that our Cloudy Qilin Clan liked! Now it’s all good, ha ha!”","The hatred between the Cloudy Qilin Clan and the Sacred Phoenix Clan has a long history, but the two sides were basically equal in strength. Every time there was a conflict, there would be a winner or loser but no one can completely suppress the other.","But now, the situation is different.","The Elders seemed to have seen the grand occasion where the Cloudy Qilin Clan dominated the God Realm, and the cultivators of the Sacred Phoenix Clan could only kneel at their feet and beg for mercy, and all smiled.","...","Li Moying returned to the residence with his wife in his arms, and saw that it was getting late.","Originally, because Li Moying was recuperating in the bamboo hut, they didn’t let anyone serve them in order to keep it secret, so Huang Yueli was usually responsible for cooking.","However, Huang Yueli spent a lot of energy in the Illusion Array today.","Although she didn’t show it at all when she was in the training grounds, and because of the excitement, she didn’t feel too much fatigue.","However, when she leaned against Li Moying’s broad chest, she began to feel the tiredness sweep her away."]},{"number":3936,"title":"Chapter 3936 Lucky! (8)","paragraphs":["3936 Lucky! (8)","Huang Yueli unknowingly moved closer to Li Moying’s neck, covered her mouth, and yawned gracefully.","However, her eyes weren’t focused as it slowly closed.","She didn’t wake up until she was carried back to the room by Li Moying and placed on the bed.","“Ah, have we arrived at the courtyard yet? I actually fell asleep! It’s so late, shall I go whip up something to eat?”","Li Moying pushed her down on the bed, not letting her get up, “If you’re sleepy, go and sleep for a while, and I’ll wake you up when dinner is ready.”","When Huang Yueli heard this, her eyes widened in horror, “What? Are you going to cook yourself?”","It’s not that she looks down on her husband, it’s just that Li Moying’s culinary skills absolutely did not match his martial arts talent!","In her previous life, he tried several times to cook and feed his little fox himself, but every time he ended in a tragic failure!","The prepared food not only failed to make Huang Yueli feel the happiness of being taken care of by her husband, but almost poisoned her a few times!","Over time, she learned to behave well.","Or else they could just eat the Satiety Pill!","Although it has no taste at all, at least it’s not that bad and it won’t kill you, right?","But now, Li Moying actually wants to go into the kitchen and cook personally?","Huang Yueli was murmuring in her heart that she was still young and she had just ascended to the God Realm not long ago, so she still wanted to live for a few more years!","Li Moying looked at her exaggerated little expression, and immediately had a complete insight into what was going on in her heart.","The corner of his mouth twitched, feeling that his self-esteem had been severely hit. A peerless genius like him actually did something bad, and he was disgusted by his wife!","So Sad! How depressing!","He doesn’t believe in love any longer!","“Moying? Don’t scare me! Don’t be impulsive or get too excited! Well, I don’t think your cooking is bad, it’s just that you have been working so hard in comprehension for so long in the training grounds. I don’t want you to work so hard! How about this, anyway, everyone knows about our relationship already, so why not just find some maids to come over...”","Li Moying looked at the cautious look of the girl in his arms and felt angry!","Li Moying stretched out her finger, flicked her on the forehead, and snorted coldly: “Don’t worry, why am I willing to let you eat the ‘pig food’ I made? I saw your Senior Brother when I came in just now, so just leave it to him!”","Huang Yueli laughed wryly in embarrassment, and said in a flattering tone: “Husband, your memory is really good! I admire you so much!”","The “pig food” that Li Moying mentioned was decades ago, and they had just met in the previous life.","But it was the first time for Li Moying, who was the proud son of heaven, to cook by himself, and wanted to cook for the girl he liked.","As a result, the food that was made received a two-word evaluation from Huang Yueli!","At that time, Huang Yueli didn’t like Li Moying at all. She just thought it was too annoying for Li Moying to stalk her because of her high talent and good looks.","Who would have thought that after so many years, this man still remembers a casual sentence she said back then...","Huang Yueli suddenly felt a little guilty...","“Well, that...Senior Brother’s cooking is quite delicious and he cooks pretty fast. We’ll just have to wait for a while.” She quickly changed the subject."]},{"number":3937,"title":"Chapter 3937 Is About To Advance...Again(1)","paragraphs":["3937 Is About To Advance...Again(1)","Li Moying stared at her little face which was trying to cover up her embarrassment for a while. This made Huang Yueli’s hair stand on ends.","“What... what’s wrong?”","Li Moying glanced at her and said casually, “Little Li’er, you know Liu Buyan’s cooking so well, it seems that you often eat his cooking?”","“Uh...huh?” Huang Yueli was stunned for a moment.","After she reacted, she realized that she had said the wrong thing again, and almost bit off her tongue!","Li Moying asked, this was a death sentence question!","In order to change the subject, she didn’t have time to think about it and it seemed that she had jumped from one pit into another!","She hastily coughed twice, thinking quickly in her mind, “Ahem, that... that... Actually, I haven’t eaten much, it’s all based on imagination, imagination! After all, brother is a cultivator with fire attributes, and he is a Spirit Medicine Master. Any cultivator who is good at refining medicine or weapons is not bad at cooking. From this, it can be inferred that the Senior Brother should be alright...”","“Well, yes! That’s right!”","Huang Yueli nodded heavily to show her sincerity, secretly proud of her wit.","Li Moying snorted coldly, and reached out to pinch the tip of her delicate nose.","“Little clever ghost, don’t think you can fool me! You dare to eat something cooked by other men behind my back. It’s too late now. I’ll settle the score with you later!”","Huang Yueli stretched out her hand to cover her pinched red nose, pitifully, “You are so fierce, you even abuse your wife! Look, it’s all red!”","Li Moying was choked by her exaggerated acting skills.","It’s obviously because the little fox’s skin was too tender and if he kissed too hard, it would even leave red marks. How did it become him abusing his wife?","However, looking at her big dole eyes staring pitifully at him, no matter how jealous Li Moying might be, it would melt away when he faced this lethal gaze.","Huang Yueli saw his expression, and knew that his anger had subsided, and the corners of her mouth were secretly raised.","Her husband has always been soft rather than tough, so as long as she has a good grasp of his temper, he was easy to deal with.","However, what did Li Moying say “too late”?","Just when she was wondering, suddenly, there was a knock on the door.","Li Moying pulled open the door, “You are too noisy!”","His contemptuous and disgusting gaze made Liu Buyan furious, “You, you... what do you mean? Do you know how precious my hands are as a genius doctor? Do you know what it is to ask me to turn on the stove and light the fire once? The price? I condescend to cook for you, and you still have this attitude? Hmph, I’ll rather feed the food to the dog, which is better than feeding you!”","Liu Buyan turned around angrily and left!","However, he was so excited, ninety percent of it was intentional.","Just waiting for Li Moying to bow his head to beg him after being threatened by him!","But who knows, after Liu Buyan walked several steps, he didn’t hear Li Moying’s request to stay, which made him feel a little bit embarrassed to step down for a while.","Could it be that the person surnamed Li really doesn’t plan to eat anymore?","At this moment, Li Moying said: “Alright, if you insist on going, I can’t stop you. Little Li’er, your Senior Brother would rather feed the dog than give it to you.”"]},{"number":3938,"title":"Chapter 3938 Is About To Advance...Again (2)","paragraphs":["3938 Is About To Advance...Again (2)","Hearing this, Liu Buyan’s footsteps stopped, and his body froze suddenly.","Li Moying’s indifferent voice sounded again: “Little Li’er, you are so pitiful, so you were bullied like this... It’s alright, we’ll ignore him! Husband will take you to eat something good!”","Liu Buyan jumped up all of a sudden, and ran back, wishing he could punch Li Moying on the spot, right in the face!","This guy was really good at sowing discord!","“What nonsense are you talking about? I’m talking about giving food to dogs and not giving it to you, and it’s not that you won’t give it to Junior Sister. You shouldn’t be here to provoke the relationship between us!”","It’s all because he was provoked by Li Moying just now, so he couldn’t speak rationally.","He almost forgot that the reason why he was willing to cook just now was not because he obeyed Li Moying’s order, but because he wanted to feed his Junior Sister!","It was his ultimate goal to let his Junior Sister who has consumed a lot of energy today to have a good rest.","She was almost led astray by Li Moying, a black-bellied man!","Liu Buyan rushed in front of Li Moying, and his fists had already hit the opponent’s face. Seeing that there was still less than an inch away, he would meet Li Moying’s handsome and angry face.","But at this moment, he suddenly felt a chill emerge from around his body.","... Li Moying’s profound energy suddenly appeared!","Liu Buyan froze all of a sudden, the fist was already too close, but he couldn’t go any further.","And his own body seemed to be frozen, and the profound energy in his body seemed to have stopped flowing.","Damn, this kid’s strength is actually stronger than before!","The gap between the two was too great! This time, he won’t be intentionally retaliated by that kid, will he?","However, what Liu Buyan was worried about did not happen.","At the next moment, the pressure around him suddenly disappeared.","Liu Buyan was exhausted, his legs were sore and weak, and he almost sat down on the ground. Fortunately, there was a chair next to him, and he quickly supported it, so he could stand firmly.","From behind Li Moying, a small head popped out, “Moying, what are you doing? Don’t bully my Senior Brother!”","Li Moying looked innocent, and raised his hands, “In all honesty my lady, I have been wronged!”","“It was he who said first that I would give you the food for the dog. I didn’t do anything to him, and he still wants to beat me! Then I can only defend myself a little, and you don’t want to see your husband disfigured, do you?”","Liu Buyan rolled his eyes and almost fainted out of breath.","This kid’s ability to reverse black and white was really getting stronger and stronger!","It was obvious that Li Moying was jealous again for some reason, and deliberately found a reason to trick him, but he still dared to slander him?","Huang Yueli couldn’t listen anymore, so she raised her hand and twisted Li Moying’s arm.","“You’re enough! Can you stop bullying Senior Brother because of trivial things? I really only ate once... twice... cough cough, well, none. Anyway, I haven’t had a meal cooked by Senior Brother! Why are you so narrow-minded?”","Liu Buyan was quite happy to hear that Huang Yueli defended him like this. She felt that this Junior Sister still had a conscience, and he didn’t love her for nothing.","However, when he heard the back, he almost fell to the ground.","He finally knew why Li Moying was suddenly jealous."]},{"number":3939,"title":"Chapter 3939 Is About To Advance...Again (3)","paragraphs":["3939 Is About To Advance...Again (3)","No wonder!","Li Moying’s cooking was so unpalatable, why not allow others to cook it?","He was simply a conniving person!","This was a disease, it must be cured! Let the Junior Sister see the true face of this horrid man with no tolerance!","After Liu Buyan figured it out, he couldn’t be more angry, and just wanted to complain about Li Moying.","However, Huang Yueli glanced at him at this moment, signaling him not to speak, and then turned to Li Moying, “Husband, I’m so hungry, can we go eat now? If you don’t let me eat, you your poor wife is about to faint from hunger.”","Li Moying looked at the little fox beside him, his gaze softened obviously.","“Alright, I’ll take you to the clan’s dining hall for dinner.”","Huang Yueli hurriedly pulled him back, “I... I’m very hungry, I want to eat now, I can’t wait. Anyway, there is something ready-made, I don’t want to run so far, I can go to sleep after eating quickly. What’s more, I’m really very tired, I’m so sleepy!”","Huang Yueli covered her mouth and yawned delicately.","Li Moying frowned slightly, but he was still reluctant in her heart.","However, seeing the faint dark circles below her eyes, he still couldn’t bear to let his wife suffer from hunger.","“Alright, then try to make it palatable. If it’s too unpalatable, just spit it out, don’t force yourself...”","Liu Buyan heard the words and almost vomited blood, “Do you think the food I cook is the same as the pig food you cook?”","“What did you say?” Li Moying’s eyes suddenly turned cold, and he glared at Liu Buyan.","Seeing that the two were about to quarrel again, Huang Yueli couldn’t care less about anything else, so she quickly put on her shoes and ran outside, “Hurry up, hurry up, I’m going to starve to death!”","Seeing that she was running away, the two of them had no choice but to chase after her immediately.","After eating, Huang Yueli lay down early.","Li Moying did not practice assiduously until late at night as usual, but took a shower and returned to the bedroom.","He stared at the girl’s beautiful little face under the dim light, his eyes gradually became gentle, his fingers brushed lightly on her pink lips, and then he bent down and stole a kiss on the corner of her lips.","However, it didn’t take long for him to feel the girl next to him twist her body slightly uneasy.","Li Moying immediately opened her eyes, “Little Li’er, you haven’t fallen asleep yet? Didn’t you say that you are very tired today?”","Originally, Huang Yueli didn’t want to disturb Li Moying’s rest, so she pretended to be asleep on purpose. Now that she was discovered, she turned around and faced Li Moying.","Li Moying held her slender waist, pulled her into his arms, and looked down at her, “What’s wrong?”","Huang Yueli raised her small hand, grabbing the thin underwear material on Li Moying’s chest, “Well, that... I’m thinking about what happened during the day today.”","He knew it!","Li Moying frowned slightly, “What’s wrong? Is there something wrong? You did a great job today, even the Patriarch and the others were overwhelmed by your strength. After today, I’m afraid no one will dare to seduce me again. Now, isn’t it just what you want?”","Huang Yueli puffed her cheeks, “That’s right, but I don’t think I should show such a strong strength. This is going to be troublesome. I guess Patriarch Li will keep staring at me. Then the possibility of revealing my identity becomes greater!”","After all, the Illusion Array she passed today was a rare exception."]},{"number":3940,"title":"Chapter 3940 Is About To Advance...Again (4)","paragraphs":["3940 Is About To Advance...Again (4)","The battle situation inside the Illusion Array was completely blocked and one can’t see anything at all from the outside and can only see the changes in points on the stone tablet.","But if she participates in other trials, or performs some special exercises under Li Shihong’s attention, then the Sacred Phoenix aura on her body cannot be concealed at all.","Her identity could easily be revealed!","During the trial today, she didn’t think too much about it, but now that she thought deeper about it, she was a little too impulsive.","Li Moying stroked her long black hair, and the smoothness under his fingers was like silk, which made him narrow his eyes slightly and his heart softened.","“Don’t think about it too much. It’s only a few more days to the God Realm’s Grand Meet. From the Cloudy Qilin Clan to the Floating Sea, even if we take an airship, it will take several days to reach, so we will leave in three days. So as long as you are careful, it is impossible to reveal your secrets.”","Li Moying really felt that his little fox was thinking too much.","No matter what Li Shihong and the others had in mind, what they wanted Huang Yueli to do was actually useless.","Li Moying thinks he has enough strength to protect his little fox.","However, Huang Yueli still shook her head, “No, I can’t go to Floating Sea with the Cloudy Qilin Clan.”","“Why?” Li Moying was startled.","Huang Yueli said: “Because, I feel like I’m going to advance soon.”","This sentence stunned the Young Master who had always remained calm even if Mount Tai collapsed!","He stared blankly at Huang Yueli, blinked and blinked again.","It took a while before he finally found his voice, “You said...you are going to advance again? So fast, this is really too fast!”","After Huang Yueli came out of the secret realm of the Saint Iniquitous Shadow for the second time, she was already at the early stage of the Heart Profound Realm.","At this age, with this level of cultivation, even Li Moying himself could only say that she was far beyond the reach of all aspiring cultivators!","However, this was not the most amazing thing.","Because, it has only been less than a month now, and Huang Yueli was about to advance again. As long as the advancement is successful, she will become a cultivator in the middle stage of the Heart Profound Realm!","A middle-stage Heart Profound Realm less than twenty years old...","In other words, Huang Yueli will soon become the youngest mid-stage Heart Profound Realm cultivator in the history of the God Realm!","With such an unbelievable speed of cultivation, even Li Moying, who is known for his outstanding talent, couldn’t help being amazed from the bottom of his heart.","Huang Yueli looked at her husband and nodded slowly, “Well, that’s true... I didn’t expect it to be so fast. In fact, when you were unconscious, I practiced with you, and some of the evil qi in your body also entered my body and transformed into my profound strength, and my cultivation level has improved significantly at that time. However, due to my lack of experience, I still didn’t know how to use this profound strength.”","“This time, after entering the training grounds, I learned several top-level combat secrets in the tower. These aren’t only helpful in actual combat, but also can be said to be classic methods for controlling the profound power in the body. I’ve attained a considerable amount of comprehension in the trial of the Illusion Array, which made the profound power in my body burst out and hit the dantian, and I vaguely feel that I am already standing on the threshold of advancement!”"]},{"number":3941,"title":"Chapter 3941 Supports His Wife No Matter What (1)","paragraphs":["3941 Supports His Wife No Matter What (1)","Li Moying was in a daze for quite some time before he came to his senses.","When they were in danger in the secret realm of Saint Iniquitous Shadow, both of them absorbed the evil qi gathered at the entrance.","However, that evil qi in Huang Yueli’s body has been successfully refined in the secret realm.","After arriving at the Amethyst Paramount Palace, she and Li Moying cultivated together, and she had also obtained part of the evil qi from Li Moying.","The combination of these two parts of evil qi actually far exceeds what Li Moying obtained.","So, in fact, in this accident, Huang Yueli got more benefits than Li Moying, and her strength improved even more, which was quite normal.","Seeing him in a daze, Huang Yueli stretched out her slender fingers and poked the muscles in his chest.","“Moying, are you asleep? Did you hear me?”","Ever since Li Moying started double cultivation with her, whenever he got close to her, he would easily become irritable, but this little girl always teased him on purpose!","He quickly grabbed the little hand that was making trouble, “Well, I’ve been listening to you. It’s a good thing that your strength has improved so quickly, but are you sure you want to advance so quickly? You have advanced several times recently. There is a risk that the foundation will be unstable.”","Huang Yueli pouted, “I’ve thought about this too. However, the God Realm’s Grand Meet is about to start, I thought about it, and I should go ahead and advance. There are so many geniuses in the God Realm, like that Jun Sihan, although he is not a god-level talent, but he must have had other adventures, and his strength is not inferior to yours. If I don’t even have a cultivation base in the middle stage of the Heart Profound Realm, it will be very difficult to get a good ranking.”","Huang Yueli’s worries were not unreasonable.","On the surface, the biggest forces in the God Realm were the Twelve Ancient God Clan Clans. In fact, there were still many hidden forces hidden in unknown places.","These forces rarely reveal themselves to others, and they are not as influential as these Ancient God Clan Clans. However, the number of geniuses in the forces and the quality of inheritance are not necessarily inferior to those of the Ancient God Clans.","The more strength, the more protection.","“So, you’ve already made up your mind?” Li Moying asked with raised eyebrows.","Huang Yueli nodded, “Well, I’ve already made up my mind. Let’s save these problems for later. After the God Realm’s Grand Meet, we’ll find a place to cultivate slowly. I won’t even think about advancing then and stabilize my foundation.”","Li Moying leaned over, kissed her on the face, and said in a low voice, “Just do what you want, is there anything you need me to do?”","As long as his little fox wants to do something, no matter whether it is right or wrong, he will firmly support it to the end!","Even if he has different ideas, he can at most put forward his own point of view. If Huang Yueli insists, he will still stand by Huang Yueli’s side.","When Huang Yueli advances, a large amount of fire attribute energy will definitely gather around her.","With the concentration of her blood, at that time, there will definitely be an obvious manifestation of the Sacred Phoenix!","No matter how stupid the people of the Cloudy Qilin Clan are, they will definitely be able to guess her true identity when they see the manifestation of the Sacred Phoenix.","When the time comes, let alone being flattered so much by Li Shihong, she might turn into a street mouse in a few minutes.","Therefore, she can only sneak out with Li Moying."]},{"number":3942,"title":"Chapter 3942 Supports His Wife No Matter What (2)","paragraphs":["3942 Supports His Wife No Matter What (2)","A smile flashed across Li Moying’s eyes, “Are you looking down on your husband’s ability? How can such a trivial matter not be handled well? Since you said so, then we should leave early and set off tomorrow morning! If there is any accident on the road, the time for the God Realm’s Grand Meet will be missed.”","“Husband, you are so kind!”","Huang Yueli showed a surprised smile, stretched out her arms and hugged her husband’s waist, leaned over, and kissed the corner of his mouth with her pink lips.","The little fox delivered herself to the door, how could the big bad wolf let her go?","Li Moying immediately turned the tides, grabbed Huang Yueli’s delicate body, turned over, and pressed her under his body, deepening this kiss...","The next morning, the two got up early.","Huang Yueli’s Sky Phoenix Ring space was large enough, and she has always had the habit of storing valuable treasures in the space.","Therefore, they didn’t have much luggage to pack, and they will be ready to go out soon.","However, just as they were about to leave, they were discovered by Liu Buyan.","“You, you... You two, where are you going?”","Liu Buyan saw that they were dressed lightly, carrying a bundle in their left hand, and holding their baby (Wang Cai) in their right hand, looking as if they were going to elope far away, and suddenly had a bad premonition.","Huang Yueli stopped in her tracks, and said apologetically, “Ahem, Senior Brother, Moying and I plan to leave early now, and go to Floating Sea to participate in the God Realm’s Grand Meet...”","“What? You really want to sneak away! How can you just leave me like this, brother? How can you do this? When you need me, you call me Little Dear and kick me away when you don’t need me? Where’s the conscience? Doesn’t it hurt?” Liu Buyan’s face flushed red, feeling that he was full of anger!","The corner of Huang Yueli’s mouth twitched.","What is this all about? She never called him Little Dear...","Her Senior Brother has been busy refining recently, and he tried the pills by himself after refining it. Could it be that he took the wrong medicine?","Li Moying asked directly, “Did you take the wrong medicine?”","“You, you...you are too much! Have you forgotten? We are sworn brothers, and I am your elder brother! Is this how you talk to your elder brother?” Liu Buyan jumped in anger, if he knew he couldn’t beat him, he would already have grabbed Li Moying and given him a good beating.","Li Moying’s face didn’t change at all, “You didn’t take the wrong medicine, it means you’re getting old and your memory is failing. Who has ever called you ‘Little Dear’? Damn...it’s disgusting.”","Liu Buyan gritted his teeth, “This is a metaphor, do you understand the metaphor?”","“You.. this...”","Seeing that the two were about to quarrel again, Huang Yueli quickly grabbed her husband and walked up to Liu Buyan at the same time.","“Ahem, Senior Brother, listen to me first...”","“Say it, you can say it if you have the ability! Tell me what the crime is for abandoning your Senior Brother!” Liu Buyan snorted coldly, crossed his arms, and looked at Huang Yueli.","Huang Yueli knew she was wrong, so she immediately explained, “Senior Brother, I’m going to advance soon, so I can’t stay in the Cloudy Qilin Clan any longer, and I can’t go to Floating Sea with them. I want to go there first with Li Moying and advance in a secluded and hidden place...”","“What? You’re about to advance again?? But, you didn’t just...” Hearing this, Liu Buyan’s eyes almost popped out."]},{"number":3943,"title":"Chapter 3943 Supports His Wife No Matter What (3)","paragraphs":["3943 Supports His Wife No Matter What (3)","His Junior Sister was extremely talented – this, he knew best.","However, her talent was so high that it still took him by surprise!","He really couldn’t believe it.","Huang Yueli nodded firmly, “Well, the time between these two advancements is indeed relatively short. However, for the sake of my performance in the God Realm’s Grand Meet, I still want to advance earlier.”","Liu Buyan was left tongue-tied and speechless for a while.","His Junior Sister’s talent was simply perverse, he, as her Senior Brother was too useless in contrast!","He looked at Huang Yueli, then at Li Moying, and suddenly became happy again, “Hahaha, so your advancement speed is much faster than that rascal, Li Moying! Very good, Junior Sister , you are really amazing! According to this trend, your strength will surpass this guy in a few years! At that time, you can just kick him away! Senior Brother will find you another handsome and a more obedient...”","“Shut up! A waste material that hasn’t even touched the Heart Profound Realm, don’t let your imagination run wild!” Li Moying gave Liu Buyan a cold look.","There was an overwhelming urge to immediately blow this guy away.","Even the breath around him has begun to fluctuate violently.","Fortunately, Huang Yueli kept staring at the two of them, reacted in time, and took another step diagonally and stood right in the middle of the two of them.","“Ahem, Senior Brother, please don’t say that, I only have my husband in my heart! There is no one who is more handsome and considerate than Moying. Thank you for your kindness...”","Hearing his own little fox’s praise, Li Moying’s coercive momentum was restrained a little.","Huang Yueli said again: “We didn’t mean to sneak away, but we just saw that Senior Brother had been refining all night last night and didn’t want to disturb you. I left a letter for you, it’s on the table in the main hall, you can read it once you’ve come by.”","Huang Yueli’s explanation made Liu Buyan’s resentment a little less.","However, he was still not satisfied.","“What’s the use of leaving a letter? Didn’t you just throw me here? Do you have any conscience? You dumped me just to get along with each other alone? This is the Cloudy Qilin Clan!”","Huang Yueli patiently continued: “Senior Brother, don’t get me wrong. Moying and I want to avoid the people of the Cloudy Qilin Clan and leave secretly. We must take some dangerous detours, I’m afraid it will be unsafe for you to follow us .Besides, your current identity is the Senior Brother of the Young Madame in the future. Who in the Cloudy Qilin Clan would dare to offend you? Yesterday, you could see that the Patriarch wished he could bow to you! At that time, you will go to the Floating Sea with the airship of the Cloudy Qilin Clan. It’s much safer than to go with us...”","Liu Buyan said angrily: “Don’t explain anymore, explaining is just covering up! Anyway, I’m not afraid of any danger, I want to go with you!”","“Uh, but...”","Seeing Liu Buyan being so firm and decisive, Huang Yueli was shaken.","Thinking about it carefully, it’s not that Liu Buyan has no ability to protect himself. Judging from his performance in the Illusion Array, he has at least reached the strength of an ordinary genius of the Ancient God Clan.","“Alright then, Senior Brother, just come with us...”","Hearing this, Li Moying’s face turned completely dark, “No way!”","He managed to find a reason to persuade Huang Yueli to get rid of Liu Buyan, that sticky candy!","He hasn’t lived in a two person world with his beloved Little Li’er for a long time.","In the end, Liu Buyan actually came out of the alchemy room at this juncture, pretending to be crazy, and desperately wanting to be with them!"]},{"number":3944,"title":"Chapter 3944 Supports His Wife No Matter What (4)","paragraphs":["3944 Supports His Wife No Matter What (4)","Liu Buyan really succeeded, all his thoughts were in vain.","Huang Yueli was taken aback.","Her husband seldom disagreed with her. Generally, Li Moying agrees with everything she decides.","Why was he so resolute today?","“Because... well, he’s still too good at it, and will hold us back.”","Li Moying casually found a reason.","Huang Yueli said: “Uh... Senior Brother’s strength is not as good as ours, but he still has the ability to protect himself? Besides, we are not going out for training this time, and we will not go to dangerous places on purpose. As long as we are careful, we should be fine.”","“The two of us have relatively small goals, and with him, there are three of us. When we slip away, the possibility of being discovered increases!”","“Uh, this...three people are alright, not much more than two...”","“But Liu Buyan is unreliable and often acts foolishly! Look, he pointed his finger at my nose, and he was about to scream in a moment! He yells at every turn, how could he not expose us?”","Huang Yueli turned her head subconsciously.","Behind her, Liu Buyan really stretched out his finger and pointed at Li Moying’s nose, looking like he was about to start scolding.","Originally, Liu Buyan was already on the verge of complaining, but when he heard Li Moying’s words, he forcefully blocked the words that were about to erupt.","At this moment, her entire face was blushing, his fingers were trembling non-stop, and now he was very angry.","However, in order to prove that he is not a man who “yells at every turn”, he still has to hold back, and he still can’t swear!","Liu Buyan scolded Li Moying countless times in his heart for being shameless!","Li Moying raised his chin and gave him a provocative look.","Hmph, he can continue dreaming! Want to fight him? Want to ruin his trip with Little Li’er? It’s all just a dream!","Li Moying felt that he had the chance to win, and the corners of his mouth couldn’t help but twitch.","But at this moment, his little fox’s voice suddenly sounded, “Alright, alright, stop arguing. How about this, Senior Brother, let’s go together.”","Liu Buyan jumped up in surprise, “Junior Sister, you are indeed my real Junior Sister! You are the one who treats me best!”","Li Moying’s face was extremely dark.","But the person who spoke just now was not Liu Buyan that annoying guy, but his beloved little fox.","Huang Yueli’s beautiful eyes flickered, and she noticed Li Moying’s tense and serious expression, and couldn’t help smiling.","She walked over slowly, grabbed Li Moying’s sleeve, and shook it gently.","“Why is your face so ugly? Are you angry?”","Li Moying groaned, “No, which eye of yours saw me angry?”","“Both eyes.” Huang Yueli resolutely exposed it.","“You...”","Before Li Moying got angry, Huang Yueli took his arm and raised her pretty face.","“Alright, don’t be angry. My Senior Brother is not familiar with the people of the Cloudy Qilin Clan. If he doesn’t want to stay here, don’t force him. It’s not too much trouble to go together. The airship is so big, and we can still squeeze in one more.”","It’s true that the airship can sit, but he doesn’t want to drag along a noisy person that he hates every day!","Li Moying was extremely resentful, but he didn’t dare to object when his own wife spoke up.","He could only look at Huang Yueli sadly, and let Liu Buyan follow them in resignation."]},{"number":3945,"title":"Chapter 3945 Heaven Level Waste (1)","paragraphs":["3945 Heaven Level Waste (1)","Amethyst Paramount Palace in the early morning was shrouded in a white mist.","This mist was not ordinary water vapor, but the rich heaven and earth profound energy gathered by the Amethyst Paramount Palace through spiritual veins and arrays, condensed in the air.","And this is the embodiment of the strength of the Cloudy Qilin Clan.","There are only a handful of forces in the entire God Realm who can gather so much profound energy in the family base.","Taking advantage of the few people in the early morning, Li Moying took his own wife and an annoying oil bottle and sneaked out in the mist.","They didn’t dare to go through the main entrance, and went directly over the back hill.","Li Moying used the identity token to open the defensive array of the back mountain, and then released a small airship from his interspatial ring.","Compared with the luxurious airship normally used by the Young Master of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, this airship looks pitifully plain from the outside.","However, after boarding the airship, Huang Yueli was pleasantly surprised to find that although the airship was small, it had a lot of functions. There were various arrays engraved on the inner and outer walls, among which the acceleration array was boasted.","The airship was small and exquisite, and the air resistance it encountered when flying was also small, so it will have an advantage in speed.","Coupled with these carefully drawn acceleration arrays, it can be said to be even more powerful!","As soon as the three of them boarded the airship, Li Moying activated the array, and the airship flew out like an arrow from the string, several times faster than the airship Huang Yueli had been on before!","“Wow! It’s so fast! It’s really fast! In this way, we estimate that it only takes four or five days to reach the Floating Sea, which is two or three days faster than going with the large army of the Cloudy Qilin Clan! I can have a few more days to practice and advance.” Huang Yueli said excitedly.","Li Moying nodded, “That’s right, but just in case, it’s better for you to start advancing early. I’ve already selected a retreat location for you. Between Black Tortoise Clan Continent, there is a mountain called Cumulus Peak. That area is relatively dangerous, and most cultivators dare not enter it easily. However, I passed by this place once, and I went to investigate. The inside of Cumulus Peak is actually a volcano. The attributes are very strong, and it used to be the cultivation cave of a powerful fire element cultivator in ancient times.”","Hearing this, Huang Yueli’s eyes lit up, and she already understood.","“You want me to enter the interior of Cumulus Peak to advance? But, since it’s the cave of an ancient power, it’s not so easy to get in, right?”","Otherwise, I’m afraid it would have been ransacked by cultivators.","Li Moying smiled, and stretched out his hands to straighten her hair that was blown by the wind in mid-air.","“It’s really not easy to enter there, but that’s mainly because of the lack of talent of ordinary cultivators. As long as you can break through the encirclement of the surrounding monsters and reach the position above 2,000 meters from Cumulus Peak, you will find the entrance of the cave to enter. , you have to pass the trial of that fire element power.”","“Trial?” Huang Yueli blinked suspiciously, “What kind of trial?”","“If not, what?”","Before Huang Yueli could speak, Liu Buyan couldn’t help but interjected and asked.","Among the three of them, he was the only one who was not a god-level talent.","Li Moying glanced at him like an idiot, “How do I know? I’m not that kind of waste material?”"]},{"number":3946,"title":"Chapter 3946 Heaven Level Waste (2)","paragraphs":["3946 Heaven Level Waste (2)","“Tch!”","Liu Buyan almost spat out a mouthful of blood, thankfully he managed to hold it in.","What? Someone actually said he was a waste?","As a cultivator who ascended to the God Realm from the Lower Realm for less than a year, his actual combat ability has reached the level of an ordinary genius of the Cloudy Qilin Clan. This was simply a miracle, wasn’t it?","Even he himself wants to worship himself!","But...","Facing Li Moying and Huang Yueli, he didn’t even have any confidence.","Li Moying said he was a waste, but he really had no way to refute it.","So angry!","Feeling Liu Buyan’s murderous gaze, Li Moying’s heart was not disturbed.","“I told you a long time ago that you can only be a hindrance when you come here, and you are the one who insisted on following.”","Seeing that her Senior Brother was about to lose his temper, Huang Yueli quickly glared at Li Moying to tell him to shut up, and at the same time looked at Liu Buyan sympathetically, “Senior Brother, it’s fine. If not, you can just wait for us on the airship. Anyway, I must succeed in advancing within five days, and it won’t take long.”","“Oh... alright...”","Although Liu Buyan felt aggrieved, there was no other way.","Li Moying ignored him, and looked at the girl in his arms again, “Little Li’er, it will take four hours to get to Cumulus Peak from here, let’s go back to the cabin to rest. This airship is driven by the array, it will automatically warn when it encounters danger, so there is no need to guard here.”","“Alright.” Huang Yueli had no objection, and nodded obediently.","Li Moying hooked his little fox’s waist and was about to leave.","Liu Buyan yawned, and slowly followed behind the two of them, planning to find a room to rest for a while.","He prefined pills all night, and originally planned to catch up on sleep during the day, but as soon as he stepped out, he saw the letter Huang Yueli left for him, so he came out in a hurry to stop people, he didn’t sleep for a moment, and now he was exhausted to the extreme.","But when he reached the door of the cabin, he froze.","“What is this... what is this?” Liu Buyan exclaimed in surprise.","Li Moying glanced at “idiot” again, “The cabin? Have you ever been on an airship?”","“But... why does this airship only have two cabins!”","“This airship is originally a speed type. In order to increase the speed, it can carry very few passengers. Only two cabins can be built, which is already considerable! Many speed type airships have only one cabin, or some, even none.” Li Moying explained slowly.","Liu Buyan’s expression changed.","Although it was the first time for him to take an airship from the God Realm, but looking at the condition of this airship, he could deduce that what Li Moying said should be true.","“Alright then. I’m going to rest first, I’m so sleepy...yawn!”","Liu Buyan stretched his waist, then walked to one of the rooms.","“Come back!” Li Moying frowned and shouted to stop.","Liu Buyan turned around, frowned and looked at him, “What’s the matter? Don’t you guys also want to rest?”","Li Moying snorted coldly, “That’s right, Little Li’er and I also want to rest, so there is no room for you. If you want to rest, you can sleep on the deck!”","Liu Buyan’s eyes widened in disbelief, and he raised his finger to point at his nose, “What? You asked me to sleep on the deck? Did you make a mistake? At the altitude we are at now, there are various turbulent currents in the air, and the temperature is very low, very dangerous! How can I sleep on the deck? I am a weak cultivator!”"]},{"number":3947,"title":"Chapter 3947 Heaven Level Waste (3)","paragraphs":["3947 Heaven Level Waste (3)","Li Moying said disapprovingly: “That’s none of my business. I told you a long time ago that there are too many people on the airship to live in. You are the one who insisted on following.”","He used the reason yet again!","Liu Buyan took a deep breath and told himself not to beat up people with higher talents than himself, it’s not cost-effective. He repeated the above steps a dozen times before he calmed down.","“Don’t try to fool me! How can you not fit in? I don’t think these two cabins are very small. You and my Junior Sister are husband and wife, and living in the same room is more than enough. I can live in this small one. There is no problem!”","“There is a problem, of course there is a problem.” Li Moying was completely unmoved.","Liu Buyan gritted his teeth and asked, “What’s the problem?”","Li Moying glanced at him disdainfully, “I am the owner of this airship, so I should live in a room alone, and Little Li’er is the hostess of this airship, so she should also live in a room alone. And you... are just a servant , still want to live in a single room?”","Liu Buyan really wanted to tear off Li Moying’s annoying mouth!","At the same time, he was extremely depressed.","Thinking of him, Liu Buyan was also very personable, a good-looking talent, no matter in the lower realm or in the god realm, he can be regarded as an outstanding genius.","But in the end, when I met Li Moying, no matter in terms of talent or appearance, he couldn’t compare to him. That’s fine, but he couldn’t even quarrel with him?","Huang Yueli listened to the two arguing with each other tit-for-tat, shook her head amusedly, and stood up.","“Alright, alright, Moying, don’t tease my Senior Brother on purpose. Isn’t it good for the two of us to live in one room? Usually I tell you not to live with me, but you still don’t want to! Senior Brother, hurry up, go and rest, four hours will soon pass, hurry up.”","What should I do if his wife was making her own decisions?","For Li Moying, there was only one way.","That was... to be obedient...","Li Moying pursed his lips, and looked at his little fox with dissatisfaction.","What do you mean “tease him”, he has never “teased” Liu Buyan, alright?","He was despising Liu Buyan, from the bottom of his heart!","What misunderstanding did his little fox have about the two of them?","“Dear Husband, you are so kind! I like you the most. Get some rest, I’m tired...”","When Li Moying heard the soft voice of his little fox, a gleam of light suddenly flashed in his bottomless black eyes.","The dissatisfaction just now has also disappeared.","He let Huang Yueli drag him into the room, and closed the door.","With a “bang”, Huang Yueli was pushed to the wall.","...","Four hours later, Huang Yueli, Li Moying and Liu Buyan reunited on the deck.","Huang Yueli pursed her lips uncomfortably, feeling a little numb, and then gave the man beside her a displeased look.","The expression on Li Moying’s face was much more relaxed than before, and there was even a hint of a faint smile at the corner of his mouth.","Liu Buyan looked at Li Moying’s happy face, and felt extremely disgusted in his heart!","Quickly turned away his gaze and looked forward.","Not far away, a towering mountain peak appeared in front of my eyes.","“This is Cumulus Peak, right? The profound energy around is so strong!” Huang Yueli blinked her big eyes and asked curiously."]},{"number":3948,"title":"Chapter 3948 Heaven Level Waste (4)","paragraphs":["3948 Heaven Level Waste (4)","Li Moying nodded and said, “That’s right, we’re here.”","As soon as he finished speaking, the airship suddenly shook violently.","However, the vibration didn’t last long, and after about a dozen breaths, it subsided.","However, the speed of the airship has obviously slowed down.","Seeing that Huang Yueli and Liu Buyan were somewhat puzzled, Li Moying hurriedly explained: “There is a special defensive array around the cave, which will not attack cultivators who approach, but there is a kind of resistance that will draw everything closer from the air. Everything on the peak is pushed outward. The closer you are to the peak, the greater the resistance. Therefore, it is impossible to directly enter the cave by airship.”","What Li Moying said was quickly verified.","Due to the influence of drag, the speed of the airship was getting slower and slower...","In the end, it was almost impossible to move an inch, and almost stopped.","Li Moying made the airship slowly land on a small piece of flat ground in the forest.","“Alright, Little Li’er, let’s go there now.”","Huang Yueli nodded, then turned to look at Liu Buyan, “Senior Brother, will you be waiting here, or are you going with us?”","Liu Buyan said without hesitation: “Of course I’m with you!”","“However, when you reach the peak, if you can’t enter the cave, you will be in danger...” Huang Yueli was a little worried.","“What are you afraid of? If there is danger, then there is danger. I am also a cultivator, so am I still afraid of danger? Besides, there may be some opportunities in the cave. If I can get in, I may miss the opportunity, it will be a big loss! Junior Sister, you won’t think of me as an ordinary Spirit Medicine Master who has no fighting power?” Liu Buyan was very dissatisfied.","Huang Yueli realized that she had said the wrong thing, and hurriedly said: “No, I just said it casually.”","This was indeed her own mistake.","When Liu Buyan was in Soaring Heavens Continent, he was one of the real top powerhouses, and he practiced with them many times.","Although after arriving in the God Realm, Liu Buyan’s talent is obviously not as good as the two of them, but this does not affect her Senior Brother’s strong heart!","The three of them stopped hesitating and set off immediately to the top of the mountain.","On the road leading from the mountainside to the peak, there were many spirit beasts of various levels.","Among them, the weakest one was equivalent to a cultivator in the middle stage of the Dream Profound Realm.","As they went up, the strength of the spirit beast was also increasing.","Moreover, many of these spirit beasts appeared in groups, and their attack power was terrifyingly strong.","For ordinary cultivators, this situation was really terrible. It was enough to make nine out of ten cultivators feel helpless, feel as if they were on the verge of death and couldn’t wait to flee!","The remaining few who can continue to climb up can only barely cope.","But for them, dealing with these spirit beasts was indeed not difficult at all.","Not to mention Li Moying and Huang Yueli, let alone spirit beasts in the middle of the Heart Profound Realm, even spirit beasts in the Dao Profound Realm, they can handle one or two.","Even for Liu Buyan, killing a few groups of spirit beasts in the middle stage of the Heart Profound Realm was not too difficult.","The three of them were like breaking through bamboo, all the way up, and it took less than an hour to get close to the peak.","Moreover, most of the time during this period was spent travelling, and killing spirit beasts was just a matter of convenience."]},{"number":3949,"title":"Chapter 3949 Is Also A Scumbag (1)","paragraphs":["3949 Is Also A Scumbag (1)","“Let’s hurry, that should be the cave dwelling you mentioned, right?”","Liu Buyan pointed to the roof hidden in the depths of the dense forest in the distance, and asked.","Li Moying nodded slightly, “That’s right, we’re almost there.”","“Haha, this journey is really smooth! We arrived at the cave dwelling so quickly. Hearing you mention so much about it, I thought the surrounding woods would also be fraught in danger, but in the end it wasn’t much!”","This was Liu Buyan’s first actual combat after comprehending in the training grounds, and he could clearly feel his strength improving rapidly.","!!","The spirit beasts that were very scary to him before have now become the dead souls under his knife.","This inflated his ego for a while.","Li Moying glanced at him lightly, and hit him unceremoniously: “Hurry up? How should we hurry? If it wasn’t for you, who had been holding us back, we would have already entered the cave dwelling by now.”","Liu Buyan’s face froze immediately, and he said through gritted teeth, “Do you have to do this each and every time? Li Moying, if you don’t speak, you will die, right?”","Li Moying snorted coldly, “It’s just the truth, why should I keep quiet about it?”","Liu Buyan was so suppressed that his face turned blue, but there was nothing he could do about him.","Because what Li Moying said was not wrong at all.","When they went up the mountain, Liu Buyan inadvertently attracted the attention of the spirit beasts in the woods several times, and when they were attacked, they had to stop and kill those spirit beasts.","Otherwise, with the abilities of Li Moying and Huang Yueli, it is estimated that walking through the forest all the way would not provoke a single spirit beast.","That way the speed must be at least twice as fast.","The two were bickering, but there was no delay in their feet, and they quickly moved towards the target.","However, after they walked a few miles, they suddenly heard someone talking in the woods.","The three of them were startled, looked at each other, and closed their mouths at the same time.","Then, they quickly lightened their steps, and looked in the direction of the sound under the cover of a giant tree.","“Ughhh..uh...uhh...I’m really exhausted! How...how far is it to the top of the mountain?”","“It was really too thrilling just now. Those spirit beasts are all equivalent to the strength of cultivators in the middle stage of the Heart Profound Realm! I... I almost died! If it weren’t for Young Miss Qingling, I would have been torn in half!”","“Yeah, it’s terrible! I’ve heard that Cumulus Peak is dangerous, but only after coming here that I truly understand...”","A group of young cultivators were sitting in a clearing in the forest. All of them were covered with dust, and some of their clothes even had a lot of blood stains on them. Their expressions were even more shocking.","Obviously, they just experienced a life-and-death battle.","“Alright, get up for me! It’s just a few spirit beasts. Let’s see how scared you are? Cultivators should be fearless in pursuit of the pinnacle of martial arts. The real strong break through in the crisis of life and death!”","A girl’s voice resounded in the forest.","The speaker’s voice was cold, and the speed of her speech was neither slow nor fast, with a kind of indifference enough to stabilize people’s hearts.","Huang Yueli recognized the voice, she was a little surprised, and looked back at her husband, “It’s Xuan Qingling? Why did she come to Cumulus Peak?”","Li Moying was not surprised at all, “This is the junction of Cloudy Qilin and the Black Tortoise. I heard that the Black Tortoise Clan has always regarded Cumulus Peak as a training ground for the younger generation.”"]},{"number":3950,"title":"Chapter 3950 Is Also A Scumbag (2)","paragraphs":["3950 Is Also A Scumbag (2)","“So it’s like this...” Huang Yueli suddenly realized and nodded.","It seems that these people should be the leading geniuses of the younger generation of the Black Tortoise Clan.","Otherwise, it would be impossible to get so close to the peak of the mountain.","Come to think of it, the Cloudy Qilin Clan also saw that the God Realm’s Grand Meet was imminent, so they sent all the geniuses of their clan out to practice.","Xuan Qingling, who possesses the top-level talent of a heavenly genius, should be the leader of the team.","Huang Yueli was quite surprised to meet the training team of the Black Tortoise Clan here.","However, she didn’t care too much about it.","When she was in White Tiger Continent, she once had contact with Xuan Qingling because of the sale of the blueprints for Spirit Armaments.","At that time, Xuan Qingling’s personality and ways of doing things were very suitable for her taste, so she chose the Black Tortoise Clan as her partner to produce standard Spirit Armaments that had been improved by her.","Originally, when she saw Xuan Qingling, she should have said hello and asked about the sales of those Spirit Armaments.","However, now that she is in a hurry to reach the top of the mountain, hence she has no time to catch up with others.","After thinking about it, Huang Yueli gestured to Li Moying, signalling them to leave secretly.","However, just as they turned around and were about to move on, Liu Buyan accidentally stepped on a branch under his feet, causing his body to lose his balance.","Fortunately, he grabbed a vine beside him in time, shook it a few times, and managed to stand still.","However, the crisp sound of the branches breaking still attracted the attention of the young cultivators in the open space.","“What’s going on? Could it be that another spirit beast has come over?”","“No, it’s dangerous! Be careful, everyone!”","“Hurry up, get up and set up the array!”","The young cultivators were in constant danger at Cumulus Peak, and they were already frightened. They became nervous when they heard any movement.","On the other hand, Xuan Qingling seemed very calm. She frowned slightly, listened carefully for a moment, then raised her hand, “Alright, don’t be nervous, this is not a sound made by a spirit beast, but someone...”","“Is there anyone?”","“Who will come to Cumulus Peak at this time?”","Xuan Qingling didn’t explain, but raised his voice, and shouted towards the forest, “Fellow cultivator across the way, we are members of the Black Tortoise Clan. I don’t know where you are from? Everyone is practicing here at the same time. It can be regarded as fate, can we come out and meet?”","Now that the other party said so, Huang Yueli had no intention of hiding her whereabouts anymore, and walked out with Li Moying and Liu Buyan.","“So it’s a friend of the Black Tortoise Clan. We were rude just now. We saw you resting here and didn’t want to disturb you, so we planned to take a detour up the mountain. We didn’t expect you to hear it.”","All the cultivators present were taken aback for a moment. They didn’t expect that the three cultivators who came out from behind the bushes had such outstanding looks.","No matter men or women, they are all top-notch looks that can’t be picked out in the entire God Realm.","Xuan Qingling recognized Li Moying immediately, and couldn’t help but gasp, “Li...Young Master Li! It’s you! I didn’t expect that you would come to Cumulus Peak to practice. These two are...”","Her gaze swept over Huang Yueli and Liu Buyan who were beside Li Moying.","She felt that Huang Yueli looked familiar, but she could not remember where they had met.","After leaving the Cloudy Qilin Clan, Huang Yueli didn’t bother to change her appearance, so now it was her real appearance, which Xuan Qingling had never seen."]},{"number":3951,"title":"Chapter 3951 Is Also A Scumbag (3)","paragraphs":["3951 Is Also A Scumbag (3)","Li Moying didn’t intend to explain further, but just nodded towards Xuan Qingling.","“Young Miss Qingling, it’s a pleasure to meet you! This Young Master Liu is my Sworn Elder Brother. I’m just bringing him and his Junior Sister to practice for a few days. You don’t need to pay attention to us.”","Xuan Qingling hurriedly smiled and said, “Young Master Li, please do what you want.”","After Li Moying greeted her perfunctorily, without saying anything else, he stretched out his hand to hold his own wife’s little hand, gave Liu Buyan another glance, and led the two of them to continue up the mountain.","Behind them, the young cultivators were completely frozen.","It wasn’t until the backs of the three of them were no longer visible that they realized it.","For a moment, everyone was so excited that they couldn’t suppress the excitement in their hearts at all, and surrounded Xuan Qingling one after another to ask questions.","“Young Miss Qingling, that one just now is... the Young Master Li Moying Li of the Cloudy Qilin Clan?”","“The only god-level genius in the God Realm?”","“Oh my God, he’s really just like the legends, so handsome... I’ve never seen a more handsome man than him in my whole life.”","“You women are superficial, you only know how to look at your face! Do you know how strong Young Master Li is? You don’t rely on your face to make a living!”","“Young Master Li really lives up to his reputation!”","Xuan Qingling answered the bombardment of questions from her clansmen casually, but felt a faint uneasiness in her heart.","Just now she saw that Li Moying was very close to the girl next to her, as if they were holding hands!","But, how could he do this?","Xuan Qingling remembered very clearly that Li Moying had a wife, and when he was in White Tiger Continent, he even tore up all pleasantries with Li Leyun because of that girl!","Now, how long has passed, and there was another woman by his side?","Thinking of this, Xuan Qingling couldn’t help frowning.","She cooperated with Li Yuehuang in a huge amount of Spirit Armament business, and she admired Li Yuehuang’s personality in private, so she must be on Li Yuehuang’s side.","Now that Miss Li doesn’t know where she is, but her husband, whom she has always trusted so much, blatantly brings other women out to practice...","“Young Miss Qingling, why are you silent? What should we do next? Should we follow Young Master Li and the others?”","Hearing the urging voices of the people around him, Xuan Qingling came to her senses.","“No need, Young Master Li and the others are strong. Although it is safe to follow them, but this way, there will be no effect of gaining any experience. Let’s continue killing spirit beasts all the way up the mountain. Keep your spirits up, these spirit beasts are just little beasts. They are just an appetiser, the Palace at the top of the mountain is the real training ground!”","Xuan Qingling calmed down and thought about it, and knew that it was impossible for her to accuse Li Moying.","On the one hand, she has no position, on the other hand, a god-level genius was not something she dares to offend!","She could only remind her the next time she meets Master Li Yuehuang.","“Oh, there is no good man in the world! I thought Young Master Li was an exception, but he turned out to be the same – a scumbag!”","Harems were commonplace in those in power in the God Realm. Xuan Qingling herself was born of the concubine of a big clan and her mother was a maid who was forced by an Elder.","This time, Li Moying became a complete scum in her eyes.","She shook her head and greeted her clansmen, “Alright, everyone assemble, let’s go up this road!”"]},{"number":3952,"title":"Chapter 3952 Is Also A Scumbag (4)","paragraphs":["3952 Is Also A Scumbag (4)","Li Moying didn’t know at all that a simple action of his pushed himself into the position of a scumbag.","He just wanted to save more time so that his wife could advance to the next level with peace of mind, so he sped up the speed of progress again.","Huang Yueli didn’t feel anything about his acceleration, but Liu Buyan was under a lot of pressure!","He exerted all his strength, trying to keep up with the two of them, but he was still thrown behind by a long way.","Liu Buyan didn’t believe it. Although he knew that his strength was inferior to others, he didn’t want to ask Li Moying to stop and wait for him.","He persisted silently for quite a while, not only failed to catch up with the two of them, but accidentally fell into the encirclement of spirit beasts.","It was Huang Yueli who noticed that her Senior Brother was missing and went back to find him and rescued him from the group of spirit beasts.","“Senior Brother, are you alright?” Huang Yueli looked at Liu Buyan, who had a bruised nose and a swollen face, and asked with some guilt as she scratched her nose.","Just now, Li Moying had been telling her about the situation in the cave dwelling, which attracted her full attention and left her no time to pay attention to the surrounding situation.","In the end, she didn’t even notice that Liu Buyan was lost.","Now that she thought about it, this was all a childish routine of Li Moying, the jealous king...","Liu Buyan snorted a few times, “Even if you still have a bit of conscience, knowing that you have a Senior Brother, I thought that if you have a husband, you won’t be able to take care of your own family anymore!”","“How could it be? To me, Senior Brother is like my own brother!” Huang Yueli immediately expressed her opinion.","After hearing this, Liu Buyan turned pale, raised his chin, and gave Li Moying a provocative look.","Although he was thrown away, Liu Buyan didn’t have much resentment. In the final analysis, this matter was due to his own lack of strength. Otherwise, Li Moying would not have been able to trick him so easily.","Therefore, it was most important to improve one’s own strength.","Without matching strength, no matter how much he complains, it’s useless.","After meeting up with Liu Buyan, the three of them walked for less than a quarter of an hour and arrived at their destination.","This was a very magnificent Palace, surrounded by a large area of dense forests, and with the mist condensed by the surrounding heaven and earth profound energy, from the foot of the mountain, it is impossible to see that the scale of the Palace is so large.","There were no obstacles set up around the Palace, and the three of them walked directly into the main hall.","Before the three of them, an array appeared, with red arrays constantly flashing on the periphery of the array, imbued with powerful fire-attribute energy.","“Now, are we going to enter this array?” Huang Yueli turned her head and asked Li Moying.","Li Moying nodded, “That’s right, this is a screening array, and it can also teleports. Standing in the centre of the array, the array will judge your talent level, and as long as you reach the god level, you will be directly teleported to inside of the Palace, there is a training room built in the core of the volcano, which is suitable for you to advance.”","Huang Yueli nodded, expressing her understanding.","“Alright, then I’ll go now.”","Li Moying said: “Go.”","Huang Yueli strode to the centre of the array and stayed in the middle for about a dozen breaths. Immediately afterwards, the red light around the array suddenly became extremely dazzling, wrapping her whole body in the middle.","After the light dissipated, her figure disappeared from their eyes.","Li Moying also wanted to walk to the middle of the array.","“Oh, wait!” Liu Buyan quickly grabbed him."]},{"number":3953,"title":"Chapter 3953 Huang Yueli Advances (1)","paragraphs":["3953 Huang Yueli Advances (1)","Li Moying paused and turned to look at him.","“What else is there?”","Liu Buyan asked: “You said just now that as long as you have a god-level talent, you can be teleported inside the Palace through this teleportation array. So, what if you don’t have a god-level talent?”","Li Moying didn’t speak, but just glanced at him.","Even so, Liu Buyan clearly felt the contempt expressed in the other party’s eyes.","He suddenly became angry, “You are a god-level genius, you are amazing! Alright? Hurry up, don’t waste your time here, and just speak clearly. I don’t believe that you have not done any research on this cave! You can enter the Palace, you must have obtained a lot of inheritance, how can you not know this little thing?”","Li Moying originally wanted to trick him but after thinking about it, his little fox has already entered the Palace and was probably waiting for him.","He was not willing to let Huang Yueli wait for a long time.","“After entering the array, if the cultivator’s talent level is below the earth level, he will be ejected directly. If the talent is at the sky level or the earth level, he will be sent to a trial in a secret realm. If he can pass the trial of the secret realm, he can also enter the interior of the Palace.”","Li Moying summarised all the points and briefly explained what he knew.","Liu Buyan raised his eyebrows, thoughtfully, “Trial of a secret realm? What kind of trial?”","Li Moying said impatiently: “How would I know this? I haven’t entered it before! However, I do know that the Black Tortoise Clan has always regarded the trial as a kind of experience for their clan. Like the group of people we met on the way just now, it is estimated that they all are on their way to the trial in the secret realm to train.”","“Take the trial secret realm as a training ground? Is it still possible to do this?” Liu Buyan was very surprised, “Besides, didn’t you just say that this cave dwelling was left by a strong exponent with a fire attribute? If I recall, the main attribute of the Black Tortoise Clan is water! Isn’t water and fire incompatible, why would they be training in this place?”","Li Moying said disapprovingly: “Because water and fire are incompatible, training in such an environment with strong fire attributes can better stimulate the potential of water attribute fighters. The training method of the Black Tortoise Clan is also considered ingenious.”","“Then...Water attribute cultivators can also enter the Palace and obtain fire attribute martial arts inheritance?” Liu Buyan asked strangely.","Li Moying shook his head, “As far as I know, there is no cultivator from the Black Tortoise Clan who can enter the Palace to obtain inheritance. However, this does not mean that water attribute cultivators cannot accept the inheritance. I am afraid it is just that they are not strong enough. If it doesn’t fit, the difficulty will definitely increase significantly if you want to pass the assessment of the trial in the secret realm.”","After hearing these words, Liu Buyan finally understood.","“I see...”","Li Moying thought for a while, and added a few words with rare kindness, “You don’t have to worry too much about whether you can enter the Palace. Since people from the Black Tortoise Clan have come here repeatedly for so many years, it shows that this trial of the secret realm has some origins. As long as you can go in once, you will be rewarded. The trial and assessment time is five days, and as long as you survive five days, you can be safely teleported out.”","Liu Buyan was startled, and heard something was wrong."]},{"number":3954,"title":"Chapter 3954 Huang Yueli Advances (2)","paragraphs":["3954 Huang Yueli Advances (2)","Li Moying glanced at him, “What do you think? How can the geniuses of the Black Tortoise Clan put in so much effort to come here to practice without any danger?”","The better the effect of experience, the more dangerous it is.","This was a self-evident unspoken rule whether in the God Realm or the Lower Realm.","Liu Buyan immediately understood, “Alright, I understand. Then, I’ll see you in five days.”","Li Moying nodded, turned around and walked into the middle of the array.","A moment later, a red light flashed, and he was teleported inside the Palace.","In the luxurious and magnificent Palace, it was empty, except for him, there was only a slender figure walking around under the main hall, looking at the murals on the wall.","Seeing Li Moying appear, Huang Yueli’s eyes lit up, and she trotted over.","“Moying, why did it take you so long to come over? Could something be wrong?”","Li Moying shook his head, “It’s nothing, I just exchanged a few words with your Senior Brother.”","“My Senior Brother?” Huang Yueli blinked, “By the way, what will my Senior Brother do for the next few days? Could it be that he is waiting for us outside?”","“No, I asked him to participate in the assessment of the trial of the secret realm.”","Seeing that Huang Yueli was puzzled, Li Moying simply repeated what he had said to Liu Buyan before.","Huang Yueli was well-informed and soon understood, with a smile on her face, “This is not bad! I hope that Senior Brother can gain something in these five days, and his strength will improve! It can be seen that he is working very hard now, I really want him to catch up with us as soon as possible.”","“Catch up with us? Then he should give up now! After all, it’s impossible in this lifetime.” Li Moying sneered.","Although what he said was true, this man was too narcissistic, right?","Huang Yueli was speechless for a while, and glared at her husband.","Li Moying was glared at by his own little fox. Not only was he not angry, but he also laughed happily.","He grabbed Huang Yueli’s little hand and said with a smile, “The core of the volcano mentioned earlier is right under this hall. I’ll take you down together.”","“Great!”","Huang Yueli nodded.","Li Moying led her all the way down the spiral stone steps.","However, the two of them were very patient and walked down hand in hand.","After walking for about half an hour, Huang Yueli paused, and lowered her head to look towards the centre of the spiral.","“I can feel it! It’s so rich in fire attribute energy! It’s so powerful, so powerful!”","Huang Yueli’s eyes lit up, and she immediately became excited. She couldn’t wait to go down slowly, so she simply ran all the way down.","Li Moying’s hand was thrown away by her, and he couldn’t help frowning.","“Little Li’er, don’t run so fast! Beware of danger below!”","“It’s alright! I can feel that the energy here is abundant, and it’s very safe!”","Huang Yueli’s voice came from below.","She said she was fine, but of course Li Moying didn’t think it was fine.","He quickly chased after the place where his little fox disappeared.","After running for a long distance, he saw Huang Yueli’s figure.","However, she was not running alone, but riding on Wang Cai’s body!","Usually Wang Cai, who has been showing off in his young kid’s appearance, felt the incomparably abundant fire attribute energy around him, and his body suddenly changed!","After a few flamboyant effects, he transformed into a grown Phoenix."]},{"number":3955,"title":"Chapter 3955 Huang Yueli Advances (3)","paragraphs":["3955 Huang Yueli Advances (3)","However, this was not the end.","Little Wang Cai’s body kept getting bigger, bigger and bigger!","He was wrapped in a dense flame, and every feather of the Little Phoenix was as red as a raging flame, as if it had already started to burn.","And at the position above the Little Phoenix’s head, there was a young girl sitting cross-legged.","She has an outstanding appearance, and her facial features seem to be finely crafted by the heavens. She was so fair and under the firelight, she looked absolutely stunning.","The flowing dress she was wearing fluttered with the flow of the fire attribute energy.","It seems that it will fly away at any time!","For a moment, Li Moying couldn’t help but rush out to grab his little fox and lock her into her arms, lest she fly away like this.","But finally, he reacted in time and controlled himself.","Huang Yueli, who was in the centre of the sea of flames, was already immersed in her own cultivation, and could no longer notice the changes in the surrounding environment.","Standing on the steps not far away, Li Moying could clearly feel that the fire attribute energy inside the entire volcano was rushing in this direction.","These energies converged into a torrent, so fierce that even Li Moying felt a little unbearable, and involuntarily retreated a few steps backwards one after another.","But fortunately, his fire attribute talent was not too bad. Although it couldn’t compare with his thunder attribute talent, at least he can dabble in it.","Li Moying simply sat down cross-legged on the stone steps, and started to cultivate.","On the one hand, it was cultivation, and on the other hand, it was to protect Huang Yueli.","Although his family’s little fox was extremely talented and has a solid foundation in martial arts, generally speaking, there will be no problems.","However, as her husband, Li Moying still has tens of thousands of worries.","Huang Yueli was in the centre of the raging flames. At this moment, the profound energy in every meridian was gathering towards the dantian, and the profound energy flowing towards the dantian was quickly replenished by the surrounding fire energy, endlessly, as if inexhaustible!","Above her head, a raging flame rose up!","The raging flame changed its shape and gradually stabilised, forming the silhouette of the Sacred Phoenix!","The powerful force was enough to shock people’s hearts. Even the strong in the Dao Profound Realm may not be able to withstand its powerful pressure.","Li Moying, who was sitting by the side, couldn’t help feeling it, and opened his eyes.","“It seems that the phoenix blood in Little Li’er’s body has almost awakened. After this advancement, she should be able to summon the manifestation of the Sacred Phoenix to help in the usual battles!”","Being able to manifest divine beasts was a sign of the blood concentration of the Ancient God Clan cultivators.","Only cultivators with pure blood would such an astounding matter be revealed.","And if one wants to summon the divine beasts to fight, one can’t just rely on the concentration of bloodline, one would also need the cultivators themselves to have extremely strong comprehension and pure cultivation!","Of course, his Little Li’er doesn’t lack all of these!","Li Moying looked at it for a while, and was about to continue to cultivate with his eyes closed, when suddenly, there was an alarming sound not far away!","He frowned slightly, and looked in the direction of the sound.","The Little Phoenix, whose body had grown exponentially, was completely engulfed in the flames, and was raising his head and screeching in pain!"]},{"number":3956,"title":"Chapter 3956 Huang Yueli Advances (4)","paragraphs":["3956 Huang Yueli Advances (4)","Li Moying only glanced at it, then looked away.","Because, he has seen that although the Little Phoenix looks painful now, it is actually experiencing a huge opportunity. It was growing and transforming!","For an ancient mythical beast like the Phoenix, which is almost extinct, it is as difficult as climbing the sky!","Especially Little Wang Cai, who lost his physical body due to an accident when he was still young, and became a spirit body.","Although the ancient mythical phoenix has the ability to be reborn from nirvana, its spirit body was infinitely stronger than other divine beasts.","However, the physical body itself was an important medium for communicating the energy of heaven and the earth. Without this medium, the perception of energy will not be so keen. It will be much more difficult to improve the strength.","Now, for Little Phoenix to advance, it was truly a unique opportunity!","So, Li Moying quickly closed his eyes and continued to cultivate with peace of mind.","Little Phoenix’s pained cries, one after another, really made those who heard it feel sad and those who saw it shed tears.","However, he was unmoved and he didn’t even lift his eyelids.","As time ticked by, the pained cries of the Little Phoenix gradually fell silent.","And the flames around Huang Yueli also slowly subsided.","Li Moying immediately opened his eyes, and a hint of surprise flashed in his eyes.","His Little Li’er... finally succeeded in advancing!","Standing in the flames, Huang Yueli looked up at him, smiled at him, and then slowly walked towards him.","Li Moying immediately got up, greeted her, grabbed Huang Yueli’s wrist, and looked up and down, “Little Li’er, how are you? Is there anywhere you feel uncomfortable?”","Huang Yueli shook her head, “It’s alright, I’m just a little tired, I used up too much when I advanced just now, but the fire attribute energy here is really abundant, and the degree of purity is also better than what I absorbed before. Not only did I succeed in advancing this time, but my meridians have also been expanded, and I have gained a lot!”","As she spoke, she suddenly stood on tiptoe, kissed Li Moying’s face, and said with a sweet smile: “Husband, thank you, it’s all thanks to you telling me about such a treasure land!”","Li Moying didn’t expect to be thrown into her arms suddenly, he was taken aback for a moment, but then he quickly regained his senses.","He grabbed Huang Yueli’s body that was retreating rapidly, and leaned over in a rebellious manner, “Thank me... just such a kiss? Isn’t it too perfunctory?”","“The core of the volcano... so what? Don’t you think this is also very interesting?” Li Moying leaned close to her ear and blew softly.","Huang Yueli’s ears became hot all of a sudden, and her face became hot as well. She couldn’t help but raise her hand to push him.","“You... What a ghost! Go away, we should go out! I don’t know how many days we’ve been here? We have to go to Floating Sea!”","However, Li Moying held her tightly.","Huang Yueli turned her head and glared at him angrily, but the man seized the opportunity, pinched her chin, and pressed his lips against her tender lips.","Only after a long while later were the two able to separate.","Huang Yueli blushed so badly, she didn’t know if it was because of the deep kiss just now, or because it was too hot here.","Suddenly, she thought of something.","“By the way, I remember that before I advanced, Little Wang Cai kept yelling for me to let him out! So I just let him out. Where did he go?”"]},{"number":3957,"title":"Chapter 3957 Where’s The Person? (1)","paragraphs":["3957 Where’s The Person? (1)","Li Moying raised his chin in the direction of poor Wang Cai and said, “Lying over there!”","Huang Yueli turned her head and looked around. After looking for a while, she found Little Wang Cai’s figure in the lava pool.","At this time, he had returned to his normal size, and fell into a coma, lying motionless on the ground.","Since the colour of Little Wang Cai’s feathers was as bright red as flames, it almost merged with the lava pool. Huang Yueli searched for it for a long time before finding it.","She ran over quickly, picked up Little Wang Cai, stretched her hand to his neck, checked his pulse and the wounds on his body.","Seeing this, Li Moying walked over slowly and said, “Don’t worry, I have been watching over him just now. This little thing may have been influenced by the strong fire energy around, which stimulated the bloodline so he evolved. Now he’s just exhausted, so it shouldn’t be a big problem. It’s just that he’s probably going to rest in the Sky Phoenix Ring for a while.”","Huang Yueli also confirmed that Little Wang Cai hadn’t suffered any injuries, and finally felt relieved and her mood relaxed a lot.","“The little kid’s luck is quite good. I heard that the conditions for the evolution of ancient beasts are very harsh, moreover, this little thing is still a spirit body, so the difficulty is even greater. I didn’t expect him to gain such an opportunity so casually.”","Li Moying lifted her hair from behind, lowered his head and kissed her ear, and said with a low smile, “It’s not entirely luck. The environment here is very suitable. It’s just one reason, on the other hand, when you were advancing, it attracted a lot of fire energy and gathered towards you, this is the key to the evolution of Little Wang Cai. Therefore, he should be thankful that he has such a wonderful master!”","Huang Yueli smiled when she heard the words, “I can’t speak like you. You exaggerate too much.”","Li Moying smiled and said nothing more.","Although he loved the girl in his arms deeply, he did not say these words to please her, but to tell the truth.","“It’s just a pity that this Little Phoenix will have to sleep for at least a month before recovering. You won’t be able to use him during the God Realm’s Grand Meet.”","Huang Yueli didn’t take it seriously, “Even without him, I can still win the competition. You are underestimating me too much!”","Seeing his little fox raising her pointed chin and looking arrogant, Li Moying’s heart moved, he lowered her head subconsciously, and wanted to kiss her yet again.","When Huang Yueli saw that the man’s eyes were wrong, she immediately knew what he wanted to do, and immediately covered her mouth with her hands.","“Let’s go out quickly! I don’t know how many days we have stayed here?”","With that said, she bypassed Li Moying, trotted all the way, and ran up the long stone steps.","Li Moying shook his head with a smile and followed.","Back in the main hall, there was a time-recording mechanism on the wall.","But the Palace was still quiet, and there was no sign of anyone else coming.","Huang Yueli was not surprised either.","Li Moying had already said before that although the Black Tortoise Clan would send young people to experience training every year, no one had ever passed the test.","“It seems that Senior Brother failed the assessment...” Huang Yueli sighed, “He will definitely be very disappointed when he comes out!”","She could tell that Liu Buyan had been cultivating very hard recently, not letting go of any opportunity to improve himself."]},{"number":3958,"title":"Chapter 3958 Where’s The Person? (2)","paragraphs":["3958 Where’s The Person? (2)","There should be a lot of opportunities gained from this trial.","Unfortunately, four and a half days have passed, and Liu Buyan has not come out yet.","This meant that the possibility of passing the trial was very low.","A gleam of light flashed in Li Moying’s eyes, he smiled, and said: “That’s hard to say, isn’t it only four and a half days? There are still four days left! Maybe your Senior Brother can still pass the trial. Alas, it’s a pity. We are going to Floating Sea soon, even if he passes the assessment, he can only come and comprehend next time. Unless he is willing to give up the opportunity to participate in the God Realm’s Grand Meet.”","After hearing this, Huang Yueli looked at her husband in surprise, “You have quite the confidence in my Senior Brother!”","When the two of them bickered, Li Moying always looked down on Liu Buyan in various ways. She thought that Li Moying looked down on Liu Buyan!","Now it seems that this was not the case.","Li Moying was more optimistic about Liu Buyan than she was.","“It’s not that I have confidence in him, I’m just telling the truth. It hasn’t been five days yet, no one can tell, right?” Li Moying shrugged.","Huang Yueli said: “That’s true! Then... If the Senior Brother fails the trial, he will have to stay in the secret realm for five days before he can come out, right? Then we have to wait for him for half a day, we can’t waste it. It just so happens that it’s my first time here, so please show me around.”","“It’s my honour to serve you.” Li Moying bowed slightly and made a gesture of invitation.","Huang Yueli was dazzled by his polite demeanour, coupled with his handsome face.","It wasn’t until Li Moying came up to hold her hand that she came back to her senses, and her cheeks were flushed pink","Seeing her expression, Li Moying raised the corners of his mouth proudly.","He used to never think that it was useful to look better than others. For cultivators, the most important thing was strength. Face was not important at all. On the contrary, being too good-looking will cause a lot of unnecessary troubles and affect cultivation.","However, since he met Huang Yueli, he was very lucky.","His family’s little fox likes good-looking ones, which was also an important factor for him to embrace this beautiful woman.","Huang Yueli followed Li Moying and walked around the inside of the Palace.","In addition to the hall where they stayed at the beginning, there are more than a dozen rooms on the periphery, and each room has different skills, Spirit Armaments, materials, etc.","But Huang Yueli took a look and felt that most of them were not needed.","Huang Yueli frowned, and asked strangely: “Why are the treasures here so broken? It doesn’t match the strength of the owner of this place at all? Could it be that you took away all the good things?”","Li Moying shook his head slightly, “I didn’t take anything, that’s all the treasures in the Palace. I guess, this cave has been here for at least 200,000 years, and Cumulus Peak is not an inaccessible place. There must be other god-level geniuses entering, or heaven-level geniuses who have passed the assessment, and have already taken away the best inheritance in the Palace.”","Huang Yueli nodded in agreement, “That makes sense, so the only place in this cave dwelling that can be used for cultivation is the volcano core?”","Li Moying said: “Actually, there are some training places on the second floor of the Palace, but they may not be suitable for you and me. I’ll take you there to have a look.”"]},{"number":3959,"title":"Chapter 3959 Where’s The Person? (3)","paragraphs":["3959 Where’s The Person? (3)","The two walked up the stone steps to the second floor, and they saw several closed doors.","Huang Yueli knew that this was the place for cultivators who entered the Palace to practice, so she opened the door curiously and went in to have a try.","As a result, she was quickly disappointed.","Because in these training rooms, the concentration of fire energy was far less than that of the volcano core, not even a fraction of the concentration at the core.","Although compared to the environment outside, this place was considered very suitable for cultivation, but she had just stayed at the core of the volcano and compared with such an environment, she felt the difference.","After she came out, she couldn’t help complaining to Li Moying, “This cave is too bad, isn’t it? It doesn’t matter if there are no treasures, even the training room is so bad.”","Li Moying shook his head and laughed, “You, your vision is too high! Apart from you, how many people can withstand the impact of the fire energy of the intensity of the volcano core? It is impossible to stay in the core for more than half an hour! Ordinary young cultivators can only practice in this kind of training room.”","Huang Yueli thought what he said was right after some contemplation so she could only follow Li Moying and leave begrudgingly.","Half a day was actually not long. The two went around and picked some treasures to take away.","When they returned to the hall, only then did they realise that it was going to be the sixth day soon.","“Alright, let’s come back next time when we have time. Now, we have to pick up my Senior Brother and leave together.”","Li Moying naturally had no objection to his wife’s suggestion.","The two left the Palace together, returned to the Palace room where the teleportation array was located, and waited for Liu Buyan to appear.","The timing of theirs was quite accurate. As soon as they arrived in the Palace, a burst of red light appeared from the teleportation array.","“It seems that Senior Brother has come out!” Huang Yueli stared at the centre of the array with delight.","However, immediately, she showed a look of disappointment, “It’s not Senior Brother, it’s someone else from the Black Tortoise Clan...”","A young cultivator of the Black Tortoise Clan stepped out of the array.","Immediately afterwards, the red light came on again, and another person walked out, not Liu Buyan.","The red light flashed again and again, and cultivators came out of the teleportation array one by one.","However, there was no Liu Buyan in it.","In the end, the red light of the teleportation array completely disappeared.","Huang Yueli waited by the side for quite a while, but did not see the red light turn on again.","“What’s going on here? Why didn’t my Senior Brother come out? Did he not enter the trial of the secret realm at all, or... did something happen?” Huang Yueli looked worried.","Li Moying also had an ominous premonition in his heart, but he didn’t want to make Huang Yueli anxious, so he still seemed very calm.","“It’s still hard to say, let’s ask the people of the Black Tortoise Clan.”","“Yes, the people from the Black Tortoise Clan should have entered at about the same time as the Senior Brother.”","Huang Yueli also came to her senses.","She strode up behind the group of Black Tortoise Clan cultivators. Just as she was about to speak out, she found that they all seemed very anxious and were discussing something loudly.","“It’s over, it’s over, it’s over now!”","“...What should I do? Why didn’t she come out? It shouldn’t be!”","“After we go back, how are we going to explain to the Patriarch! Sigh!”","Huang Yueli vaguely heard a few words, but couldn’t understand them, so she could only raise her voice: “Fellow cultivators, please excuse me!”"]},{"number":3960,"title":"Chapter 3960 Where’s The Person? (4)","paragraphs":["3960 Where’s The Person? (4)","Hearing Huang Yueli’s voice, the members of the Black Tortoise Clan were obviously taken aback.","They turned around in a hurry, and when they saw a little girl, they all showed displeasure.","“You... aren’t you the little girl who followed Young Master Li?”","“Our Black Tortoise Clan discusses things, why do you have the nerve to eavesdrop here?”","“That’s right, hurry up and go away!”","!!","None of the cultivators of the Black Tortoise Clan had a good impression of Huang Yueli. She looked very young, and she was not from the Cloudy Qilin Clan, so her strength should not be very good, but she seemed so close to Li Moying. These Ancient God Clan cultivators who thought they were born noble were the most disliked.","Huang Yueli frowned.","Originally, she planned to communicate with them properly. Since these cultivators are so self-righteous, she doesn’t need to be too polite!","She snorted coldly and said: “Alright, you guys don’t hide it. I can guess that the reason why your faces are so ugly is because Xuan Qingling, who led the team, had an accident in the trial of the secret realm, right? ”","The cultivators of the Black Tortoise Clan immediately changed their faces, and all looked at her defensively.","“You... how did you know?”","Huang Yueli sneered and said, “What’s so hard to guess? I saw Xuan Qingling on the mountain just now. Since she was leading the team, she will definitely enter the secret realm with you, but she has not been teleported out now... ...Maybe there was an accident, right?”","Hearing what she said directly, the cultivators couldn’t find anything to refute.","Thinking of the most talented and most promising top genius in the God Realm of their clan, who fell like this, the hearts of everyone were extremely heavy.","Moreover, Xuan Qingling doesn’t have the kind of arrogance that peerless geniuses usually have, and has always been very popular among the clan.","“Alright, can you tell me what happened in the trial of the secret realm? Why did all of you come out safely but Xuan Qingling, who is the strongest among you, didn’t come out?”","Huang Yueli had a feeling that Xuan Qingling’s disappearance should have something to do with Liu Buyan.","After all, according to Li Moying, disappearances in the trial of the secret realm are relatively rare, and there must be an accident in the secret realm.","The cultivators of the Black Tortoise Clan looked at each other, hesitating, as if they didn’t really want to speak out.","Seeing their expressions, Huang Yueli suddenly understood, and couldn’t help but sneered, “What? You don’t want to say, is it because... Young Miss Xuan Qingling was killed by you?”","“Yes, what... why do we have to do this!”","The cultivators all showed a bit of panic on their faces, subconsciously retorting loudly.","Huang Yueli smiled slightly, and said casually: “Then why don’t you dare to talk about the situation in the secret realm? I know you won’t intentionally harm her, but maybe an accident happened? If you tell me, maybe I can help you .Even if you don’t believe in my strength, you should always believe in him, right?”","With that said, she turned her head and pointed in the direction where Li Moying was.","Li Moying has been standing in the corner of the main hall without making a sound, just letting his little fox play freely.","It wasn’t until Huang Yueli pointed at him that he slowly walked out of the shadows.","That incomparably handsome face was revealed in the sunlight, and immediately the cultivators of the Black Tortoise Clan exclaimed: “Young Master Li!”"]},{"number":3961,"title":"Chapter 3961 Where’s The Person? (5)","paragraphs":["3961 Where’s The Person? (5)","Ever since Li Moying killed the strong man in the middle stage of the Sky Devil, the reputation of the Cloudy Qilin Clan’s god-level genius had gradually spread throughout the God Realm.","The cultivators of the Black Tortoise Clan have naturally heard about him.","The God Realm respects the strong and every cultivator was the same.","Therefore, as soon as Li Moying appeared, the cultivators present felt ashamed and bowed their heads consciously. Compared with their attitude towards Huang Yueli just now, it can be said that they were completely different people.","Huang Yueli was a little displeased, she curled her lips.","Li Moying saw her small movements, and a glint of smile flashed by in the man’s eyes.","“Friends of the Black Tortoise Clan, we have met outside the cave before, you should still remember me?”","“Remember, remember, of course we remember!”","“Young Master Li is wise and powerful. He looks like a dragon among men at first glance. Anyone who sees him once will never forget it!”","“Isn’t it? It’s our honour to meet Young Master Li with our own eyes!”","Facing Li Moying, the young cultivators all behaved very respectfully.","Li Moying nodded, and said, “Just now, what my wife said...you all heard?”","“Wi..wi... Wife?!”","“What wife?”","“I...I must have heard wrong...”","Everyone’s eyes widened, looking at the faces of Li Moying and Huang Yueli, their faces were full of disbelief.","Who would have thought that Li Moying would introduce the lady beside him in such a manner! This weak-looking little beauty of the human race was... the wife of Young Master Li? The Young Madame of the Cloudy Qilin Clan?","Was he kidding?","This lady was indeed beautiful, rare in the world, but she was a human race! And she doesn’t look strong at all.","The Cloudy Qilin Clan was also an Ancient God Clan clan, can such a woman be allowed to become the Young Madame of the family? Moreover, it is still allocated to a god-level genius like Li Moying!","Everyone was full of doubts, but no one dared to say anything to Li Moying’s cold face.","Huang Yueli said: “There is Moying here, don’t you feel relieved now? Quickly tell me what happened to Xuan Qingling in the secret realm?”","If there was a life-and-death crisis, it is very likely that they will not arrive in time, and Liu Buyan will die.","The cultivators of the Black Tortoise Clan didn’t dare to neglect, they looked at each other for a while, and recommended an articulate one to explain to Li Moying.","“Young Master Li, what happened was this. I wonder if you have entered the trial of the secret before?”","Li Moying shook his head.","The person hurriedly said: “Then let me briefly explain that the concentration of the profound energy of the heavens and the earth in the trial of the secret realm is much lower than that outside, and it would be good for the cultivators to display half of their usual strength inside. However, there are a large number of spirit beasts and traps, which force cultivators to squeeze their potential greatly. In the secret realm, there are seven caves, and each cave lives a powerful king-level spirit beast comparable to the Dap Profound Realm cultivator. And these king-level spirit beasts are each guarding a moon lotus.”","“If you want to pass the test and enter the cave, you must obtain the moon lotus from one of the king-level spirit beasts, and at the same time send the moon lotus to the teleportation point in the centre of the secret realm.”","“This is almost impossible for us. With the combined strength of all of us, we can’t fight against cultivators at the early stage of the Dao Profound Realm, let alone against spirit beasts at the middle stage of the Dao Profound Realm.”"]},{"number":3962,"title":"Chapter 3962 Where’s The Person? (6)","paragraphs":["3962 Where’s The Person? (6)","“So, usually, we just kill spirit beasts and practice in a safe place, and we have never been close to these caves.”","“But...”","“However, when you entered the secret realm this time, something happened, which made you feel that you have the strength to win a Moon Lotus, right?”","After hearing what the young cultivator said, Huang Yueli quickly analysed the situation at that time.","The young cultivator nodded hurriedly, “Yes, that’s true! When we entered, there was an Astute Blaze Beast guarding the Moon Lotus, which seemed to be giving birth, and the surroundings were full of blood. However, the coercion released around the Astute Blaze Beast’s cave weakened significantly. Yes. Young Miss Qing Ling is very courageous, so she took the risk to check.”","“We were very lucky. The Astute Blaze Beast was really weak, and it didn’t notice that someone had entered its territory, so we plucked the Moon Lotus...”","Having said that, the young cultivator paused for a moment, and his face became serious.","“Then something happened?” Huang Yueli blinked and asked.","The young cultivator nodded, “Yes! After we picked the Moon Lotus, the Astute Blaze Beast suddenly noticed it, and immediately went mad. It left its cub and chased after us. Luckily, Young Miss Qingling was prepared. She told us to hide in the distance, and she was the only one who went to pick the Moon Lotus, so everyone escaped in time.”","“She took us all the way to the teleportation circle in the centre of the secret realm. We all felt that there was a high possibility of successfully reaching the teleportation circle! Because the Astute Blaze Beast was weak after giving birth, and its speed was much slower than usual and we also brought a pill for speeding up and saving our lives. However, after running for a certain distance, we realised that we underestimated the difficulty of the secret trial...”","Huang Yueli and Li Moying looked at each other without saying a word.","The two of them were well-informed, and they have almost guessed what will happen next.","The young cultivator’s eyes were moist, he took a deep breath, stabilised his emotions, and then said: “It’s not just the Astute Blaze Beast that was chasing us but all the spirit beasts in the entire trial of the secret realm had been attracted by the scent of the Moon Lotus. We can’t deal with one Astute Blaze Beast, and it’s even more impossible to deal with other spirit beasts. Soon, some members of the clan were injured.”","“If this continues, we may all die there!”","“So, Young Miss Qingling decided that she would take Moon Lotus alone and leave us alone, and let us go to the teleportation array to wait for her...”","“After Young Miss Qingling left, those spirit beasts really stopped chasing us. We waited and waited in the teleportation array. After waiting for three days, she didn’t come back. Later, we were teleported out...”","Huang Yueli listened to the young cultivator’s narration very calmly from beginning to end, but she couldn’t help but change her face when she heard this.","“What did you say? It’s been three days since Xuan Qingling disappeared with Moon Lotus!”","“Yes, yes...that’s how it is...”","Seeing Huang Yueli being so excited, the young cultivator was also taken aback.","“Uh, we’re so worried about Young Miss Qingling that we didn’t leave the teleportation array. Besides, even if we want to gain experience, we can’t do it because all the spirit beasts were chasing Young Miss Qingling. There weren’t any spirit beasts at all even if we wanted to kill any!”"]},{"number":3963,"title":"Chapter 3963 Where’s The Person? (7)","paragraphs":["3963 Where’s The Person? (7)","Hearing this, Huang Yueli already had an idea in her heart.","“Alright, thank you, I’ve figured out what happened in the trial of the secret realm.”","The young cultivator didn’t look at her, but stared at Li Moying behind her, and asked worriedly: “Young Master Li, that’s how things were.Can.. can you save our Young Miss Qingling?”","The other cultivators of the Black Tortoise Clan also looked at him expectantly.","Li Moying just glanced at them indifferently, then turned her gaze to Huang Yueli, “Little Li’er, what do you think?”","Hearing this, all the cultivators present were taken aback.","From their point of view, Huang Yueli was just a vase for Li Moying. Even if she wins Young Master Li’s favour by virtue of her beauty, when they encounter such serious matters, she can only listen from the sidelines.","But who would have thought that Li Moying asked her for her opinion without her opening her mouth, moreover, he looked very sincere.","Huang Yueli noticed everyone’s astonished gazes, but she didn’t take it seriously at all, and now her mind was completely on Liu Buyan.","“From what that fellow cultivator said, there are two important points. First, the disappearance of my Senior Brother should be related to the disappearance of Xuan Qingling. Because, according to what they just said, the spirit beasts in the entire secret realm were chasing Xuan Qingling. It’s difficult to find one outside, so if Senior Brother is not with Xuan Qingling, it is actually very safe.”","Everyone originally looked down on Huang Yueli, but when they heard her speak, they didn’t take it seriously.","However, everyone was taken aback when they heard what she analyzed.","So clear and logical...","This girl was not just beautiful!","Just this ability to analyse was much better than most people.","In this way, the cultivators of the Black Tortoise Clan listened more attentively.","Huang Yueli continued to speak, and immediately made a big move, “The second point...Xuan Qingling and my Senior Brother should not be dead yet, we have to enter the secret realm now, there is still a chance to save them.”","“What? Young Miss Qingling is not dead?”","“Girl, are you... are you sure?”","“What basis do you have for saying that?”","Although they wanted to ask Li Moying to find a way to save Xuan Qingling just now, they didn’t have much hope in their hearts.","Because it has been three days since Xuan Qingling was in danger!","Under the attack of so many spirit beasts, those who can survive for three hours are god-like.","Three days! How can it be?","Therefore, in their thinking, there was a 90% possibility that Xuan Qingling was already in danger.","But Huang Yueli said that she was still alive, and said so with certainty!","Huang Yueli explained lightly: “Isn’t it obvious? You have never encountered any spirit beasts attacking you until you were teleported out, which means that these spirit beasts have always been attracted by Xuan Qingling. If she dies, these spirit beasts will come back.”","“It...is...it’s that simple?” Everyone had expressions of disbelief.","Huang Yueli said: “Otherwise?”","Everyone looked extremely upset.","“Yes, why didn’t I think of it?”","“This matter is indeed quite obvious, but... I didn’t think about it at all before!”","Huang Yueli didn’t bother to say more to them, she turned her head to look at Li Moying, “It seems that we have to hurry up!”"]},{"number":3964,"title":"Chapter 3964 Where’s The Person? (8)","paragraphs":["3964 Where’s The Person? (8)","Li Moying nodded, “We’re going to try the secret realm to save people!”","Hearing this, all the cultivators were shocked!","“Young Master Li, do you really have the means to enter the secret realm of trials? But, aren’t you...a god-level talent?”","Although they don’t have the talents of Li Moying, they all know the rules of the trials of the secret realm.","Only heaven-level and earth-level talented cultivators will be sent in.","!!","Li Moying said calmly: “I just don’t need to participate in the trial. It doesn’t mean that when I want to enter the trial of the secret realm, I can’t enter.”","As he spoke, he turned to Huang Yueli, “Little Li’er, enter the easternmost tower in the cave, and there is a teleportation array that can lead to the secret trial realm.”","Huang Yueli’s eyes lit up, she grabbed his hand and ran towards the teleportation array.","“Then hurry up, we’ll be there right away, don’t waste time!”","Li Moying was taken away by his wife very cooperatively.","But the Black Tortoise Clan cultivators who looked at the backs of the two frowned.","“Madam Li is too anxious, isn’t she? Why did she go with Young Master Li, how can she enter the secret realm? The two of them can’t enter the teleportation array together!”","Although it’s alright for the teleportation array to transmit to two people at the same time, the directions of the two people’s teleportation must be the same!","If one is sent to the inside of the cave while the other is sent to the secret trial realm, and if the destinations are different, then the one with the poorest cultivation will be ejected.","It’s a small matter to be ashamed but one might get hurt.","The cultivators wanted to stop Huang Yueli, but she ran too fast, and by the time everyone realised it, it was too late to catch her.","They could only watch helplessly as she and Li Moying entered the teleportation array.","A moment later, the red light lit up.","Everyone was waiting for Huang Yueli to be ejected.","But the result...","“What’s going on? Where are they? Where did they go?”","Everyone looked at each other in blank dismay, not understanding what happened.","If the person disappeared, he was naturally teleported away.","But where did the little beauty next to Li Moying go? It doesn’t mean that she is also a god-level genius, and entered the cave together with Li Moying, right?","“No, don’t make wild guesses, this is absolutely impossible! It must be some means that Young Master Li took the initiative to allow the teleportation array to teleport to two destinations at the same time!”","This argument was unanimously supported by everyone.","“That’s right, it must be like this!”","“It seems that Young Master Li really likes that girl very much, and he is not willing to let her get hurt!”","“Sigh, I never thought that a peerless genius like Young Master Li could not escape the temptation of beauty...”","“Look at you! You don’t even look at what level of beauty she is! With such beauty, who won’t be tempted? If you remove the halo of a god-level genius, the Young Master Li is just an ordinary man!”","...","In the trial in the secret realm....","With the Moon Lotus in her arms, Xuan Qingling flitted through quickly as she traversed through the bushes.","Before she picked the flower, she also thought that she would be in great danger, but she still didn’t expect that it would be so dangerous!","What’s worse, this Moon Lotus was now like a hot potato that couldn’t be shaken off.","She wanted to throw it on the side of the road or in the pond several times, but after a while, for some reason, the Moon Lotus would return to her hand."]},{"number":3965,"title":"Chapter 3965 Don’t Follow Me (1)","paragraphs":["3965 Don’t Follow Me (1)","There was something evil about it!","At this moment, Xuan Qingling really regretted it a bit. She felt that she had overestimated her own strength, underestimated the cave dwelling left by the strong men from the ancient times.","At that time, she only saw Astute Blaze Beast’s dying appearance and only thought of the opportunity to take advantage of it, so she took the risk.","She was really eager to get the secret law inheritance in the Palace!","The young geniuses of the Black Tortoise Clan were all very similar in strength, and there were quite a few who were in the same position as her. If she could get the inheritance, she will definitely have a certain advantage in the God Realm’s Grand Meet, and she will be able to overwhelm her own competition by then. This way, she could obtain more resources from the clan.","!!","However, Xuan Qingling has come to this secret trial realm at least five or six times.","Although there was progress in every trial, but there was no chance of passing the assessment.","Only this time...","The Moon Lotus seemed to be at her fingertips, but she was dazzled by the immediate benefits, and chose to make a decisive move without thinking further.","As a result...","It turned into such a difficult situation!","Xuan Qingling has been chasing and intercepting various spirit beasts in the secret realm, and has persisted in fighting for two and a half days!","If she hadn’t been quite experienced in combat and was usually very cautious, she might have become a corpse by now.","However, even though she was still alive, she had suffered serious internal injuries during the series of battles, and her running speed was not as good as before.","“Roar... Roar...”","Not far behind her, the roars of high-level spirit beasts came and went.","Xuan Qingling’s face became paler and paler.","With her current physical condition, it is almost impossible to persevere in the next battle!","If she was caught up by these high-level spirit beasts, she would definitely have to leave her life here today.","Seeing the roars of the spirit beasts getting closer, Xuan Qingling showed a look of despair...","A deep and magnetic male voice sounded, full of doubts.","Xuan Qingling never expected that there would be someone beside her. She was so frightened that she almost jumped up. When she turned her head, she saw a very handsome man standing in front of her.","This man looks somewhat familiar...","Xuan Qingling thought for a while before recognizing the identity of this person, “You...aren’t you he one who came with Young Master Li...”","When the two groups of people met just now, her attention was focused on Huang Yueli, but she didn’t pay much attention to Liu Buyan, but she had a vague impression.","Liu Buyan nodded, and said politely: “I’m Liu Buyan and I’m Li Moying’s...”","“Run! Run!”","Before Liu Buyan finished speaking, he was interrupted by Xuan Qingling’s cry.","He froze for a moment, and saw a large group of spirit beasts galloping towards them.","Moreover, many of the ones running in the front are high-level spirit beasts, whose strength is equivalent to the powerhouses in the late stage of the human race’s Heart Profound Realm!","Liu Buyan’s face changed, “Damn, what’s the situation, how did you attract so many spirit beasts?”","Xuan Qingling hurriedly said: “Stop talking, hurry up and run! You are still dawdling here, do you want to die?”","Liu Buyan also came to his senses, and ran after Xuan Qingling.","Seeing this, Xuan Qingling hurriedly said: “You... don’t follow me! These spirit beasts are coming for me, and they are only chasing me! Go to the east, as long as you run out of this forest, these monsters will not go away. They won’t chase you, I will lead them away!”"]},{"number":3966,"title":"Chapter 3966 Don’t Follow Me (2)","paragraphs":["3966 Don’t Follow Me (2)","Liu Buyan obviously didn’t expect Xuan Qingling to say such a thing, and was taken aback for a moment.","Seeing that he was still standing there stupidly, Xuan Qingling became anxious, “Hey! Are you stupid? Run quickly!”","Xuan Qingling was so angry that she wanted to vomit blood.","Was this guy a fool? She had obviously told him to run, but he won’t run! What’s up with him? Could it be due to lack of actual combat experience, seeing such a group of spirit beasts, he was so frightened that he couldn’t move?","However, this was not impossible.","After all, looking at this kid’s cultivation, he seems to be only in the middle stage of the Dream Profound Realm. This level of strength, in the eyes of the geniuses of the Ancient God Clans, was simply unsightly!","Either they don’t have prefecture-level talents, or they don’t work hard in cultivation.","Seeing that Liu Buyan was able to enter the trial of the secret realm, he probably has an earth-level talent, so it must be the latter...","Recalling that Li Moying’s wife from the lower realm who was dumped was replaced by with Liu Buyan’s Junior Sister, Xuan Qingling quickly made up her mind that Liu Buyan was a man who relied on his Junior Sister’s beauty to seduce men. That meant that he himself was one that seeked profits from ladies and his image became...","Liu Buyan did not expect that Xuan Qingling could imagine so much in such a short period of time.","After looking at the herd of spirit beasts behind the two of them, he analysed for a moment, then suddenly said: “No, you can’t run that way, they will definitely catch up.”","Xuan Qingling felt that he was simply stupid.","“Of course I know that I will be overtaken if I run that way, but it’s the same for me if I run that way. These spirit beasts will definitely catch up to me! Don’t worry about it so much, just go!”","Seeing that Liu Buyan still didn’t move, she didn’t bother to say any more, “If you are willing to feed spirit beasts here, then I won’t care anymore, I have to go!”","Xuan Qingling didn’t want to delay any longer, she still wanted to struggle to the death!","Even if there is only a glimmer of life, she has to fight for it, and she won’t wait here to die.","Seeing that Xuan Qingling was about to run away, Liu Buyan hurriedly called out, “Wait!”","Xuan Qingling ignored him and continued to run forward, but unexpectedly, a strong force came from her shoulders and pulled her back.","“What are you doing...” Xuan Qingling turned her head angrily.","However, before she could say anything, Liu Buyan grabbed her wrist, pulled her and ran in another direction.","As Liu Buyan spoke, he ran wildly with Xuan Qingling.","“Hey! Liu Buyan, right? You... you’re not crazy, are you? Didn’t you hear what I said just now? These spirit beasts are coming for me. As long as I don’t die, they will keep chasing me! Why are you still dragging me to run together! Are you seeking your own death? Let me go!”","Xuan Qingling was terribly anxious, and kept pushing back, trying to pull her wrist out of Liu Buyan’s hand.","However, she tried hard twice but failed.","Such a situation made her stunned for a moment.","In her opinion, Liu Buyan’s strength was too far behind hers. Even if she doesn’t use profound strength, Liu Buyan can’t bear her strength!","While running, Liu Buyan said, “I know there is a place to hide, so come with me first.”","Seeing that the group of spirit beasts behind them had changed direction, they chased after them again.","Xuan Qingling had no choice but to follow Liu Buyan all the way to the dark.","The two ran wildly all the way, ran out of the bushes, and arrived in a forest.","Liu Buyan suddenly stopped under a big tree.","Xuan Qingling thought he couldn’t run anymore and was extremely anxious."]},{"number":3967,"title":"Chapter 3967 Don’t Follow Me (3)","paragraphs":["3967 Don’t Follow Me (3)","“Why did you stop? Now is not the time to rest, we will be chased soon! No, just keep going, let’s continue...”","Liu Buyan turned his head and waved at her.","“Don’t talk, you come in first!”","Xuan Qingling was taken aback, “Come in? What do you mean?”","The next moment, she widened her eyes and watched Liu Buyan clean up some vines beside the big tree, revealing the entrance of a cave.","“Go in, hurry up! Didn’t you see that the spirit beasts are coming after you?” Liu Buyan urged.","Xuan Qingling actually didn’t think there was any use in doing this at all, but Liu Buyan’s attitude was so firm, and now that the spirit beast was chasing her, it was too late to think of a solution, so she could only obey Liu Buyan’s words and sneak in.","After a while, Liu Buyan also got in and let down the vines that were covering the hole.","As soon as Xuan Qingling saw him, he immediately said: “You, you... why did you bring me here? Do you think you can fool those spirit beasts with a few vines as a disguise? Let me tell you, it’s impossible. Yes! Those spirit beasts have identified me, no matter how far away they are, they can sense my position!”","Liu Buyan didn’t take it seriously, “So what if you sense it? As long as you can’t get in.”","“How could it be impossible to get in! These are high-level spirit beasts with strong attack power! Although the trees at the door are more than ten metres thick, they can’t withstand their impact!”","As soon as Xuan Qingling’s anxious words fell, the roar of spirit beasts came from outside the cave.","Then, there was the rumbling sound caused by a large number of spirit beasts hitting the big tree.","The whole ground trembled with the attacks of the spirit beasts.","Xuan Qingling couldn’t even stand firmly in the cave, her body shook a few times, and she was about to fall down.","Liu Buyan quickly stretched out his hand to help her.","Xuan Qingling was caught off guard and fell onto him.","Liu Buyan was hit by her, and his body fell backwards. He hastily stepped back a few steps in a row, and didn’t stop until his back hit the cave wall.","“Young Miss Xuan, are you alright?” Liu Buyan stood firm and reached out to help Xuan Qingling.","Xuan Qingling was leaning in his arms before she suddenly realised that she had actually fallen on top of a man and hurriedly backed away.","As a genius cultivator of the Ancient God Clan race, she has been thinking about cultivation since she was a child, and she has never been so close to a man...","“I’m fine, thank you... Thank you Young Master Liu.”","Liu Buyan was pushed away by her, and it was only then that he realised that Xuan Qingling was a young girl, so she was a little embarrassed.","However, Young Master Liu was a well-known playboy in Soaring Heavens Continent after all. Although he is just a playboy and never shows his true self, his face must be hundreds of times thicker than that of an innocent girl, and he quickly returned to normal. Said: “It’s alright, serving beauties is what I should do.”","It was a bit frivolous to say this.","Xuan Qingling suddenly felt a little offended, raised her head, and glared at Liu Buyan, as if she wanted to get angry.","However, she thought that this man had helped her just now, so she could only hold back her anger. However, her already flushed face became even redder because of suppressing the brewing rage.","The proud daughter of heaven, who originally looked high and cold as ice, has become a lot more approachable because of this extra flush."]},{"number":3968,"title":"Chapter 3968 Don’t Follow Me (4)","paragraphs":["3968 Don’t Follow Me (4)","Liu Buyan’s heart skipped a beat.","It wasn’t until then that he noticed that Xuan Qingling was also very beautiful.","Although she doesn’t have the beauty of his Junior Sister who can amaze everyone with just a single encounter, she does have an ethereal aura.","It looked like a white lotus blooming peacefully by the spring.","Xuan Qingling took a few deep breaths, calmed down, and looked in the direction of the cave entrance.","“What should we do? These trees will surely fall down soon! The entrance of the cave will definitely be exposed! We still can’t escape! Why don’t we hurry up and see if there is another exit behind this cave!”","Xuan Qingling looked towards the other side. The inside of the cave was pitch black and nothing could be seen. It looked very gloomy.","She took out a flint and wanted to ignite it, but was stopped by Liu Buyan.","“Wait, don’t worry, let’s see the situation.”","Even though Xuan Qingling was always calm and self-reliant, at this time, Liu Buyan was about to panic to death.","What kind of a situation and timing was this? He still wants to wait and see the situation?!","If they waited and by the time they could ‘look’ again, both of them would have become food in the belly of spirit beasts!","And at this time, a loud “bang” sound finally came from outside.","The ground was shaken constantly, smoke and dust were scattered everywhere, and even passed through the vines and flew in from the hole.","“It’s over! The big tree has been brought down by the spirit beasts! It’s too late for us to run!” Xuan Qingling said in despair.","Sure enough, the roar of the spirit beast rang around in the vicinity, sometimes far away and sometimes near.","In the end, the vines covering the cave were torn into pieces by pairs of sharp claws scrambling to be the first, and hideous beast faces appeared at the entrance of the cave.","Xuan Qingling knew that they were finished!","She couldn’t help closing her eyes in despair.","It was her audacity, impetuousness and underestimation of the enemy that led to such consequences. She felt extremely aggrieved to die here!","It’s a pity that Liu Buyan, an innocent passer-by, was also implicated by her...","But at this moment, she suddenly heard a sharp hissing sound, which seemed to be full of fear.","A group of spirit beasts were looking at the direction of the cave entrance in horror, looking very alert, hesitated for a while, and gradually moved back.","Although there was no shelter at the entrance of the cave, not a single spirit beast rushed in.","Xuan Qingling never expected such a situation to happen.","She stared blankly for a while, then remembered something, and immediately turned to look at Liu Buyan, “Liu... Young Master Liu? You did this, right? What’s going on? What did you do to these spirit beasts? ”","Liu Buyan’s expression was actually very serious, and he was slightly relieved when he saw the spirit beasts retreating one after another.","“I don’t have the ability to do anything to these spirit beasts. After all, I am only in the Dream Profound Realm. If you add three or five of these spirit beasts, I will die!”","After hearing this, Xuan Qingling was speechless for a while.","What three or five!","This was a high-level spirit beast equivalent to the strength of a strong person in the late stage of the Heart Profound Realm!","Not to mention three or five, just one of his followers can tear a Dream Profound Realm cultivator into pieces, alright?","However, Xuan Qingling had just been rescued by someone, so naturally she wouldn’t point out Liu Buya’s nonsense and continued with a good attitude: “Then how could these spirit beasts retreat? They definitely have something to do with you! Young Master Liu, don’t be so modest, this time you saved me, I’m really grateful!”"]},{"number":3969,"title":"Chapter 3969 Barking up the Wrong Tree (1)","paragraphs":["3969 Barking up the Wrong Tree (1)","Liu Buyan actually noticed Xuan Qingling’s eyes.","He was very good at observing words and deeds. Of course he understands that Xuan Qingling doesn’t believe that he can fight against three or five high-level spirit beasts.","However, he didn’t explain. He just smiled and said, “Actually, we haven’t escaped danger yet. These spirit beasts are just afraid to enter the cave for the time being. But if they don’t leave, we can’t be trapped here forever, right?”","Xuan Qingling also understood this point. She originally thought that Liu Buyan would have a way to escape from the cave, but now she heard what he said, and she was a little disappointed.","“This...how can we do this? We have to work it out. That’s right!”","Xuan Qingling suddenly thought of something, pointed to the entrance of the cave, and asked, “Young Master Liu, what method did you use to prevent these spirit beasts from entering?”","She purposely observed around the cave for a while just now, and found that there was no special pattern at the entrance of the cave, so this was not due to the defensive array.","And there is no mechanism in the cave, it looks very ordinary.","This made Xuan Qingling a little incomprehensible.","Liu Buyan smiled and said, “I just used a little medicine powder.”","As he spoke, he took out a medicine bottle from his sleeve and waved it in front of Xuan Qingling’s eyes.","“This kind of medicinal powder is quite special. It can imitate the aura of king-level spirit beasts. I sprinkled the medicine powder on the entrance of the cave. Therefore, spirit beasts below the king-level dare not approach the cave. By the way, you can also sprinkle some on your clothes. Just in case.”","Liu Buyan opened the medicine bottle, grabbed Xuan Qingling’s sleeve with one hand, and was about to sprinkle it on her body.","Xuan Qingling was stunned for a moment, and quickly withdrew his hand, “Well... this... ahem, thank you Young Master Liu, but I’d better spread it myself...”","Liu Buyan was also taken aback, and then realised that he was behaving a little too familiar.","Now the teammate beside him was not Li Moying, but a girl from an Ancient God Clan that he doesn’t know well at all.","He smiled mischievously, and handed the bottle to Xuan Qingling, “Alright, Young Miss Xuan, you can do it yourself.”","Xuan Qingling took out the medicine bottle and carefully sprinkled the medicine powder on her body. During her actions, she accidentally twitched the wound on her body, and she almost screamed in pain.","“Ughhhl...”","She snorted and frowned.","Xuan Qingling nodded, and replied: “That’s right! Actually, I have been chased by those spirit beasts for several days. During the period, I was almost caught up several times, and a fight broke out. Fortunately, I was lucky and escaped smoothly in the end. It’s just... It’s just that I suffered a lot of injuries, if you hadn’t rescued me this time, I probably would have died here.”","Liu Buyan thought for a while, and then took out two bottles of pills from his sleeve.","“Young Miss Xuan, of these two bottles of elixir, one is for treating internal injuries, and the other is an ointment. As long as you apply it on the wound, it will heal quickly.”","Xuan Qingling was stunned for a moment, and then refused: “No need, Young Master Liu, it really doesn’t matter. To tell you the truth, when I came out of the family, I brought a lot of medicinal pills for healing, but here The spirit beasts here are all fire-type, and for a water-type physique like mine, they will do a lot of damage, and any pills will have limited effects. Also, my profound strength is seriously depleted, which cannot be cured by pills.”","After listening to Xuan Qingling’s words, Liu Buyan just smiled."]},{"number":3970,"title":"Chapter 3970 Barking up the Wrong Tree (2)","paragraphs":["3970 Barking up the Wrong Tree (2)","He simply pushed the bottle of pills towards her.","“Young Miss Xuan, this is a pill I made myself. It is improved based on the existing pill formula. It is definitely different from the healing medicine in your clan. Is it alright for you to try it? Or... are you worried that I will poison you?”","Hearing this, a smile of embarrassment appeared on Xuan Qingling’s face before she hurriedly shook her head, “How can you say that? Young Master Liu, you are my lifesaver!”","She took the medicine bottles, poured out a pill from one of the bottles, stuffed it into her mouth, and swallowed it with her head raised.","If Liu Buyan wanted to harm her, all he had to do was watch her being killed by a spirit beast. It didn’t have to be so complicated.","Besides, Liu Buyan knew that she was from the Ancient God Clan yet he strongly recommended this bottle to her, which showed that these medicinal pills were indeed superior.","Now that they were in such a precarious situation, it was always a good thing to be able to heal any injuries as much as possible and increase their combat effectiveness.","Even if the medicinal pill doesn’t work, it doesn’t hurt to try it.","After Xuan Qingling took the medicinal pill, she thanked Liu Buyan and leaned against the cave wall to rest for a while.","She actually didn’t have much confidence in Liu Buyan’s medicinal pill.","As a cultivator of the human race, he has limited cultivation resources, so what good medicine can he have!","However, after only a dozen or so breaths passed, Xuan Qingling suddenly felt an incomparably cool feeling coming from her meridians...","Due to the fire energy invading her meridians, she has been feeling like her meridians are on fire during this entire time, burning her internal organs.","No matter what pill she took, she couldn’t suppress this feeling.","But now...","She could clearly feel that the fire energy was being slowly suppressed, and her own profound strength was stimulated, slowly flowing out from her dantian.","Not long after, she felt that half of her internal injuries had healed. At least, it wouldn’t make her completely unable to fight anymore!","Xuan Qingling suddenly opened her eyes which were filled with surprise, “Young Master Liu, I... I’m really much better! Your medicinal pill is really amazing!”","She has always had a cold personality, and she rarely got so excited.","It’s true that the medicinal pill Liu Buyan gave her was so effective that it completely exceeded her expectations!","Liu Buyan looked at her surprised face and smiled slightly.","Heh, he didn’t notice this before but this iceberg beauty is quite cute when she smiles.","“Now you know that my medicine is effective?” He pointed to another medicine bottle, “The ointment in that bottle is for trauma, you should rub some on it and try.”","Xuan Qingling picked up the medicine bottle, showing some hesitation.","Seeing this, Liu Buyan couldn’t help laughing, “I’ll just turn my back, and I promise not to peek! But, to be honest, Young Miss Xuan, your figure is really... the front and back are almost the same, Even if you show me, I’m not interested either.”","Xuan Qing was so angry that he almost vomited blood!","Which of the young Black Tortoise Clan cultivators around her was not in awe of her talent and strength and respected her? Has she ever met a man like Liu Buyan who never forgets to tease her one in three sentences?","And...","Xuan Qingling subconsciously looked down at her chest.","She has to admit that what Liu Buyan said seemed to make sense...","Was she really a little developmentally delayed?"]},{"number":3971,"title":"Chapter 3971 Barking up the Wrong Tree (3)","paragraphs":["3971 Barking up the Wrong Tree (3)","Damn, what was she thinking?","Xuan Qingling tapped her head in frustration, deeply felt that she really hadn’t slept for several days and nights, and was so tired that her mind was not clear.","To actually listen to such an unreliable guy talking nonsense here!","She was a talented cultivator of the Ancient God Clan and she was not any showgirl so how endowed she was was none of that stinky man’s business!","And Liu Buyan waited for a while, but didn’t hear any movement behind him, so he couldn’t help urging: “Young Miss Xuan, how are you? Have you applied the medicine already?”","Only then did Xuan Qingling come back to her senses, and hurriedly shouted: “Wait a while!”","She hastily rolled up her sleeves, exposing the wound, and carefully applied the medicine bit by bit.","Although it was as light as possible, several of her wounds were very deep, and when touched, they still hurt so deeply that she couldn’t help but let out a hiss.","Liu Buyan felt his heart tugged when he heard it.","He was not a very sympathetic person, however, hearing a girl in such pain and not screaming out loud, just sucking in to restrain herself made him feel even more uncomfortable.","Deliberately wanting to look back at the situation, but thinking of Xuan Qingling’s cold demeanor, he still didn’t do so.","Finally, Xuan Qingling applied ointment to every wound.","A miraculous thing happened.","Almost as soon as her wound touched the ointment, the bleeding wound began to heal, and the cold touch of the ointment effectively relieved her pain.","Xuan Qingling put away the medicine bottle and got dressed.","In just such a short time, she discovered that several of the relatively minor wounds were no longer painful!","This time, Xuan Qingling was shocked!","She never expected that the medicinal pill and ointment that Liu Buyan took out were all such incredulous medicines!","Although she was not a professional, she still has common sense. If such a bottle of medicinal pill was taken out, it will definitely fetch sky-high prices in auction houses on all continents!","Even the elders of their clan, or even the Patriarch, might rush to seek it.","Xuan Qingling immediately felt that this kindness was great!","She hastily handed the used medicine bottle to Liu Buyan, “Young Master Liu, your medicinal pill is so effective that my injury is already half healed. I have never used such an easy-to-use medicinal pill. This time, I really have to thank you!”","Liu Buyan didn’t take back the medicine bottle, “It’s alright, keep the medicinal pill, your injury is serious, it will take three consecutive days to fully heal. Besides, if you fight later, you might get injured again.”","“But... this... this pill is too expensive! How could you...” Xuan Qingling was dumbfounded.","Was she mistaken? Will Liu Buyan give her the whole bottle of pills?","Does he know how valuable these pills are!","As a human race, how could he have so much money and give away such life-saving magic pills to others casually? Could it be that he got it from Young Master Li?","However, even if Young Master Li is really with Liu Buyan’s Junior Sister, then it’s impossible for Liu Buyan to spend so much, right?","Liu Buyan saw the doubts in her heart, and explained: “This is not an expensive medicine, it’s just refined by myself. In fact, I have better quality here, these are for daily use, you don’t need to worry too much, take it!”","Although it was the medicinal pill that he and Huang Yueli Li Moying used daily, Liu Buyan was not a kind person."]},{"number":3972,"title":"Chapter 3972 Barking up the Wrong Tree (4)","paragraphs":["3972 Barking up the Wrong Tree (4)","Originally, he would not give away the pills so casually.","However, Xuan Qingling gave him a good impression.","When the two bumped into each other by accident just now, Xuan Qingling could pull him in and use him a backstop, but she insisted on driving him away, without even asking for a word of help.","Some people may think that this was just the basic morality of human beings.","However, Liu Buyan has some experience, and he knows very well that the so-called morality was not worth mentioning when it is really a life-and-death crisis!","Many people who seem to be dignified and dignified on weekdays, as if they are gentlemen, when they are really dying, they don’t care about the interests of others at all, and only want to keep themselves alive! At any cost!","And Xuan Qingling was obviously not such a person.","Besides, Huang Yueli had mentioned to him before about her cooperative relationship with Xuan Qingling.","It’s not easy for the younger sister to find a partner with such a decent personality, Liu Buyan still doesn’t mind helping her a little more.","But Xuan Qingling was so shocked that she couldn’t speak because of Liu Buyan’s casual explanation.","“You, you... what did you say? You made this medicinal pill yourself??”","Liu Buyan nodded, “Yup.”","“How is it possible? How is this possible?” Xuan Qingling cried out in shock, “These pills are at least heaven-level! Could it be that you are a heaven-level Spirit Medicine Master? But you... how old are you? No, not even ordinary heaven-level medicinal pills have such a good effect, this prescription must have been improved!”","Xuan Qingling felt that she had been through a whirlwind.","What exactly was going on?","Are there already so many geniuses in the God Realm? How can she meet heaven-defying geniuses so casually?","First, a god-level genius like Li Moying appeared out of thin air.","Later, when she was in White Tiger Continent, she met a genius Spirit Armament Master who could improve the standard of Spirit Armaments!","And now, there was another talented Spirit Medicine Master!","Xuan Qingling herself was a Spiritual Artifact Master, and she was also a person who has learned the craft, so she knows very well what kind of effort it takes to improve these skills to a certain level! And how many people, trying every means and spending countless money, can’t reach the peak!","Liu Buyan smiled, and said: “Young Miss Xuan misunderstood, in fact, those medicinal pills you took just now are only earth-level medicinal pills, but their efficacy is better than ordinary earth-level medicinal pills.”","The medicinal pill he took out was indeed improved.","However, he was not as talented as his Junior Sister. The brand new fire control method was invented by Huang Yueli, and he just learned from her.","However, he was indeed quite talented in the medicinal pill technique. After learning the method of controlling fire, he quickly put it into practice and made a breakthrough in the medicinal pill technique.","It took Xuan Qingling a while to calm down.","At this moment, when she looked at Liu Buyan again, it was completely different from before!","Just now she thought that Liu Buyan should be hugging Li Moying’s thigh through Huang Yueli, but now she thinks...to be able to hang out with Young Master Li and become a Sworn Brothers with him, it really was extraordinary!","Liu Buyan noticed the implicit admiration in the girl’s gaze, and couldn’t help feeling a little complacent.","However, their current situation was not the time for him to enjoy the admiration of others with a peace of mind.","Seeing that Xuan Qingling had almost recovered, he immediately asked the question that had been pressing in his mind for a long time: “Young Miss Xuan, why on earth were you chased and killed by those spirit beasts?”"]},{"number":3973,"title":"Chapter 3973 Barking Up The Wrong Tree (5)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3973 Barking Up The Wrong Tree (5)","When Xuan Qingling heard this question, thinking of the predicament the two of them were facing now, her expression became a little downcast.","“Oh, it’s all my fault for being too impulsive...”","She simply talked about how she took advantage of the Astute Blaze Beast’s weakness during childbirth to take the Moon Lotus, but was chased and killed by the spirit beasts in the entire trial of the secret realm.","Although she didn’t describe the process of her escape in detail, Liu Buyan could imagine how many arduous battles Xuan Qingling had experienced in the past few days.","He couldn’t help but have a little admiration for Xuan Qingling.","So tenacious, so persistent, as long as such a cultivator does not fall halfway, one will definitely become a top powerhouse.","After hearing her finish, Liu Buyan thought for a while and said, “Are you sure the Moon Lotus can’t leave your side?”","Xuan Qingling nodded, “I’m sure! I’ve tried six times on the road to throw it away, but all failed! I also tried to set it on fire to burn it, or just crush it with my feet. However, it has no effect at all. It seems that the Moon Lotus will not suffer any damage at all!”","Liu Buyan frowned and thought for a moment, then suddenly asked: “Young Miss Xuan, can you let me see Moon Lotus?”","“This...” Xuan Qingling hesitated for a moment.","Liu Buyan hurriedly said: “If it’s inconvenient, forget it, I was indeed reckless in asking. Such a treasure, itself, shouldn’t be shown casually to others...”","Seeing his nervousness, Xuan Qingling laughed and said, “Young Master Liu, you misunderstood. This is not a treasure, but a burden that I can’t even throw away! I hesitated just now because I was afraid that you would get affected by this Moon Lotus. I’m afraid that you would also be entangled by those spirit beasts and end up like me with no way to escape.”","Liu Buyan smiled, “Even if you don’t show me the Moon Lotus, I won’t be able to get away? If Young Miss Xuan has nothing to hide, why don’t you take out the Moon Lotus, let’s study it together and think of a way.”","Xuan Qingling nodded, and carefully took out a lotus flower from the interspatial ring.","This Moon Lotus flower was larger than ordinary lotus flowers. Its whole body was snow white, and there was a faint halo wrapped around the petals.","When Liu Buyan saw it, his eyes lit up immediately, “This Moon Lotus... overflows with spiritual energy. If it is used as medicine, it will have the effect of promoting muscle and blood circulation, and bringing the dead back to life!”","Xuan Qingling blinked, “Really? I can only see that this Moon Lotus is definitely a treasure, but I can’t see what it can be used for.”","Liu Buyan smiled, “Such a kind of treasure of heaven and earth is definitely not only useful in alchemy, but I am a Spirit Medicine Master, so I only consider it from this perspective. Can I touch it?”","Seeing Xuan Qingling nod her head, Liu Buyan stretched out his hand towards Moon Lotus, wanting to feel the breath of Moon Lotus.","But who knew, seeing his fingers were about to land on the petals, suddenly...","“Ouch!!”","Liu Buyan suddenly let out a cry of pain, and hurriedly took his hand back.","“This... this flower is really not simple!”","The moment he was about to touch the Moon Lotus, the hazy moonlight around the Moon Lotus suddenly exploded, becoming bright and dazzling. At the same time, a powerful energy erupted from it, knocking Liu Buyan’s hand away.","Fortunately, he was used to being careful and he was prepared when it struck, otherwise, his entire right hand will probably be blown away by now!"]},{"number":3974,"title":"Chapter 3974 Barking Up The Wrong Tree (6)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3974 Barking Up The Wrong Tree (6)","“Young Master Liu, are you alright?” Xuan Qingling didn’t expect this to happen, she was startled, and hurried over to see Liu Buyan’s injury.","Liu Buyan shook his head, and said: “It’s alright, it’s not too late for me to stop, I just suffered some traumatic injuries, I just need to apply some ointment later. But... It seems that this Moon Lotus has set its sight on you? ”","Xuan Qingling’s face collapsed all of a sudden, “Isn’t it so?! I thought it just couldn’t be thrown away, but now I realize that others can’t even touch it!”","“This is going to be a big trouble! You are carrying such a thing, the target is too big, how can we escape the pursuit of spirit beasts?”","Almost as soon as Liu Buyan finished speaking, the two of them heard commotion coming from outside the cave.","When Moon Lotus was in Xuan Qingling’s interspatial ring just now, she was doing relatively well. Most of her aura was covered by the interspatial ring.","After taking it out now, a large amount of spiritual energy escaped outwards, which tempted the high-level spirit beasts waiting outside and became more irritable.","A few spirit beasts couldn’t hold back anymore, they rushed to the entrance of the cave again, tentatively stretching out their claws into the cave.","Even Xuan Qingling who has always been calm and independent could no longer take it and her expression crumbled!","Could it be that with the temptation of the Moon Lotus, even Liu Buyan’s medicine powder can’t stop these spirit beasts!","Seeing that these spirit beasts were getting closer and closer, almost passing the area marked by Liu Buyan’s medicine powder, Xuan Qingling’s hands and feet were stiff for a moment, and she didn’t know what to do.","Liu Buyan hurriedly called out: “Young Miss Xuan, quickly throw the Moon Lotus out! Quick! Throw it at them!”","There was a flash in Xuan Qingling’s mind, and she also realised that this is the best way!","Although she discarded the Moon Lotus several times before, they were all secretly placed in secluded places.","It’s not that she doesn’t want to throw the Moon Lotus directly at the spirit beast, but that she can’t get so close to the spirit beast and still keep herself safe.","Therefore, she could only choose a safer and more reliable method.","But now, these high-level spirit beasts were right in front of them but they were still afraid of the power exuded by Liu Buyan’s medicine powder, so they did not dare approach them for a while. This was an excellent opportunity!","She quickly understood and made a decisive decision. With a slight flick of her wrist, she threw the Moon Lotus flower towards the entrance of the cave!","The Moon Lotus flower with a hazy light drew a beautiful arc in midair, like a shooting star, flew towards the entrance of the cave, crossed the boundary of the medicine powder, and flew directly into the herd of spirit beasts.","All the spirit beasts were obviously taken aback.","But soon, they let out a roar, and stretched out their claws one by one, scrambling to grab the Moon Lotus!","There were many spirit beasts, but there was only one Moon Lotus.","The fight between the spirit beasts quickly escalated into a brutal bloodbath!","In this way, no spirit beast would pay attention to the two tiny humans in the cave.","Seeing this, both Liu Buyan and Xuan Qingling let out a long sigh of relief.","Xuan Qingling looked at Liu Buyan even more differently, “Young Master Liu, you are so witty! The timing just now was impeccable! If you hadn’t reminded me in time, I still wouldn’t be able to react!”","Liu Buyan kept a reserved attitude as much as possible, and said with a smile, “I’m just quick witted in an emergency. Fortunately, this method is...effective...”","Before he finished speaking, he suddenly straightened his back, his eyes widened and he looked out of the cave again."]},{"number":3975,"title":"Chapter 3975 Barking Up The Wrong Tree (7)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3975 Barking Up The Wrong Tree (7)","Suddenly, a dazzling golden light erupted from wihin the fray of spirit beasts!","The few high-level spirit beasts at the centre of the battle were all hit by the golden light and were sent roaring and flying backwards.","And that burst of golden light gradually shrunk and slowly rose from the ground.","The centre of the golden light was that Moon Lotus flower!","After being embroiled in the intense fight between so many spirit beasts just now, if it was an ordinary lotus, it would be impossible to find a complete petal.","However, this Moon Lotus was still luscious and intact, it looks like it was just picked off.","Liu Buyan and Xuan Qingling stared dumbfounded at Moon Lotus flying through the air and returning to Xuan Qingling’s arms again.","The two of them were really dumbfounded now!","It turns out that Xuan Qingling’s so-called inability to throw it away was really impossible to throw it away!","Not only can it not be thrown away if it was placed anywhere, even if it was thrown directly to the spirit beasts to devour, it was still useless!","Xuan Qingling wanted to cry but had no tears, “So, I can only carry this Moon Lotus with me all the time?”","Liu Buyan was also despondent for a moment.","However, compared to Xuan Qingling who was almost exhausted after being chased by spirit beasts for three days and two nights, he was obviously much more rational.","Liu Buyan thought for a while, when his eyes suddenly lit up and he snapped his fingers.","“Yes! We clearly did it wrong just now! In fact, we don’t need to escape from here at all. As long as we persist for half a day, the five-day experience time will be over. At that time, we will be sent to the trial outside of the secret realm, we will be safe then.”","Xuan Qingling thought about it carefully, and then nodded.","“Yes, what you said makes sense. It’s just... these spirit beasts seem to be getting more and more courageous, and they almost entered the cave just now. Can your medicine powder really last for such a long time? Animal repelling medicine powders rely on special scents and if they are used to the smell of the medicine powder to lure spirit beasts, they might rush in directly.”","Liu Buyan laughed, “You don’t have to worry about that. I can’t just bring a bottle of medicine powder with me when I go out. Since you’re worried, I’ll add some food to these small animals.”","“Small... small animals??” Xuan Qingling looked at him, bewildered.","The herd of spirit beasts outside were all several metres tall, giants who can turn people into minced meat with a single slap, alright?","How did they become small animals from Liu Buyan?","Liu Buyan took out a new bottle of medicinal powder from his sleeve, and walked towards the entrance of the cave.","There were still a few high-level spirit beasts that have not left, and were still hovering in front of the cave entrance.","Seeing Liu Buyan walking over, as if about to go out, several spirit beasts became excited, and all moved to the front of the cave, as if they were waiting for a certain prey to walk into their mouths by themselves.","This scene made Xuan Qingling’s heart rise in her throat, and she was extremely nervous.","“Liu... Young Master Liu, you must be careful! This is too risky, you come back first, and we will think of a way...”","However, Liu Buyan didn’t stop in his footsteps, but walked straight to the entrance of the cave, only less than one metre away from the spirit beasts.","It seems that these spirit beasts can bite his head off as long as they stretch their necks forward a little and open their mouths again.","As a matter of fact, there were some brutal spirit beasts who really did this.","A tiger-shaped spirit beast suddenly opened its mouth wide, trying to bite Liu Buyan in two.","But who would have thought that as soon as it opened its mouth, it was sprinkled with a handful of medicinal powder."]},{"number":3976,"title":"Chapter 3976 Barking up the Wrong Tree (8)","paragraphs":["3976 Barking up the Wrong Tree (8)","“Aw~~~Woo~~~Aw~~~Woo~~~~”","Immediately, the miserable cry of this tiger-shaped spirit beast echoed throughout the woods.","It really made me sad when I smelled it, and shed tears when I saw it.","“Hahahaha...” Liu Buyan laughed so hard that he fell down, “You dare to take the idea of the young master’s human flesh! Is my meat also affordable for you? No, it’s too hot, right?”","Xuan Qingling was stunned by the reaction of the tiger-shaped spirit beast, and was speechless for a long time.","Next, she was struck by Liu Buyan’s exaggerated laughter and smiled wryly.","This Liu Buyan... has quite a bit of ability, but he was a little too unreliable, right? Does he really treat himself like a dish? It’s so spicy!","Liu Buyan chased away a tiger-shaped spirit beast, and frightened the other spirit beasts that were staring at it.","They looked at the tiger-shaped spirit beast that was screaming miserably, and at the fragrant Moon Lotus inside. After weighing for a moment, they chose to leave temporarily.","Liu Buyan quickly took the medicine bottle and sprinkled it around the hole.","When he came back, Xuan Qingling had already put away the Moon Lotus.","It feels much safer to put it in the interspatial ring, but to those spirit beasts outside, it was some kind of strong drug. It really makes people feel insecure.","Liu Buyan sat down against the cave wall, turned his head and said, “Young Miss Xuan, how old are you this year...”","Since the two of them still had to wait in this cave for a long time, Liu Buyan decided to chat with the young girl beside him. Anyway, being idle is idle, how stupid would he be if it was all silent!","However, as soon as he turned his head, he didn’t finish a sentence, and found that Xuan Qingling was sitting cross-legged on the ground with her eyes closed and her breath restrained. It was obvious that she had already entered the state of cultivation!","Liu Buyan was stunned for a moment.","It’s unknown whether the two of them are still alive or dead here! There are so many high-level spirit beasts roaring at the door all the time, the only line of defense they rely on was a pile of medicinal powder.","I don’t know if I can get out alive after half a day.","This Xuan Qingling actually still has the mood to cultivate? ?","Were all the cultivators of the Ancient God Clan race so perverted?","Liu Buyan was really rendered speechless by Xuan Qingling!","However, she had already delved into cultivation and it was not easy for him to forcibly wake her up to chat with him. In desperation, he had no choice but to close his eyes and cultivate as well.","During the period, the medicinal powder dissipated to some extent several times, causing the spirit beasts at the entrance of the cave to become restless again. Liu Buyan interrupted his cultivation and added the medicinal powder again.","Just like that, seven hours passed without any risk.","Seeing that the time for teleportation was approaching, Xuan Qingling took the initiative to stop cultivating and waited with Liu Buyan.","After going through a series of battles, both of them now desperately hope that they can return to a safe place immediately.","“My time today should be a little earlier than yours. I will definitely be sent it out later. Don’t worry, if the medicine powder here lasts for another hour, you will be able to get out safely.” Liu Buyan was afraid that she would be uneasy, and explained.","Xuan Qingling nodded, “I got it.”","Although the two of them only fought side by side for a short half a day, she already trusted Liu Buyan very much.","There was a special charm in this man.","Although his appearance and behaviour seem to make people feel that he was very unreliable, in fact, this was just a disguise.","Liu Buyan was far stronger than what he showed on the outside!"]},{"number":3977,"title":"Chapter 3977 Cornered (1)","paragraphs":["3977 Cornered (1)","The two of them sat side by side, leaning against the cave wall, and started chatting, waiting for the moment of teleportation.","However, the two talked about everything from their own life experiences to their family background, to their hobbies... almost everything.","At this time, Xuan Qingling suddenly woke up and realised that something was wrong.","“Strange, how long have we been chatting, why haven’t you been sent out yet?”","Liu Buyan was taken aback, and it was like waking up from a dream, “That’s right, what’s going on? My time here is clearly up!”","The chat with Xuan Qingling was too speculative just now, he didn’t even pay attention to the time, but now that he thinked back carefully, he realised that half an hour had already passed.","No, nearly an hour has passed!","Even Xuan Qingling estimated that the time when she would teleport out by herself was almost here.","The two looked at each other, and both saw a trace of uneasiness in each other’s eyes.","Xuan Qingling asked: “Young Master Liu, think about it again, could it be that you misremembered the time?”","Liu Buyan frowned and said: “How is this possible? I came with my Junior Sister and Young Master Li. Before the two of them entered the cave, I was afraid that they would miss the time and not have time to go to Floating Sea, so I specially checked the time and told them, Then I entered the trial of the secret realm. Can this still be remembered wrongly?”","Xuan Qingling’s eyes widened after hearing this, “Wait, you said your Junior Sister entered the cave together with Young Master Li? God-level geniuses can bring their companions into the cave together? This is the first time I’ve heard of it. There is such a thing!”","If this is the case, wouldn’t the people of the Cloudy Qilin Clan take advantage of it, they could be brought in one by one by Li Moying, and there was no need to pass the trial of the secret realm at all.","Liu Buyan was taken aback, and realised that he had slipped up and exposed his Junior Sister’s cultivation.","However, in his eyes, Xuan Qingling was someone he could trust, so after thinking about it, he decided not to hide it from her.","“Of course Li Moying can’t bring anyone in. My Junior Sister can go in because...”","In the middle of his speech, suddenly, there was a beeping sound from the corner of the cave.","Liu Buyan’s words were interrupted, because both of them immediately looked at the source of the sound, which was an hourglass specially set up by them.","The sound just now was the warning sound when the sand in the hourglass ran out.","This means... Xuan Qingling’s teleportation time has come!","Liu Buyan’s eyes turned to Xuan Qingling, waiting for her figure to disappear.","If it was still possible for him to remember the time he entered wrongly, then it was definitely impossible for Xuan Qingling to remember wrongly.","Because she brought a whole team to the trial this time, representing the person in charge of the Black Tortoise Clan, it was impossible to remember the time clearly.","However, one breath, two breaths, three breaths...","Ten breaths, twenty breaths, thirty breaths...","A stick of incense time passed, and Xuan Qingling was still sitting there, not even a strand of hair was missing from her body.","Both of them were experienced fighters. If they still can’t see the problem, then they have lived in vain.","Immediately, both Liu Buyan and Xuan Qingling showed extremely disappointed expressions.","“We’re in big trouble now...” Xuan Qingling frowned.","“What the hell!” Liu Buyan slammed his fist heavily on the cave wall.","He used so much force that the entire cave shook a few times."]},{"number":3978,"title":"Chapter 3978 Cornered (2)","paragraphs":["3978 Cornered (2)","However, this did not relieve the pressure in his heart at all.","Seeing him like this, Xuan Qingling rushed over to stop him, “Young Master Liu, no! Don’t be so impulsive! Calm down, calm down! We are still safe now, we can think of a way, maybe there is still a chance to escape. Don’t waste your energy, let’s sit down and discuss slowly.”","Probably because of the water attribute, Xuan Qingling has a reassuring aura about her.","Hearing her gentle voice whispering in his ears, Liu Buyan felt as if a clear spring flowed through his heart, and his restless emotions were suppressed.","He obeyed Xuan Qingling’s words and sat down again.","“Calm down! How can I calm down now? The matter is very clear. Although the cultivators who failed the trial will all be sent outside the cave at the end of the five days. However, since we have the Moon Lotus in our hands, it has not been judged as a trial failure, on the contrary, we should still be in the trial process. This process has to be maintained until we send the Moon Lotus to the transmission centre, or we are eaten to death by the spirit beast!”","Xuan Qingling’s speculation was the same, so she didn’t say much, but seemed quite guilty.","“I’m sorry, Young Master Liu, I’m really sorry! If it weren’t for me, you wouldn’t have been involved in such a big trouble. It’s all my fault. Originally, you were doing the trial alone in the secret realm, at least it was safe.”","Seeing her extremely guilty look, Liu Buyan couldn’t bear it, so he quickly shook his head and said, “Young Miss Xuan, don’t say that, you have already asked me to run for my life, and I insisted on following you. Besides, This level of danger is just a trivial matter for me. How can a cultivator break through without encountering a life-and-death crisis? Today’s encounter may be an opportunity for the two of us!”","Xuan Qingling heard that, although her expression was still a little lonely, her mood improved a lot.","“Young Master Liu, you are really good at comforting people, and it made me feel much better.”","“This is not consolation, but a fact.” Liu Buyan said with a smile.","Xuan Qingling nodded, and said: “You are right, this is a danger, but also an opportunity! If we can break through the siege, bring the Moon Lotus to the transmission centre, and pass the trial, we will be able to enter the cave successfully and obtain the inheritance. I believe we can do it!”","“I believe so as well!”","The two encouraged each other with confidence, but when it came to concrete actions, they encountered difficulties again.","“Although the effect of my medicine powder is good, the quantity is limited after all, and it is impossible to use it forever. In fact, I only have one bottle of medicine powder, and I can last for half a day. We must find ways to escape during this half day.” There is a way. Otherwise, when the medicine powder is used up, these spirit beasts will swarm up, and we will have nowhere to escape!”","Xuan Qingling nodded, “That’s right, we can’t sit still! There are only two ways now.”","Liu Buyan looked at Xuan Qingling, waiting for her to tell her plan.","“First, find a way to get out! There are fewer spirit beasts gathered outside than when we first came in. Maybe we can fight our way out.”","“No, this is absolutely not feasible!”","Liu Buyan immediately rejected this suggestion."]},{"number":3979,"title":"Chapter 3979 Cornered (3)","paragraphs":["3979 Cornered (3)","“Although the number of spirit beasts outside seems to be a little less, in fact, many spirit beasts are hiding in the woods, or hunting nearby. Once we leave the cave, these spirit beasts will be able to recover in a short time and catch up with us quickly and continue to hunt us down.”","“Besides, when you ran for your life, you kept a certain distance from these spirit beasts, but now these spirit beasts are all crowded at the door! How can it be possible to kill them! If we had such strength, we wouldn’t be trapped here for days.”","Xuan Qingling actually felt that the first method was not reliable, so she said, “Well, then this way is considered unfeasible. But the second way seems even more unreliable.”","“Why so? Let’s discuss it.” Liu Buyan urged her.","Xuan Qingling looked at the entrance of the cave, then turned her head to look at the back, and said, “Since you can’t go from the front, you can only go in other directions. I just observed it, and there is a cool air flow from the back of this cave blowing from the outside, it seems that there must be an exit leading to the outside at the back, let’s look carefully, maybe we can find it.”","Hearing this, Liu Buyan couldn’t help but sighed.","“I knew you would say this! Actually, before I brought you here, I had already lived in this cave for one night. At that time, I guessed that there was an exit behind the cave, so I went there to check it out.”","When he said this, he paused.","Xuan Qingling immediately felt terrible, “What’s going on? Is there something wrong? You can’t get through the exit?”","She reacted very quickly, knowing that since Liu Buyan had looked for it, if there was a way out, he would have said it long ago. It is impossible to wait until now, when they are in such a desperate situation.","Sure enough, Liu Buyan nodded depressedly and said, “You will find out if you come with me and have a look.”","With that said, he walked towards the back of the cave first.","Xuan Qingling quickly followed.","The inside of the cave was very dark, but Liu Buyan’s fire attribute talent was also very high. With a snap of his fingers, several lighting sparks flew out, illuminating the surrounding environment like daylight.","Behind the cave was a large gourd-shaped space. There were many weathered bones in it, and there were some scratch marks of beasts on the ground. Obviously, this was the cave where a high-level spirit beast once lived in.","Liu Buyan went straight to a corner and pushed aside some weeds with his hands, revealing a small hole.","“The air current you feel should come from here. I have searched for other places, and there is no other place than this little vent.”","Xuan Qingling knelt down, examined it carefully, and immediately frowned.","Because, this hole looks really small, about the size of a dog hole on the wall of someone else’s house, and it’s obviously unrealistic for people to go in.","Moreover, from their point of view, the inside of this dog hole was pitch black, so it can be seen that it should be a very long tunnel. They did not know how long it was and did not know what was at the other end. Climbing directly into it was no different from sending themselves to death.","Seeing this, Xuan Qingling’s face collapsed, “Then there is nothing else we can do? Are we really going to sit here and wait to die?”","Liu Buyan’s face also darkened.","In fact, although he was optimistic just now, he basically said it to comfort Xuan Qingling.","He also felt that it was unlikely for the two of them to escape this time."]},{"number":3980,"title":"Chapter 3980 Cornered (4)","paragraphs":["3980 Cornered (4)","However, realising that Xuan Qingling beside him was looking at him for help, Liu Buyan couldn’t say a word of negativity.","He gritted his teeth, and said bravely: “Let’s think about it again, isn’t it only half a day... no, how many hours? Maybe we can figure out a way! If it really doesn’t work, we can at least be fully armed. Let’s fight to the death with those spirit beasts! Although there are many of them, we are not weak, and we are not sure who will win and who will lose in the end!”","After hearing this, Xuan Qingling actually understood that this time, she probably had to leave her little life here.","However, there were very few cultivators who could cultivate to this stage who were greedy for life and afraid of death, and Xuan Qingling was no exception.","She was already prepared for the worst.","Moreover, thinking that before she died, she could still meet a new partner with the same goals, she felt that she was quite lucky.","A man like Liu Buyan was a type of man she had never met before.","He was completely different from the kind of genius of the Ancient God Clan with their eyes always stuck to the skies that she usually associates with.","Even if he was implicated and may even lose his life here, he didn’t harbour any grievances at all. Instead, he still thought about her every time.","The two sat down on the ground again.","This time, Xuan Qingling flipped her wrist and took something out of her interspatial ring.","“What did you take out? Is it some powerful Spirit Armament? By the way, you are a Spirit Armament master! What good treasures are there?” Liu Buyan came over curiously.","Xuan Qingling smiled wryly and shook her head, “What can I do? I used to think that I was at least among the younger generation, a genius Spirit Armament Master. As a result, compared with that Li Yuehuang, the real genius is someone like her!”","“Hehe, she is indeed a genius, genius to the point of pervert! We don’t need to compare with perverts, right?” Liu Buyan unconsciously complained about his Junior Sister in order to comfort her.","Xuan Qingling gave him a strange look, “What? Young Master Liu, you also know Miss Li?”","“Uh, this...”","It was only then that Liu Buyan remembered that Xuan Qingling didn’t know that his Junior Sister was the Spirit Armament Master from White Tiger Continent, and he was about to explain it to Xuan Qingling.","However, Xuan Qingling stopped looking at him, and put the things she took out in front of the two of them.","Liu Buyan looked at it and couldn’t help being stunned.","“This...could it be wine?”","Xuan Qingling nodded, and said with a smile: “Yes, this is the unique secret recipe of our Black Tortoise Clan! Have you heard of the Thousand Days Rhapsody?”","Liu Buyan exclaimed, “I seem to have heard of it. I heard that this kind of wine from your Black Tortoise Clan can only be brewed with natural treasures. It can boost the cultivation of cultivators even those of the Dao Profound Realm. A bottle is priceless!”","Xuan Qingling nodded slightly, “That’s right, this wine is very precious even within our clan, and only elders in the Dao Profound Realm can occasionally get a bottle or two. It takes five years to be the first to get the reward.”","“So precious...”","Xuan Qingling shook her head, “No matter how precious it is, it’s just a thing. Both of us probably won’t survive today, so we don’t need to think much about it. Why don’t we just open this bottle of wine! Maybe we can make a breakthrough in our strength. Even if we can’t make a breakthrough, it is a blessing in life to meet a confidant in wine.”"]},{"number":3981,"title":"Chapter 3981 Saved! (1)","paragraphs":["3981 Saved! (1)","Liu Buyan was also a person with a free and easy personality, after hearing what she said, naturally he will not shirk it.","He smiled casually, “Alright, since that’s the case, then I’ll come and taste what this so-called top wine famous in the God Realm tastes like!”","Xuan Qingling took out two white jade cups from her interspatial ring, put them on the ground, opened the seal on the wine bottle and filled the cups.","She picked up one of the cups and held it to Liu Buyan, “Young Master Liu, let me pay my respects to you with this cup! When I first saw you earlier, I thought you were just hanging alongside to gain the benefits of Young Master Li. If there is any offence, please don’t take it to heart.”","Liu Buyan smiled and said, “How can I argue with girls about such trivial things? Speaking of which, I really have no skills. After arriving in the God Realm, I can only be considered good at medicine. My cultivation is indeed far behind that of you God Realm cultivators!”","Xuan Qingling hurriedly said: “Young Master Liu, you’re too modest! Among the human cultivators, I have never seen one with higher talent than you. Even if I have a higher cultivation base, it is just taking advantage of my blood. Moreover, I have been cultivated by the family, and I have obtained more resources than you. If we have the same background and the same experience, I am afraid that I am far inferior to you!”","“Young Miss Xuan’s words make me ashamed...”","The two talked to each other, chatting and drinking one cup after another.","Liu Buyan considered himself a good drinker. When he was in the lower realm, except for Li Moying, he had never lost a drinking bout with others!","Not to mention drinking with a girl now.","So, he drank very readily, as long as Xuan Qingling filled it up for him, he would immediately gulp it down.","After drinking a few cups, Liu Buyan’s hand suddenly trembled.","With a “bang”, the white jade cup slipped from his hand, hit the ground, and shattered.","Xuan Qingling’s gaze flashed, and she leaned towards him, calling out in a low voice, “Young Master Liu? Are you drunk?”","“Drunk...what...drunk...I...I’m not...not drunk...”","Liu Buyan murmured, his head lowered little by little, and his voice became softer...","Xuan Qingling hooked her lips, and threw out the small bottle she hid in her sleeve to hold wine.","Just now, she and Liu Buyan seemed to be drinking each other, but in fact, Liu Buyan was the only one who really drank the Thousand Days Rhapsody.","Xuan Qingling herself had been prepared for a long time, and poured out all the wine in the glass with a clever technique.","Liu Buyan never thought that Xuan Qingling would plot against him at this time, so he was totally caught off guard.","After a few breaths, Liu Buyan fell to the ground with a “boom”, straight and motionless.","Xuan Qingling knelt down and touched his face, but Liu Buyan didn’t move at all.","Only then did she heave a sigh of relief, “Young Master Liu, thank you so much today. If you hadn’t saved me, I wouldn’t have lived another day. On this day, I have made friends like you. However, there is love and righteousness, but I can’t really let you die with me. There is no other way now, and I can only treat a dead horse as a living horse doctor. You should avoid it for a while, and hope that after I die, these spirit beasts will recede and you still have a chance to survive.”","After Xuan Qingling finished speaking to the unconscious Liu Buyan, she stood up, bent down and grabbed the clothes on Liu Buyan’s shoulders, and dragged him to a corner."]},{"number":3982,"title":"Chapter 3982 Saved! (2)","paragraphs":["3982 Saved! (2)","Soon, she came to the “dog hole” that the two of them had just checked earlier.","Xuan Qingling probed and checked the situation in the cave again.","Then, she clasped her hands together, and said to Liu Buyan in a very apologetic tone: “Young Master Liu, I really have to wrong you! This hole is actually not deep, but you don’t know what it’s for, so you feel there may be danger on the other side. Of course, for ordinary people, getting into this hole is bad enough, but now it is for survival, and you should be willing to bear it, right?”","Obviously, it was impossible for Liu Buyan to answer her.","Xuan Qingling said: “Very well, I’ll take it as your agreement.”","After finishing speaking, she dragged Liu Buyan’s body, and directly stuffed him into the “dog hole” with his head turned inward.","This hole was indeed too small for an adult, especially Liu Buyan was a tall man.","However, Xuan Qingling was a cultivator of the water attribute, and she cast a secret technique, causing some small streams of water to seep into the cave.","In this way, the rocks beside the hole became loose, and the lubricating effect of the water flow created an impulsive force.","Seeing that everything was ready, Xuan Qingling kicked Liu Buyan’s ass violently.","“Boom”!","Liu Buyan’s body rushed to the other end of the “dog hole” along with the water flow.","Hearing the sound of a heavy object falling to the ground from the other end of the cave, Xuan Qingling’s brows twitched, and she clasped her hands together again, “Young Master Liu, you have to remember, this is all for survival!”","At this time, outside the cave, the roars of the spirit beasts gradually became more and more intense and violent.","Moreover, judging from where the sounds came from, they were getting closer and closer to the cave.","Apparently, Liu Buyan’s medicinal powder was slowly dissipating and gradually lost its effect.","It won’t be long before these spirit beasts will rush into the cave.","Xuan Qingling took a deep breath, and took out the weapon she was best at using from the interspatial ring. It was a pair of nine-section whips, or an improved version of the standard Spirit Armament that Huang Yueli personally refined.","Then, she put on a full set of profound armaments and took all the pills that could improve her strength.","Finally, she took a step forward and walked slowly towards the entrance of the cave.","Anyway, she can’t escape now. If she waits in the cave until the medicine powder completely dissipates and so many high-level spirit beasts swarm in, she will definitely be torn into pieces on the spot, and she will die without dignity!","Instead of doing this, she might as well rush out by herself!","Although the result is probably death, at least it’s much better than hiding in a cave!","As a cultivator, how can she be like a turtle with a shrinking head, waiting to be dragged out of the turtle’s shell?","Only fighting is the final destination of cultivators!","Even if she died in the course of the battle, it was a worthy death!","Xuan Qingling’s gaze became more and more determined, and her walking speed became faster and faster. Water mist gradually rose around her body, enveloping her in it.","This was formed only when the water profound energy of heaven and earth reaches a certain concentration!","Logically speaking, since this secret realm is dominated by the fire attribute, the water attribute fighters, not to mention attracting the profound energy from the outside world to condense into mist, even the profound energy in their own bodies can’t exert 50% of its power.","But now, Xuan Qingling has achieved something almost impossible!","Threading by death’s door, let’s see how far she can go!"]},{"number":3983,"title":"Chapter 3983 Saved! (3)","paragraphs":["3983 Saved! (3)","At this time, Xuan Qingling felt that she was full of strength, and the little Thousand Days Rhapsody that she drank just now seemed to have also had an effect, making the flow of profound energy in her body reach a peak, and it seemed that she would be able to advance at any time!","The speed under her feet also accelerated, and she began to run.","Passing by a line drawn by Liu Buyan’s medicinal powder...","If she takes this step, she will lose the last protection and will be exposed to many spirit beasts.","However, Xuan Qingling didn’t stop!","With a light jump, she jumped over the boundary and jumped outside the cave.","The spirit beasts lurking outside had been waiting for a long time, and they were getting impatient. They all waited for the powder to be disbursed before entering the cave to snatch the Moon Lotus.","They never thought that the people inside would come out on their own initiative!","For a moment, all the spirit beasts stared at the slender and vigorous figure of the woman at the entrance of the cave, but did not move.","Seeing this, Xuan Qingling ran away decisively!","It’s a pity that although her reaction was quick, the spirit beasts weren’t really stupid, they were just stunned at first.","It didn’t take long before they all came to their senses and rushed towards her!","Xuan Qingling didn’t even take a few steps before being overtaken.","She immediately threw out her nine-section whip and started fighting with the spirit beasts.","The profound strength in her body was also rising steadily, and even, at a certain moment, broke through a certain limit in her Dantian and completed the breakthrough!","From the early stage of the Heart Profound Realm to the middle stage of the Heart Profound Realm!","Reaching the middle stage of the Heart Profound Realm at such an age was very rare even for a heavenly genius.","However, advancing under such circumstances was luck, and even more misfortune!","She didn’t even have time to stabilise her cultivation, so she continued to fight without stopping!","Although Xuan Qingling’s strength has been raised to a higher level, she has faced too many spirit beasts! After killing one, another herd will come!","And she was only the only person!","In the end, her profound strength was gradually exhausted, and her body became more and more uncontrollable, feeling a little numb...","She knew that this was her last...","“It’s a pity... But, I was able to kill so many spirit beasts by myself. I didn’t even dare to think about it before...”","“I hope Young Master Liu won’t blame me after he wakes up...”","Xuan Qingling’s consciousness was a little blurred, so that when she heard the screams from the group of spirit beasts, she thought she was hallucinating.","But it didn’t take long for her to realise that something really happened in the group of spirit beasts.","Because, the several high-level spirit beasts that were still besieging her suddenly retreated from her at the same time, turned around and rushed towards the opposite direction.","Xuan Qingling was stunned for a moment, “What’s going on? Didn’t they grab the Moon Lotus yet?”","She touched the Moon Lotus flower in her bosom, feeling a little dazed, wondering what the situation was?","For this flower, these spirit beasts guarded her for three days and three nights!","Now that she was about to fall, they left by themselves instead? ?","Just then, she seemed to hear someone talking not far away.","“Husband, you still have a solution! We searched in the secret realm for several hours before, but we didn’t even find a shadow of a spirit beast. Now that we have picked a Moon Lotus, there are so many lovely spirit beasts to play with us! Why didn’t I think of it!” The girl’s sweet voice sounded."]},{"number":3984,"title":"Chapter 3984 Saved! (4)","paragraphs":["3984 Saved! (4)","The man’s helpless voice came, “You can play if you want, but don’t play too much! We are not here to kill spirit beasts, but to find people! Pay attention to which direction these spirit beasts come from, our ultimate goal is to find your Senior Brother!”","Huang Yueli sighed, “Oh, I got it! I don’t know what happened to Senior Brother! Look, there are a lot of spirit beasts running over there! Senior Brother must be in that direction, let’s go there quickly!”","Xuan Qingling’s eyes widened. She really felt that she was dreaming!","However, no matter what she thought, the scene in front of her was extremely clear.","In the woods in the distance, a beautiful girl was pulling a tall and handsome man and running forward together.","The man’s expression was cold, but his gaze towards the girl was gentle and helpless.","The two of them ran very fast, and, that direction...","It was the direction where those high-level spirit beasts who had left her turned and ran!","If these two people run any further, they will immediately collide with those spirit beasts head-on!","“Be careful! Go away! There are many spirit beasts ahead! Go, go!”","Seeing this, Xuan Qingling became anxious, and shouted loudly, trying to make them leave quickly.","However, when she heard the cry, the girl’s eyes suddenly lit up, “There is a sound! Someone is calling! Great, it seems that we really found the right place this time! Husband, hurry up!”","Li Moying’s expression also became serious, and he quickened his pace without being dragged by Huang Yueli.","Xuan Qingling saw that the two of them didn’t turn around and run for their lives, but ran over here, almost fainting!","How could such a stupid person even come to the secret realm for trials? This, this, this... simply seeking the road to death!","Seeing that the two of them were about to collide head-on with the group of spirit beasts, Xuan Qingling couldn’t bear to watch it any longer.","However, the next moment...","“Boom!” There was a loud noise!","A thunderbolt suddenly fell from the sky, with astonishing power, it illuminated the entire sky so brightly that people couldn’t open their eyes.","Xuan Qingling closed her eyes subconsciously to avoid such powerful energy.","The ground was shaken constantly by the earthquake. When Xuan Qingling stood firm and opened her eyes again, the scene in front of her almost made her jaw drop to the ground.","Those high-level spirit beasts who were aggressive just now have all fallen to the ground, with scorched black marks on their bodies.","And in the middle of the herd of spirit beasts, the man and woman were still running towards her.","The two of them were already very close to her.","Xuan Qingling could finally see the person’s face clearly, and exclaimed immediately: “Li...Young Master Li!!!”","Li Moying and Huang Yueli were very fast, coupled with their impatience, they had already run in front of Xuan Qingling.","“Young Miss Xuan, you are indeed here! These spirit beasts are chasing after you, right?” Huang Yueli blinked her big eyes and looked at Xuan Qingling up and down, “How is it? Are you injured?”","Xuan Qingling has been shocked to the extreme, and she still hasn’t recovered from it.","Hearing Huang Yueli’s voice, she suddenly came back to her senses, and hurriedly said: “I...I...I’m fine! Young Master Li, and this...girl, you came too timely! If it weren’t for you, I would have died today...”","Huang Yueli couldn’t care less about saying these polite words to her, and kept looking behind Xuan Qingling. After looking for a long time, she didn’t find Liu Buyan’s figure, so she couldn’t help but frown."]},{"number":3985,"title":"Chapter 3985 Saved! (5)","paragraphs":["3985 Saved! (5)","“Young Miss Xuan, have you seen my Senior Brother? Hmm... he is about the same height as Moying, and he is pretty good-looking, and he has two deep dimples when he smiles. He wears a blue robe and is a wood attribute cultivator... ”","Xuan Qingling had already guessed that the two of them came to rescue Liu Buyan, and after hearing Huang Yueli describe him to such an extent, she couldn’t pretend to not know any more.","She nodded and was about to answer, but at this moment, out of the corner of her eye, she saw something approaching Huang Yueli from behind and her face suddenly changed.","“Girl, be careful!! Quick, get out of the way!!!”","Those high-level spirit beasts were the most unlucky. Even though they ran the fastest, they were all charred into a pile of ashes by Li Moying’s thunderbolt.","However, there were still some who ran slowly, did not enter Li Moying’s attack range and escaped by luck.","These spirit beasts were scared out of their wits at first, and hurriedly turned their heads and ran for their lives, but after waiting for a while, realizing that no one was chasing them, they gradually became more courageous, and began to tentatively surround the three of them.","After all, the attraction of a Moon Lotus was strong enough for them to chase Xuan Qingling for three days and three nights.","And now, Huang Yueli also has a Moon Lotus on her body!","There were two Moon Lotus flowers in the same place at the same time, this was simply a fatal attraction!","Even though they knew that Huang Yueli and Li Moying were not easy to mess with, there were still many spirit beasts who couldn’t resist the temptation and surrounded them one after another.","Seeing the three talking, they didn’t seem to be paying attention to the surrounding situation. Several of the most powerful high-level spirit beasts looked at each other, and suddenly made a concentrated effort to pounce on the three of them!","By the time Xuan Qingling spoke, it was already too late.","Seeing that three high-level spirit beasts had already pounced on Huang Yueli’s head at the same time, she didn’t dare to look any longer, and couldn’t help closing her eyes.","Even if Li Moying was by this little girl’s side, it might be too late to save her!","This girl will definitely be torn to pieces by the spirit beast!","“Oh...!!!”","There was a shrill scream, and immediately, a strong smell of blood and... the smell of barbecue?","Xuan Qingling sniffed, feeling that something was wrong, so she quickly opened her eyes to take a look.","She saw Huang Yueli standing in front of her intact, holding a beautifully embroidered silk handkerchief to wipe her hands.","And at her feet, the three high-level spirit beasts that attacked her just now collapsed to the ground and were burnt to death.","Moreover, judging from the slightly charred heat on their bodies and the smell of barbecued meat in the air, the people who burned them to death controlled the fire very well.","These spirit beasts are definitely charred on the outside and tender on the inside, with crispy skin...","Xuan Qingling’s eyes widened, her jaw almost fell to the ground.","Just now... What exactly happened?","Why did the three powerful high-level spirit beasts turn into three barbeques in the blink of an eye?","Besides, she didn’t see Li Moying summoning lightning, did she?","Not necessarily, these three high-level spirit beasts were all killed by the girl beside him, right?","But, how was this possible? Even for herself, if she wanted to kill these three spirit beasts, she would have to go through a bloody battle, and she might even risk her life!","But just now, it was only an instant, and the three spirit beasts were instantly killed!","This is something that only god-level geniuses can do, right?","When Xuan Qingling was in doubt, Huang Yueli had already walked over again, and continued to ask: “Young Miss Xuan, we haven’t finished talking just now! You said you met my Senior Brother? When?”"]},{"number":3986,"title":"Chapter 3986 Saved! (6)","paragraphs":["3986 Saved! (6)","Xuan Qingling wanted to speak again, but unexpectedly, at this moment, another eight high-level spirit beasts rushed towards Huang Yueli together.","This scene scared her so much that she almost screamed on the spot!","But who knew, the girl standing in front of her just frowned impatiently, then raised her right hand slightly.","A burst of flames appeared from her palm, and shot towards the sky quickly. The blaze suddenly became extremely bright, wrapped in powerful fire-attribute energy, and shot straight into the sky!","The spirit beasts that flew towards her felt the danger immediately, and wanted to flee in all directions in panic.","But, it was too late.","They were already wrapped in the flames, they couldn’t even make a roar, they were engulfed by the flames.","The blazing fire only existed for a short period of two breaths.","Huang Yueli just spread out her palms, paused for a moment, and clenched her fists again.","The flames also disappeared.","Immediately after, the corpses of the spirit beasts fell from mid-air one after another, hitting the ground continuously.","The corpses of these spirit beasts were exactly the same as the three just now. They were all charred on the outside and tender on the inside, and they looked perfectly cooked.","Seeing this scene with her own eyes made Xuan Qingling flustered.","This... What’s the situation? She must be dreaming, must be dreaming, definitely dreaming!","The little girl in front of her doesn’t look half her age, and she looks delicate, and she doesn’t seem to be able to bear the hardships of cultivation. How could she be such a terrifying master?","Huang Yueli killed eight high-level spirit beasts with one move, but she didn’t have any excited expression on her face. Instead, she looked a little unhappy and complained to the man beside her.","“There are too few spirit beasts here! You can’t kill a few of them at once! Unlike the Illusion Array of your Cloudy Qilin Clan, there are as many as you want in it, and there are hundreds of them together. That’s more exciting!”","In Li Moying’s usually indifferent eyes, there was a gentle look and he laughed softly: “We are here to find people, not for the trial, so don’t worry about it so much. I will take you to the place of experience in the future , let you kill as many as you like!”","“Don’t lie to me! Do what you say!” Huang Yueli blinked her big eyes, grabbed her husband’s sleeve with one hand, and forced him to promise.","Li Moying said: “When have I ever lied to you?”","Only now was Huang Yueli happy, and she turned to look at Xuan Qingling again.","Seeing her sluggish look, she couldn’t help but frowned, “What’s the matter? Young Miss Xuan has been chased by spirit beasts for the past two days, and she was seriously injured and her brain was broken, right? Why did she stay in a daze? She looks dumb, and can’t even finish her sentence... If this is the case, where can we find our Senior Brother?”","Li Moying coldly glanced at Xuan Qingling who was lying limp on the ground, without any emotion in his eyes.","“If she doesn’t know where Liu Buyan is, just leave her alone. Let’s go and kill all the spirit beasts in the secret realm and then we will find him slowly. I don’t believe it, your Senior Brother is so treacherous and cunning. Will such a person die like this? Impossible!”","“Hey, you really don’t feel pity at all! It’s a life anyway! Since I saw Young Miss Xuan, I’ll save her by the way. How can I leave her here?” Huang Yueli shook her head helplessly.","Li Moying just let out a cold snort.","In his eyes, only Huang Yueli is the most important. Why stain his eyes with others?"]},{"number":3987,"title":"Chapter 3987 Leaving a Psychological Shadow (1)","paragraphs":["3987 Leaving a Psychological Shadow (1)","Huang Yueli knew her husband’s temper, so she didn’t say much, walked up to Xuan Qingling, squatted down, and held her wrist to feel her pulse.","“It doesn’t seem like a big problem, it’s just that you’ve been overly frightened.”","She took out a medicine bottle from her interspatial ring, poured out a few pills, and stuffed them into Xuan Qingling’s mouth.","These elixirs were all good medicines for calming the mind and heart. Once ingested, Xuan Qingling gradually calmed down.","After regaining her senses, she stared at Huang Yueli with wide eyes, still unable to accept the reality.","This girl who she thought was misbehaving and hooking up with a married man was actually a peerless genius with outstanding talent! Probably a god-level genius like Li Moying!","Huang Yueli was still muttering, “Looks like her complexion has improved a bit, alas, what a pity! She has been scared silly by those spirit beasts!”","After hearing this, Xuan Qingling almost vomited blood.","She wasn’t scared by those spirit beasts, she was completely scared by Huang Yueli herself, alright?","Didn’t this girl realize that she is scarier than some powerful king-level spirit beast?","However, at this moment she had regained her senses, and remembering that they were looking for Liu Buyan, she hurriedly said: “Li...Young Miss Li, are you looking for Young Master Liu? I have been together with him for the past two days. We’ve been fighting against spirit beasts together, we just separated not long ago...”","“How is he now? Why is he separated from you again? Could it be...” Huang Yueli became even more nervous when she heard this.","Generally speaking, in such a dangerous situation, two people fighting side by side would not easily separate.","Unless there was some crisis, or one of them was already dead!","Xuan Qingling hurriedly said: “Don’t worry, Young Master Liu is not in danger.”","Li Moying and Huang Yueli looked at each other, and both let out a sigh of relief.","However, before they were completely relieved, Xuan Qingling added: “Well, although he won’t die, but...uh, his situation should not be very good...”","Seeing that Huang Yueli became anxious again, Li Moying quickly grabbed his little fox, and scratched her palm twice comfortingly, telling her to calm down.","“Young Miss Xuan, what’s going on? Don’t worry, explain clearly slowly. Also, if you remember Liu Buyan’s location, take us there to find him.”","Xuan Qingling nodded again and again, “Alright, I’ll take you there. However, I have a Moon Lotus on my body, and I’ve been hunted down by those spirit beasts. I’m afraid there will be some trouble on the way...”","Hearing this, Huang Yueli took out a golden lotus flower from her bosom, and said with a smile: “The Moon Lotus flower you mentioned is this one, right?”","Seeing the Moon Lotus flower appearing in the air, Xuan Qingling’s face suddenly changed, “Miss, you...how can you take out the Moon Lotus flower? Quickly, put it away! Otherwise, all the spirit beasts will surround you...”","Halfway through speaking, she suddenly remembered Huang Yueli’s ability to instantly kill eight high-level spirit beasts with one move, and she couldn’t help but stop.","“I almost forgot, you two are so powerful that you don’t care about the siege of these spirit beasts at all. Unlike me, who only picked a Moon Lotus by chance, and got into big trouble because of it, and almost got Young Master Liu involved...”","“You two, please come with me. Young Master Liu is in the cave ahead, not far from here.”","Xuan Qingling led the way, leading Huang Yueli and Li Moying to the cave.","Along the way, there were still many spirit beasts rushing towards the Moon Lotus.","However, Huang Yueli made two casual gestures, and all of them were burnt into barbecue."]},{"number":3988,"title":"Chapter 3988 Leaving a Psychological Shadow (2)","paragraphs":["3988 Leaving a Psychological Shadow (2)","Xuan Qingling watched from the side, deeply sighing in her heart.","If she had such strength, how could she have been hunted down by these spirit beasts and ended up in such a mess?","The gap between people was really too big!","She began to wonder where she came from? She had never heard that there was a second god-level genius comparable to Li Moying?","The three returned to the cave, and Huang Yueli casually sprinkled some medicinal powder on the entrance of the cave.","Although she and Li Moying were strong enough, but now they have business to do, it would be troublesome if some flies and mosquitoes kept coming to disturb them.","With Liu Buyan in mind, she rushed to the innermost place as soon as she came in, and looked inside and out of the cave.","The hole was not big, and she immediately judged that there was no one in the hole.","“What’s going on? Senior Brother, he doesn’t seem to be here? Could it be that after you left, he walked away by himself?” Huang Yueli frowned, thinking suspiciously, “If he walked out by himself, it would be troublesome. Now, we have to find someone again.”","Xuan Qingling shook his head and said, “That’s not the case, Young Master Liu is in the cave, but you didn’t pay attention.”","As Xuan Qingling said, she walked to the corner, squatted down and pushed aside the weeds, revealing the “dog hole” just now.","Huang Yueli stared at the hole for a while before realizing it, and asked in surprise, “No way? You don’t want to tell me that my brother escaped from this dog hole?”","Was it that exaggerated?","Based on her decades of friendship with Liu Buyan, she thinks she knows Liu Buyan’s character very well.","Even if it was to escape for his life, he wouldn’t be willing to go through a dog’s hole, would he?","Taking a ten thousand step back, even if he really reached the end of the mountain and went through the dog’s hole, he couldn’t leave a girl behind and go into the dog’s hole to escape by himself!","Liu Buyan really wants to save face!","Huang Yueli always felt that something was wrong, so she turned her head and looked at Xuan Qingling.","Xuan Qingling cleared her throat, and explained: “To be precise, Young Master Liu didn’t get in by himself, it was me...uh, I got him drunk, and when he was unconscious, I forcefully pushed him down...”","Huang Yueli was taken aback for a moment, “Why?”","Xuan Qingling lowered her head in shame, “Oh, to be honest with you two, I was the one who provoked these spirit beasts by picking the Moon Lotus flower, but in order to save me, Young Master Liu was implicated by me and was also hunted down by them. I don’t want him to die because of me, so I could only resort to this trick...”","Huang Yueli immediately understood.","It must be that Xuan Qingling was resolute to die alone, and was afraid that Liu Buyan would follow her, so she came up with this idea...","Thinking of this, Huang Yueli couldn’t help but look at Xuan Qingling a few more times, and she had a higher opinion of her in her heart.","When life and death are on the line, cultivators who can still consider others in this way ware rare.","This Young Miss Xuanqing Ling was really outstanding in character. She was so much better than Li Leyun who bullies ordinary cultivators just because of her outstanding status and strength!","Huang Yueli’s voice became softer, “Young Miss Xuan, I thank you on behalf of my Senior Brother! After we rescue the Senior Brother, we will definitely repay you for saving his life!”","As she spoke, she gave Li Moying a wink, signaling him to blast open the hole to save people.","Just as Li Moying was about to make a move, Xuan Qingling’s face suddenly changed, “Young Master Li, please wait!”"]},{"number":3989,"title":"Chapter 3989 Leaving a Psychological Shadow (3)","paragraphs":["3989 Leaving a Psychological Shadow (3)","“What’s wrong?” Huang Yueli and Li Moying didn’t expect that Xuan Qingling would suddenly jump out to stop them at this time, they were both startled.","A look of embarrassment appeared on Xuan Qingling’s face, and he said hesitantly, “Uh... um, um... there’s something I have to tell you first, so that you can be mentally prepared...”","Huang Yueli became even more puzzled, “What’s going on? Young Miss Xuan, just tell me straight!”","Xuan Qingling hesitated for a while before gritting his teeth and said, “This is... ahem, the entrance of the cave below actually does not lead to the outside of the cave, but is a part of the cave.”","“So?” Huang Yueli blinked.","“This cave must have been inhabited by a high-level spirit beast. Based on my years of experience, this kind of spirit beast lived, ate, and lived in the cave for a long time. During this process, it will definitely need to deal with some, um... things that are not very clean. That small hole was dug out by the spirit beast to hold those things...”","Xuan Qingling also knew that it was impossible to keep this matter a secret. After thinking about it, she still said it in one breath.","After listening to what she said, Huang Yueli didn’t understand what she meant at first.","After a while, she burst out laughing, “Ahem, this...Young Miss Xuan, you mean...there is a... shit hole underneath?”","Xuan Qingling nodded in embarrassment, “Yes... yes... that...”","She never expected that Huang Yueli would say the word “shit hole” so directly.","She took a cautious look at Li Moying, and found that Li Moying’s mouth was tightly pursed, and her face was not very good-looking. She was afraid that he would be angry, so she hurriedly explained: “Young Master Li, there is still this girl, I really... I really didn’t mean to let Young Master Liu go into that hole. Wasn’t there no way at that time? Young Master Liu stayed in the cave, and it was a dead end. The only way was to get into that hole, and I went to lure most of the spirit beasts away. Only with the attention gone can he have a chance to live...”","Huang Yueli was already laughing so hard that she couldn’t straighten up","Seeing Xuan Qingling’s nervous and bewildered expression, she barely stopped laughing, walked up to her, and comforted her: “Young Miss Xuan, please don’t get me wrong, we definitely don’t mean to blame you. You At such a critical time, you can still think of such a good way to save my brother, we can’t thank you enough!”","Xuan Qingling was still a little apprehensive, “But... but... I hurt him after all... Will Young Master Li be unhappy?”","Huang Yueli turned her head to look at her husband.","There was no expression on that handsome and impeccable face, and it looked particularly inscrutable.","It’s no wonder that Young Miss Xuan was frightened.","Huang Yueli twisted his waist forcefully, “Moying, stop pretending! Looking at my Senior Brother’s misfortune, you want to laugh more than anyone else right? Don’t hold back!”","The muscles on Li Moying’s face twitched and he glared at her little fox.","It was already very hard for him to hold back his laughter, yet this little fox came to provoke him!","However, looking at Huang Yueli’s smiling face, he still couldn’t help laughing.","“You! When will you not tear down my desk?”","The man, who was originally handsome, smiled at this moment, and his aloof and indifferent temperament completely melted away, revealing an obvious gentle look in his eyes."]},{"number":3990,"title":"Chapter 3990 Leaving a Psychological Shadow (4)","paragraphs":["3990 Leaving a Psychological Shadow (4)","Xuan Qingling opened her mouth wide in surprise, and couldn’t believe her eyes.","It’s really hard to imagine that a man like Li Moying could ever be so gentle.","However, seeing the relaxed manner in which this young couple had, she finally heaved a sigh of relief.","She was also worried that her bad behavior of stuffing Liu Buyan into the cesspit would cause dissatisfaction with Li Moying and the others.","Now it seems that she was really worrying too much.","After flirting with her husband for a while, Huang Yueli finally remembered that her poor Senior Brother was still in the cesspit, and hurriedly urged Li Moying to save him.","Although it was not difficult for her to blast away the mountain wall, but considering that behind the mountain wall was... well, she decided that it would be better to stay away and leave the physical work to men.","Huang Yueli pulled Xuan Qingling and retreated outside the cave together.","Not long after, a dazzling lightning suddenly fell from the sky and smashed into the mountain wall!","“Boom! Boom——!”","Violent vibrations radiated from the ground under their feet.","That earth-shattering aura seemed as if the entire mountain had been split open by Li Moying.","The nearby sand and gravel were all shaken and flew into the air.","Xuan Qingling quickly closed her eyes. When she opened her eyes again, she realized that the mountain seemed to have been split into two? Rubbing her eyes and staring agape at the unbelievable scene before her eyes, Li Moying had really split the mountain into two!","The previous location of the cave entrance has now become a long tunnel leading to the other side of the mountain.","Huang Yueli and Xuan Qingling walked over together, and when they reached the entrance of the cave, they smelled a stench coming from inside.","“Ughhh...Ughhh...It stinks...” Huang Yueli covered her nose, with an expression on the verge of fainting, she refused to move forward no matter what.","Ever since she joined Li Moying, she has been lovingly doted on by her husband, how could she suffer such a crime! It’s such a smelly place!","Xuan Qingling seemed much calmer. Although her face was pale, she still walked forward bravely.","She was not as delicate as Huang Yueli, and, Liu Buyan is her benefactor after all, she feels that she can’t despise him just because he smells bad!","Seeing this, Huang Yueli quickly grabbed her, “Don’t go, they will come out later.”","“But...” Xuan Qingling hesitated.","She couldn’t imagine that Young Master Li, who is as dignified and elegant as a god, would jump into the cesspit to fetch someone!","However, after a while, she realized that she was thinking too much.","Because, Li Moying came out of the cave, dragging a very long rope in his hand, and a figure was tied to the other end of the rope, dragging him out of the ground...it was Liu Buyan.","Xuan Qingling hurried over and checked Liu Buyan’s situation nervously.","And after Li Moying dragged the person out, he also looked like he couldn’t bear it. He simply flicked the rope and walked towards Huang Yueli.","Huang Yueli backed away again and again, not letting him approach, “No, move away! You stink so bad! Don’t touch me unless you take a bath!”","Li Moying’s face turned dark, “Impossible! I was very careful just now, and I made sure that I didn’t get any dirt on it, so I definitely don’t stink! If you don’t believe me, why don’t you come and smell it?”","“I don’t smell it, I don’t smell it! You must be lying to me!” Huang Yueli held her nose with a firm attitude.","Li Moying coaxed her for a long time, but he was still ruthlessly rejected by his own wife ten meters away."]},{"number":3991,"title":"Chapter 3991 Leaving a Psychological Shadow (5)","paragraphs":["3991 Leaving a Psychological Shadow (5)","Li Moying was heartbroken!","If he knew it earlier, he wouldn’t have saved that brat Liu Buyan!","It’s alright to always interfere with his intimacy with his wife, but now, in order to save him, he even caused himself to be rejected by his wife!","Such an eyesore, he should lie in the cesspit for a few more days.","Anyway, the Thousand Days Rhapsody can’t kill anyone. Liu Buyan will wake up after being drunk for a few days and nights, and he will crawl out by then, so he doesn’t need to be rescued.","Thinking of this, he couldn’t help but glare at Liu Buyan.","Liu Buyan was lying on the ground pitifully. Fortunately, there was Xuan Qingling who didn’t dislike the stench on his body. She squatted on the ground and carefully checked his physical condition.","She only let out a long sigh of relief after discovering that he was only in a coma due to drunkenness and that there was no external injury on his body.","Huang Yueli saw it from a distance, and said with a smile: “Young Miss Xuan, you don’t have to worry, Senior Brother is definitely fine, that thing in the cesspit... must be soft, can he still be injured?”","Xuan Qingling said: “But Young Master Liu has been so drunk, how can we take him out of the secret realm?”","Speaking of this, she suddenly thought of more important things, and her face froze, “By the way, I have to go to Floating Sea to participate in the God Realm’s Grand Meet! You three must go too? Now because I and The reason for Young Master Liu is that it has been delayed for such a long time, so I don’t know if we can make it in time?”","Huang Yueli didn’t care at all, she still looked very relaxed.","“It’s alright, Young Miss Xuan, don’t worry, our airship is faster, if you go with us, you can still make it in time.”","Li Moying also nodded.","With two god-level geniuses as guarantees, Xuan Qingling naturally did not believe it, and was obviously relieved.","“That’s good, that’s good! But, we can’t delay any longer, right? Well, I’ll carry Young Master Liu on my back, and we’ll go to the teleportation array now!”","Since both Xuan Qingling and Huang Yueli were carrying Moon Lotus, they had to go to the teleportation formation and complete the task of escorting the Moon Lotus before they could leave the trial secret realm. There was no other way to teleport.","After Xuan Qingling finished speaking, she grabbed Liu Buyan’s sleeve and prepared to carry him on her back.","As a cultivator in the Profound Mind Realm, carrying a big man on her back was still effortless.","The only depressing thing is that Liu Buyan really stinks now! Xuan Qingling was very afraid that she would be fainted by the stench on the way.","Seeing her doing this, Huang Yueli’s eyes widened, and she secretly said to her husband: “Husband, look quickly! This Young Miss Xuan is really affectionate and righteous, and she doesn’t dislike her Senior Brother who is so stinky! It’s not bad, she’s a Spirit Armament Master! Isn’t she a good match for my Senior Brother?”","Li Moying didn’t have the heart to look at other women, he was still depressed because Huang Yueli wouldn’t let him get close!","“I don’t know, who cares what she does? But, if she can really get Liu Buyan away from me, I can give her a generous dowry!”","Huang Yueli couldn’t help but burst out laughing, how much resentment her husband had towards Liu Buyan!","Seeing Xuan Qingling’s difficult appearance, Huang Yueli finally realized his conscience, took out a bottle of medicine pill from his clothes, and threw it towards Xuan Qingling from a long distance away.","“Young Miss Xuan, I almost forgot that this hangover pill was made by my brother himself. According to him, no matter how seriously drunk a person is, as long as he takes three pills, he will definitely wake up. Give him a little to try.”"]},{"number":3992,"title":"Chapter 3992 Leaving a Psychological Shadow (6)","paragraphs":["3992 Leaving a Psychological Shadow (6)","If Liu Buyan was awake, he would definitely scold Huang Yueli for being heartless.","Obviously she had medicine, but it took so long for her to take it out!","However, Xuan Qingling didn’t have so many complicated thoughts. She picked up the pill from the ground and thanked Huang Yueli solemnly. She opened the bottle and poured out a handful of pills. There were a few, and all of them were stuffed into Liu Buyan’s mouth.","After finishing, she nervously stared at Liu Buyan’s dirty face, for fear that these pills would not work.","Fortunately, what she was worried about didn’t happen.","Liu Buyan swallowed the elixir, and not long after, his face gradually changed from pale to rosy, and he gradually regained consciousness.","His eyelids trembled slightly, and finally, he opened them all at once.","Xuan Qingling almost cried with joy, “Young Master Liu, you... you finally woke up! That’s great! Really great! Are you alright?”","Seeing Xuan Qingling’s face, Liu Buyan sat up from the ground, and asked excitedly: “What’s going on? Young Miss Xuan, what happened just now? Why did I faint all of a sudden? I can’t have been drunk, can I?”","Xuan Qingling coughed twice: “Ahem, this... Thousand Days Rhapsody is indeed an extremely strong alcohol, you were really drunk...”","Liu Buyan hadn’t figured out what the problem was yet and was still extremely upset.","“Hey, we are doomed now! There is not much time left, and I have been drunk for such a long time! How is it? What’s the situation now? Are the spirit beasts rushing in soon? Let’s make some preparations quickly, and we can’t die like this. It’s too ugly a manner to die...”","Xuan Qingling hurriedly interrupted him, “Ahem, Young Master Liu, don’t worry, don’t get excited... In fact, we’ve already been saved...”","“What? Saved?” Liu Buyan was taken aback, and then realized that he was not in a cave, but in the woods, and there wasn’t even a single spirit beast around.","“Saved? How did you get saved? Those spirit beasts have been chasing us for so long, how could they let us go so easily?”","Xuan Qingling pointed in Huang Yueli’s direction, and said: “Young Master Li and your Junior Sister are here, the two of them are amazingly strong, even those high-level spirit beasts can’t stop them, they have all been cleaned up.”","Liu Buyan looked in the direction she indicated, and when he saw Huang Yueli and Li Moying, his eyes lit up immediately, and he jumped up from the ground, about to run over.","“Junior Sister! You... you are finally here! Thanks to you, otherwise Senior Brother would be in a miserable situation this time! There is also the one named Li... Well, I can ...thank you!”","Seeing Liu Buyan running towards this side, Huang Yueli’s face changed abruptly, and she didn’t care to keep a distance and she resolutely turned around and ran away.","Liu Buyan never expected that Huang Yueli would actually run away. After being surprised for a moment, he quickly chased after her.","“Oh? Junior Sister, why are you running? Stop quickly! I have something to tell you!”","“Hey, wait!”","However, the squeamish little fox couldn’t stand the smell of him and ran even faster.","The speed of her and Li Moying was naturally not something that Liu Buyan could catch up with. After chasing for a long distance, he found that the distance from Huang Yueli was getting farther and farther, so he could only stop.","As soon as he stopped, Huang Yueli also stopped running.","Liu Buyan, who was puzzled, shouted loudly: “Junior Sister, why are you running? Seeing your Senior Brother safe and sound, shouldn’t you be happy?”"]},{"number":3993,"title":"Chapter 3993 Leaving a Psychological Shadow (7)","paragraphs":["3993 Leaving a Psychological Shadow (7)","Huang Yueli scratched her nose and laughed wryly, “Ha ha, of course I’m happy, but you... stay away from me! Don’t come here...”","Liu Buyan frowned, feeling that something was wrong.","Although Li Moying was always arguing with him, his Junior Sister cared about him very much, and she never ran away when she saw him?","At this moment, Xuan Qingling finally caught up from behind, seeing Liu Buyan standing in the woods with a dazed expression on his face, she coughed heavily.","“Ahem, Young Master Liu!”","“Young Miss Xuan, it’s you! What’s going on? Did something happen? Why did my Junior Sister run away?”","Xuan Qingling gave him several winks, trying to hint at him.","However, Liu Buyan was always lacking in this aspect, and couldn’t react at all, “What’s wrong? Young Miss Xuan, are your eyes cramping?”","Xuan Qingling looked at the sky speechlessly, so she could only say, “Young Master Liu, do you feel... well, that there is something wrong with the smell on your body?”","Liu Buyan was startled when he heard this.","He just drank so much Thousand Days Rhapsody. Such kind of strong alcohol actually has a paralyzing effect on the five senses of people, so his sense of smell was much worse than usual, and he was currently immersed in joy after being saved, so he did not notice that his body smelled wrong.","But now, after hearing Xuan Qingling’s prompt, he immediately came to his senses.","The stench around him seemed to pour into his nose in an instant, and rushed straight to his forehead.","“Ughh...ughh...ughhhh...” Liu Buyan supported the trunk of a big tree, retching endlessly.","After finally controlling his nausea, he quickly turned his head and asked Xuan Qingling, “Young Miss Xuan, where did this smell come from? Why is it so stinky?”","Xuan Qingling smirked in embarrassment, “Well... Young Master Liu, you must be calm, calm... being alive is happiness, so everything else is trivial...”","She stepped back slowly, step by step, until she had retreated more than 20 steps before stopping.","“What’s the situation?” Seeing the exaggerated reactions of everyone around him, Liu Buyan had a bad feeling in his heart.","Xuan Qingling said: “Actually, that’s...umm... just now I was afraid that you would be attacked by spirit beasts, and when I saw you were drunk, I tried to stuff you into the small hole we saw on the wall. I was thinking, no matter where the cave leads to, whether it is dangerous or not, it is better than waiting in the cave to die, right? Not long after, your Junior Sister and Young Master Li came to save me, and Young Master Li blasted open the cave wall and saved you. That’s when we found ...um...”","Speaking of which, she had another meal.","“What did you find? Young Miss Xuan, stop being tricky, tell me quickly!”","Xuan Qingling said: “I found...under the entrance of the cave, it seems to be a spirit beast that used to live in the cave, used to accumulate excrement...cough cough, so it’s a little dirty and smelly...”","Xuan Qingling spoke in a more reserved manner, but Liu Buyan didn’t realize it for a while.","When he realized what the so-called “excrement” was, his face suddenly changed.","“This... this... you mean, all the stains on my body are...shit?!”","“Ahem, well... Actually, I can’t say that. After all, the spirit beasts in the cave may have been dead for thousands of years, and the things below have been dried for a long time. Except for a little smell, it should be the same as that. There’s not much resemblance either.”"]},{"number":3994,"title":"Chapter 3994 Leaving a Psychological Shadow (8)","paragraphs":["3994 Leaving a Psychological Shadow (8)","Xuan Qingling racked her brains to comfort him and she squeezed out all her eloquence she had.","It’s a pity that no matter how gorgeous the vocabulary was, it can’t cover up the fact that Liu Buyan fell into the cesspit.","What made him twitch even more was that when he woke up just now, he always felt something wet on his face, could it be...","Cough cough, I don’t know if he accidentally ate it when he was drunk?","Thinking of this, Liu Buyan couldn’t bear such a blow any longer, his face turned pale, and he fell straight to the ground.","He actually passed out again!","Xuan Qingling was taken aback, and quickly raised her voice to call out, “Young Master Li, and... that Lady, please come over and have a look, something is wrong, Young Master Liu has passed out again!”","Standing far away under a big tree, Huang Yueli had already seen everything that happened between Liu Buyan and Xuan Qingling.","She laughed a few times: “Young Miss Xuan, don’t worry, my Senior Brother is definitely fine, but he was hit too hard and will wake up after a while.”","“That’s good, then we...”","Huang Yueli was afraid that Xuan Qingling would ask her to stay and take care of Liu Buyan, so she quickly interrupted her, “Young Miss Xuan, I will leave my Senior Brother to you, Moying and I have some things to do, we must leave first! How about this, you can help clean up my Senior Brother, and when he wakes up, take him to wait for us near the teleportation array, we will be there in two hours.”","Xuan Qingling was startled, seeing that the two of them were about to leave after finishing speaking, she hurriedly called out, “Hey, wait! You wait! Young Master Liu and I are not strong enough, how will we go to the teleportation array later? What if we meet some spirit beasts?”","Huang Yueli smiled and said: “That’s impossible, we will be responsible for cleaning up the remaining spirit beasts.”","“Ah?” Xuan Qingling was taken aback again.","Really, what Huang Yueli said sounds a little too scary to her!","Cleaning up the remaining spirit beasts, as if she said, “throw away the leftovers from yesterday’s meal”, seems to be a matter of little effort.","Does she know how many high-level spirit beasts there are in this secret realm?","Moreover, there were seven king-level spirit beasts!","“Then... where are you two going? Can you reach the teleportation array in two hours?”","Huang Yueli beamed at her, “Young Miss Xuan, you don’t have to worry about us, we are just going to deal with small things. Moon Lotus is a good thing, whether it is refining weapons or alchemy, it is very useful! The Moon Lotus in this secret realm is still ten thousand years old, and there is no place to buy it outside this secret realm! We’ll go and collect the remaining few Moon Lotus flowers, otherwise it will be a waste to put them in the secret realm.”","Hearing this, Xuan Qingling was instantly petrified.","She really felt that her brain was not enough, and it might be because she hadn’t slept in the past few days, so she had hallucinations.","Picked all the remaining Moon Lotus flowers?!","Did she make a mistake?","She was able to pick one, but it happened to coincide with the opportunity of Astute Blaze Beast giving birth and got it by sneak attack.","The remaining six Moon Lotuses were each guarded by healthy king-level spirit beasts!","Even if Li Moying and Huang Yueli were extremely talented and powerful, but if they want to defeat a king-level spirit beast, it will definitely take a lot of effort. It may not be possible to pick a Moon Lotus in two hours. Want to pick six flowers all at one go?","Oh, no, it’s five. Huang Yueli already has one on her body."]},{"number":3995,"title":"Chapter 3995 Leaving a Psychological Shadow (9)","paragraphs":["3995 Leaving a Psychological Shadow (9)","When Huang Yueli saw Xuan Qingling’s expression, she knew what she was thinking.","However, there is no need to say too much about this kind of thing.","Therefore, she just emphasized: “Young Miss Xuan, you must help Senior Brother clean up well!! Moying and I will be able to make it in time, but you probably won’t have time, because if you have to wash so many things, you have to wash them well and make sure it’s clean. It must take a lot of effort to wash without leaving any smell...”","She repeatedly emphasized “wash well and clean” before she followed Li Moying.","Along the way, she was still quite worried.","Of course, she didn’t forget to drag her husband to take a bath by the edge of a pond first.","“Over there...Wash more over there! And the back! Well...turn around again and let me see...”","Huang Yueli sat on the big rock by the pond, admiring her husband’s beautiful body coming out of the bath, while directing him to take a bath.","For a while, she disliked the smell here, and for another while, she disliked that he was not clean enough over at another spot.","However, even though she has a little smell, her husband was still so handsome!","That firm and powerful chest, tight eight-pack abs and mermaid lines...","Drool...Woohoo, luckily it’s all hers!","Li Moying cooperated with all her demands expressionlessly all the time. After washing it three or four times, his little fox was still not satisfied.","He simply threw back the bath towel and walked out of the pond.","Huang Yueli stared at him angrily, “What are you doing? I asked you to wash it again, why didn’t you listen to me? You definitely don’t love me as much as before!”","Li Moying stared at her deeply, and the corners of his mouth suddenly lifted up, and he smiled evilly.","Huang Yueli suddenly felt a sense of danger, the hairs on her back stood on end, and she quickly jumped up from the stone.","“Ahem, I thought about it. Anyway, you have washed it several times. It should...it should be almost clean, so forget it! There is a little smell, but I can still bear it, and I won’t dislike it just because of it. My husband’s...”","“Hey, don’t come here!”","However, Li Moying had already strode in front of her, grabbed the little fox who was about to run away, and dragged her into his arms.","“You think I’m stinky, huh? Then does this stink?”","“What?” Huang Yueli tilted her head in doubt.","The next moment, her chin was lifted by the man’s powerful palm, and the scorching kisses overwhelmingly pressed her down.","“No, no, no!”","Huang Yueli’s eyes widened, wanting to cry but no tears.","This man has put his tongue in, so he’s going to wash it off, it’s so close, all the smell had passed to her!","It’s all over now!","It has been several days since the two of them have had a good relationship. At this moment, in the wilderness, lonely men and widows, it looks like a good time to start a fire.","Moreover, Li Moying was naked at first, and Huang Yueli’s clothes got soaked when she rubbed against her husband.","The two of them pressed tightly together, and Huang Yueli suddenly felt that something hard was poking her.","She immediately changed her face, and pushed Li Moying away, “You, you... are in heat everywhere! Put on your clothes quickly, we have to find more Moon Lotus!”","The man with a scorching body was abruptly interrupted, and his face was extremely ugly.","“Isn’t it just picking a few small flowers? No matter how big it is, it can be solved in a quarter of an hour, and there is still nearly an hour left. If you want me to hurry up, I can try ...”"]},{"number":3996,"title":"Chapter 3996 Leaving a Psychological Shadow (10)","paragraphs":["3996 Leaving a Psychological Shadow (10)","“Li Moying!!” Huang Yueli couldn’t help but glare at him when she heard his words getting more and more out unscrupulous.","Li Moying smiled lazily, and his voice became deeper and deeper, “Little Li’er, don’t you like it? Just now you watched me take a bath, but you kept staring at me...you can’t see anything that’s under the water. Come on, aren’t you disappointed too?”","“I... How can it be? You are not allowed to talk nonsense!” Huang Yueli became angry from embarrassment.","She was clearly watching it very reservedly just now, every time she came into contact with Li Moying, she would pretend to look to the side as if nothing had happened.","Why was it still spotted by this man?","Besides, how could she look under the water? This man was impossible!","After all, even if she wanted to see it, she couldn’t see it...","“Little Li’er, we haven’t been outside yet... I heard it’s very exciting, do you want to try it?” Li Moying was still trying to tempt his little fox.","Huang Yueli glared at him, and stomped on him, “Hmph! Stop it! Dry your body quickly, and put on your clothes! Don’t think that you are a god-level genius so you won’t catch a cold! Also, my Senior Brother said it last time. Now, your primordial spirit still needs to be stabilized, we can no longer practice dual cultivation before the God Realm’s Grand Meet, you didn’t even listen properly, did you?”","He would be a ghost if he would listen to such nonsense!","It’s clear that that brat Liu Buyan deliberately punished him!","Li Moying gritted his teeth in anger, wishing he could run back and stuff Liu Buyan back into the cesspit.","However, Huang Yueli firmly believed in Liu Buyan’s words, and was determined not to make out with him. After the two stalemate for a while, Young Maste Li, who loved his wife like his life, lost as expected.","Li Moying put on his clothes, hugged his wife aggrievedly and kissed her a few more times before he reluctantly got up and went to work for her.","The scope of this secret realm was very large, and there were a lot of spirit beasts around it.","With Huang Yueli and Li Moying’s abilities, it was not impossible to kill them all, but considering that there will be people coming here for trials in the future, they only killed those who were close to Liu Buyan and Xuan Qingling. A path to the teleportation array was cleared for them.","They didn’t kill any of the seven king-level spirit beasts that guarded the Moon Lotus, they just knocked them out.","Even when picking the Moon Lotus, Huang Yueli also carefully picked off only the flowers, leaving the roots below intact.","“Alright, in this way, after another thousand years or so, these Moon Lotuses will bloom again, and the spirit beasts we killed will reproduce and grow up again. At that time, this secret realm’s trial will return to normal!”","Huang Yueli put away the six Moon Lotus flowers and clapped her hands, “Alright, let’s go!”","When Huang Yueli and Li Moying arrived at the teleportation formation, Liu Buyan and Xuan Qingling were already waiting by the side.","Liu Buyan’s complexion is still pale up to now, and the two exaggerated dark circles under his eyes were no different from that of a panda.","When others were talking to him, he was also a little stunned. Obviously, he hadn’t recovered from the heavy blow just now.","Seeing this, Huang Yueli threw a Moon Lotus flower at him from a distance.","“Alright, Senior Brother, don’t be depressed, what does it matter if you can save your little life by eating some shit? Right? Come on, come on, this Moon Lotus is for you, hold him, even if you pass this trial of this secret realm in the future, you can freely enter and exit this cave, and it can also be used for alchemy.”"]},{"number":3997,"title":"Chapter 3997 Well, That’s A Scumbag","paragraphs":["3997 Well, That’s A Scumbag","Liu Buyan still looked like he had no love in his life, even when the Moon Lotus fell on him, there was no change in his decadent expression.","If it was different from usual, he would probably jump up excitedly when he saw such a rare and good medicinal material.","“Oh, poor Senior Brother, what happened seems to have left a psychological shadow...” Huang Yueli shook her head and sighed.","Xuan Qingling felt even more guilty when she heard Huang Yueli’s words, and cared for Liu Buyan even more.","In order to show that she didn’t dislike Liu Buyan, she stayed by Liu Buyan’s side all the time, paying close attention to his every move.","Huang Yueli saw it in her eyes, and the corners of her mouth raised slightly, “However, I think that what happened to Senior Brother is a blessing in disguise. Husband, what do you think?”","“I think it’s time for us to leave. If we don’t leave, we really won’t be able to even register for the God Realm’s Grand Meet.” Li Moying didn’t even look at Xuan Qingling, but mentioned it in a very unpleasant manner.","Huang Yueli came back to her senses, and hurriedly said: “Yes yes yes, hurry up! We are in a hurry!”","As she said that, she turned her head to look at Xuan Qingling, “By the way, Young Miss Xuan, you will also go to the Floating Sea with us, right?”","“Yes, I can only trouble Young Master Li.” Xuan Qingling said helplessly: “When I separated from my clansmen, I already predicted that I might be in danger, so I told them not to wait for me. If I didn’t teleport away from the secret realm on time, let them go to Floating Sea by themselves. By now, they should have all left.”","Huang Yueli nodded.","Although the people of the Black Tortoise Clan were very nervous about Xuan Qingling when they came in, it was afterall a big event for the whole clan and many geniuses are going to participate in the God Realm’s Grand Meet. So they won’t stay here and wait for her to come out.","“Alright, then let’s go together, the four of us can still squeeze a bit. Young Miss Xuan, take care of my Senior Brother!”","The four of them arrived at the teleportation point together.","Huang Yueli and Li Moying could come in and out freely, but they were teleported out with a whoosh.","Liu Buyan and Xuan Qingling each held a Moon Lotus flower, and a golden light gradually glowed around their bodies.","Huang Yueli and Li Moying waited at the gate of the palace for more than half an hour before seeing their figures appear in the center of the teleportation array.","Moreover, both of them were flushed with excitement.","Even Liu Buyan, who had a gloomy face just now, seemed to have come back to life.","“It seems that after passing the assessment of the secret realm, you have gained a lot of benefits! I really want to congratulate you. It’s a pity that there is not enough time now. Otherwise, you can go to the cave to see if there is any suitable inheritance and strength and you can go further!”","When Huang Yueli saw their appearance, she immediately understood and couldn’t help laughing.","Xuan Qingling smiled happily and said: “No hurry, anyway, this cave has been here for hundreds of thousands of years, is it still a few days away? Just wait for us to return from the God Realm’s Grand Meet. Speaking of which, thanks to Young Master Li and Young Miss, if not for the two of you, I would be dead. How could I still turn misfortune into blessings? I will remember this kindness, and I will definitely repay you in the future!”","“Hehe, there’s no need to repay. If you can handle my Senior Brother, my husband will definitely kowtow to you!”","Huang Yueli muttered in a low voice, but Xuan Qingling couldn’t hear clearly, “What did you say?”"]},{"number":3998,"title":"Chapter 3998 Well, That’s A Scumbag (2)","paragraphs":["3998 Well, That’s A Scumbag (2)","“Nothing, nothing! Our airship is right there, let’s go!”","Huang Yueli pulled her husband back to the airship with two followers behind her.","Since they were delayed for a long time in the trial of the secret realm, time was already very tight.","Li Moying activated all the acceleration arrays on the airship, and headed towards the Floating Sea at full speed.","It would take a few more days to reach their destination. Since Huang Yueli has just advanced and her cultivation level was not yet stable, she seized this little time left and has been cultivating like mad in the cabin.","Originally, Li Moying and Huang Yueli occupied a cabin alone, and kicked Liu Buyan out to live on the deck.","However, with an additional Xuan Qingling on board, Huang Yueli was too embarrassed to let her sleep on the deck, so she had to share half of her cabin with her.","Xuan Qingling was also very quiet, and spent most of her day cultivating.","Three days later, Huang Yueli finished her training, stood up from the bed, moved her stiff limbs, and when she turned her head, she saw Xuan Qingling sitting on a chair and looking at her.","It’s quite rare for the two of them to leave the cultivation state at the same time.","Huang Yueli nodded to Xuan Qingling, “Morning Young Miss Xuan! I’ll go to the deck for some exercise, you can do it yourself.”","“I’ll go with you!”","Seeing that Huang Yueli was about to go out, Xuan Qingling suddenly jumped up and followed her out.","Huang Yueli raised her eyebrows in surprise, feeling surprised.","Why did Xuan Qingling suddenly follow her? Could it be... What happened between Xuan Qingling and Liu Buyan when she was practicing?","However, after walking to the deck, Huang Yueli realized that she was wrong.","Xuan Qingling took her around to the tail of the airship, saw that Liu Buyan and Li Moying were not nearby, and suddenly said: “Miss Li, logically speaking, you are my savior, I shouldn’t have said such things , but... well, I’ve been thinking about it for the past few days, but I still can’t get over this hurdle in my heart...I must tell you about this, don’t get excited, there are thousands of mistakes, it’s always the man’s fault...”","Huang Yueli was excited to listen to gossip about her Senior Brother.","But as she listened, she found that the topic seems to be getting further and further from what she thought.","“Wait, wait a minute! Young Miss Xuan, what exactly are you trying to say? Why can’t I understand anything?” Huang Yueli asked with a confused expression.","Xuan Qingling coughed heavily, hesitated for a moment, and then gritted her teeth and spoke.","“Young Miss Li, do you know that Young Master Li was already married when he was in the lower realm?”","“Uh... huh??” Huang Yueli’s eyes widened. She never thought that what Xuan Qingling wanted to tell her was such a thing.","On the other hand, Xuan Qingling completely misunderstood what she meant, thinking that she was shocked by the news.","She said bitterly: “It seems that you don’t know at all! This Young Master Li is really... really too much! Although he is superior in strength and saved my life, I shouldn’t say this , but what he did can only be described as a scumbag!”","“Let me tell you the truth! When Young Master Li was in the Lower Realm, he had already married a lady, and this girl was also surnamed Li. She also ascended to the God Realm a few months ago and was reunited with Young Master Li. When I was in the White Tiger Continent, I met her once and when Young Master Li was with her, it was as if he loved her so much!”"]},{"number":3999,"title":"Chapter 3999 Well, That’s A Scumbag (3)","paragraphs":["3999 Well, That’s A Scumbag (3)","“This Young Miss Li is a Spirit Armament Master, and she is very talented. Although her talent in martial arts is average, she is quite suitable for Young Master Li. At that time, the elders of the Cloudy Qilin Clan did not agree with the marriage between the two. Young Master Li even stood up to defend her! At that time, I thought that Young Master Li was a peerless and good man who was rarely seen in ten thousand years! As a result...”","The more Xuan Qingling spoke, the angrier she became, and she couldn’t help but clenched her fists.","Looking at Huang Yueli again, she always had a confused expression on her face, and she stomped her feet anxiously.","“Young Miss Li, do you think I’m lying to you? Let me tell you, it’s all true! Don’t be fooled by Young Master Li’s sweet words!”","“Although Young Master Li is very kind to you now, he was also very kind to that girl before! But now that a few months have passed, that girl doesn’t know where she is! Of course, you are so talented, Young Master Li I will definitely not treat you as seriously as I treat others. But that kind of scumbag will show his true colors one day! Young Miss Li, you are such a nice person, you must not be fooled by him!”","Xuan Qingling despised Li Moying from head to toe.","Every family of the ancient gods has a different style of doing things.","Because the main attribute of the Black Tortoise Clan is water, there are fewer fights among clan members than other clans. Moreover, most of them follow the monogamy system. Even the Patriarch only married one wife.","She has long been disgusted with the atmosphere of three wives and four concubines and three thousand harems of other protoss.","When she was in Empyrean Fox Continent, Li Moying and the lady from the lower realm were in love with each other and never left her. This made her think highly of Li Moying.","As a result, when they met again this time, Li Moying’s tall image was completely shattered.","At first, she even thought that Huang Yueli was a shameless vixen who hooked up with other people’s husbands.","Of course, after what happened in the past few days, she no longer thought that way. Instead, she felt that Huang Yueli must have been deceived by a scumbag like Li Moying!","It took Huang Yueli a lot of effort to digest what Xuan Qingling said.","Then, she couldn’t help but burst out laughing, and couldn’t even stand straight.","She always thought that Xuan Qingling knew who she was.","But now after hearing these words, and thinking about it carefully, she realized that her appearance in Empyrean Fox Continent last time was a little different from now.","In order to conceal her identity and have an affair with Li Moying, she has changed her appearance so many times that she can’t even remember how many images she has.","Xuan Qingling didn’t expect that after Huang Yueli knew that Li Moying was a “scumbag”, not only was she not as angry as she imagined, but she even laughed so happily.","She was very angry immediately, and said angrily: “Young Miss Li, what are you laughing at? What’s so funny about this? I really misjudged you! Do you think that girl is not talented enough to be worthy of Young Master Li, and you deserve him right from the beginning to the end? Let me tell you, that girl is innocent, and you can’t let her be hurt like this just because of your own interests!”","Seeing Xuan Qingling’s righteous indignation, Huang Yueli knew that she had misunderstood, so she quickly tried to hold back her laughter.","“Cough, cough...Young Miss Xuan, you...you misunderstood me...Oh, I can’t take it anymore, it’s so funny!”","She desperately wanted to suppress her urge to laugh, but it was so difficult!"]},{"number":4000,"title":"Chapter 4000 Well, That’s A Scumbag (4)","paragraphs":["4000 Well, That’s A Scumbag (4)","A man as affectionate as Li Moying can still be treated as a scumbag!","In Soaring Heavens Continent, who doesn’t know that Sect Master Li of Blue Profound Sect is the number one love saint in all ages!","If Li Moying knew that he was labeled as a “scumbag”, what kind of expression would he have?","Huang Yueli laughed for a long time, but still felt a pain in her stomach.","Xuan Qingling couldn’t bear it anymore, “Young Miss Li, I understand, we are not the same way at all! I will find a way to repay your life-saving grace, but we are destined not to be friends. Wait until we’ve reached the Floating Sea, let’s go our separate ways then!”","Xuan Qingling said her words, turned around and was about to leave.","Seeing that the situation was not going well, Huang Yueli quickly pulled her back, “Hey, wait, Young Miss Xuan, why don’t you listen to me first, why are you so impulsive?”","“Impulsive? I’m not impulsive at all! Anyway, I don’t feel it at all. How can such a serious matter of principle be so funny?” Xuan Qingling’s face was extremely ugly.","Huang Yueli grabbed her wrist, pulled her aside, and said with a smile: “Young Miss Xuan, I really should thank you. Everyone in the Cloudy Qilin Clan said that Moying dumped me and found another girl of the god-level genius to be his fiancée and everyone in the world should celebrate it! Only you, remember me as a little Spirit Armament Master.”","Xuan Qingling was stunned for a while, but didn’t understand what she meant.","“What does it mean to find a god-level genius again? Aren’t you a god... Wait, you said, you are that Spirit Armament Master?”","After Xuan Qingling realized it, she immediately cried out.","Huang Yueli smiled and nodded, “Well...Although it seems a bit unbelievable, but that’s how things are.”","“What? How is this possible? You, you...how could you be alone?” Xuan Qingling couldn’t believe that such a thing would happen, and shook her head desperately.","Huang Yueli smiled and said, “I’m just more cautious when I go out, and I just used the disguise technique. If you want to see my appearance in White Tiger Continent, I can also dress it up for you to see.”","Xuan Qingling had a frozen expression on her face, “I...Of course I know that there is such a thing as disguise! Our Black Tortoise Clan has many masters of disguise, I’m not talking about that! It’s just...but how is this possible? What? You, you... aren’t you a Spirit Armament Master? When did you become a god-level genius again? Besides, didn’t you ascend from the lower realm? What’s going on?”","Huang Yueli said: “That’s a long story... In short, I did marry Li Moying in the lower realm, and I’m indeed a Spirit Armament Master, and a god-level genius. However, for some reasons, I can’t reveal my identity...”","“Can’t reveal your identity?” Xuan Qingling frowned suspiciously, full of puzzlement, “Why? No matter what your identity is, just because of your god-level talent, the Cloudy Qilin Clan has to acknowledge you! How could it be possible to object to your marriage with Young Master Li? It’s unreasonable for you two to be so sneaky? Unless...”","Hearing this, Huang Yueli raised her eyebrows.","Xuan Qingling’s character has passed her assessment, so she is actually not afraid that the other party will betray her.","If Xuan Qingling was really so keen and guessed the truth of the matter, she would of course admit it.","Xuan Qingling looked at her, and said, “You can’t be a demon, are you?”"]}]);
